  },
  "1018066": {
    "ENU": "<u>Tutorial Options.</u>  Select this option if you want to re-take some or all of the new-player tutorial.  You will be able to exit the tutorial at any time."
  },
  "1018067": {
    "ENU": "<u>Tutorial Entry.</u>  This option will take you to the beginning of the tutorial.  From here you will be able to re-take the entire tutorial."
  },
  "1018068": {
    "ENU": "<u>Learning to Use and Equip.</u>  This option will take you to the section of the tutorial that teaches you how to manipulate items in Ultima Online"
  },
  "1018069": {
    "ENU": "<u>Learning to Fight.</u>  This option will take you to the section of the tutorial that teaches you how combat works."
  },
  "1018070": {
    "ENU": "Exit Tutorial"
  },
  "1018071": {
    "ENU": "While your young player status continues, you can re-take parts or all of the tutorial at any time by selecting the 'Help' button from your paperdoll, then chose the 'Tutorial Options' button."
  },
