    "ENU": "This is a message hastily scribbled by a passenger aboard a sinking ship.  While it is probably too late to save the passengers and crew, perhaps some treasure went down with the ship!  The message gives the ship's last known sextant co-ordinates, located in Trammel or Felucca."
  },
