  "1048049": {
    "ENU": "I don't feel comfortable sending you into this battle with the amount of reagents you currently have on your person.",
    "PTB": "Não me sinto confortável em enviá-lo para esta batalha com a quantidade de reagentes que você possui no momento."
  },
  "1048050": {
    "ENU": "Please go and gather at least 35 of each reagent before returning.",
    "PTB": "Por favor, vá e colete pelo menos 35 de cada reagente antes de retornar."
  },
  "1048051": {
    "ENU": "Remember that there are 8 different reagents: Spider's Silk, Bloodmoss, Mandrake, Ginseng, Nightshade, Garlic, Black Pearl and Sulfurous Ash.",
    "PTB": "Lembre-se de que existem 8 reagentes diferentes: Seda de Aranha, Musgo de Sangue, Mandrágora, Ginseng, Erva-da-Noite, Alho, Pérola Negra e Cinzas Sulfurosas."
  },
  "1048052": {
    "ENU": "Double click the grey order deeds to open them.  Once open, the deed lists which items and what quantity the armourer needs.  Once you forge an item, combine the item with the deed by choosing ‘Combine Item’ and targeting the item.",
    "PTB": "Clique duas vezes nos deeds de ordem cinza para abri-los. Uma vez aberto, o deed lista quais itens e em que quantidade o armeiro precisa. Depois de forjar um item, combine o item com o deed escolhendo 'Combinar Item' e mirando no item."
  },
  "1048053": {
    "ENU": "You can't stable that!",
    "PTB": "Você não pode estabular isso!"
  },
  "1048054": {
    "ENU": "Uzeraan explains the bank is on the north side of town.  Take your bank check to a banker and drop it on the banker to cash it in.",
    "PTB": "Uzeraan explica que o bank está no lado norte da cidade. Leve seu cheque bancário a um banqueiro e solte-o no banqueiro para resgatá-lo."
  },
  "1048055": {
    "ENU": "Uzeraan says: Congratulations!  I got word through magical means that you had completed your task.  The armourers were extremely happy to have received their orders fulfilled.",
    "PTB": "Uzeraan diz: Parabéns! Recebi a notícia por meios mágicos de que você completou sua tarefa. Os armeiros ficaram extremamente felizes por terem recebido seus pedidos cumpridos."
  },
  "1048056": {
    "ENU": "Through my magic, I was able to raise your blacksmithing skill a couple points.  Now, I would like to let you take some time to put your goods in the bank. The bank is right next to the mansion to the southeast.",
    "PTB": "Através da minha magia, consegui aumentar seu skill de ferraria em alguns pontos. Agora, gostaria que você aproveitasse um tempo para guardar seus bens no bank. O bank fica bem ao lado da mansão, a sudeste."
  },
  "1048057": {
    "ENU": "As you approach the bank, the names of bankers and their titles of 'banker' or 'minter' will appear.  This means you have located the building where you can access your bank account.",
    "PTB": "Ao se aproximar do bank, os nomes dos banqueiros e seus títulos de 'banqueiro' ou 'cunhador' aparecerão. Isso significa que você localizou o prédio onde pode acessar sua conta bancária."
  },
  "1048058": {
    "ENU": "How to open your bank account by saying the word 'bank' and depositing items.  Once finished, visit Uzeraan and he will give you a pack horse.",
    "PTB": "Como abrir sua conta bancária dizendo a palavra 'bank' e depositando itens. Quando terminar, visite Uzeraan e ele lhe dará um cavalo de carga."
  },
  "1048059": {
    "ENU": "Ah! Thank you noble adventurer!  I have accepted your check and cashed it for you.  The cash can be found in your bank box.",
    "PTB": "Ah! Obrigado, nobre aventureiro! Aceitei seu cheque e o resgatei para você. O dinheiro pode ser encontrado em sua caixa bancária."
  },
  "1048060": {
    "ENU": "Of course you can also open your bank box by using a Minter's or Banker's context menu.",
    "PTB": "Claro que você também pode abrir sua caixa bancária usando o menu de contexto de um Cunhador ou Banqueiro."
  },
  "1048061": {
    "ENU": "Bank boxes in Britannia are special in that the goods you place into a bank box anywhere can be accessed from your bank box anywhere else in the land.",
    "PTB": "As caixas bancárias em Britannia são especiais no sentido de que os bens que você coloca em uma caixa bancária em qualquer lugar podem ser acessados de sua caixa bancária em qualquer outro lugar do reino."
  },
  "1048062": {
    "ENU": "The safest place for any of your goods is your bank box.  No one can access your bank box except for you.",
    "PTB": "O lugar mais seguro para qualquer um dos seus bens é sua caixa bancária. Ninguém pode acessar sua caixa bancária, exceto você."
  },
  "1048063": {
    "ENU": "After you have finished depositing items in your bank, visit Uzeraan for a pack horse.",
    "PTB": "Depois de terminar de depositar itens em seu bank, visite Uzeraan para obter um cavalo de carga."
  },
  "1048064": {
    "ENU": "Uzeraan explains how to use a pack horse.  Take your pack horse to mountains south of Uzeraan's castle.",
    "PTB": "Uzeraan explica como usar um cavalo de carga. Leve seu cavalo de carga para as montanhas ao sul do castelo de Uzeraan."
  },
  "1048065": {
    "ENU": "Pack horses are used to carry large quantities of items that you normally could not fit in your backpack.  Miners use them for carrying large quantities of ore, ingots, and some tools.",
    "PTB": "Cavalos de carga são usados para transportar grandes quantidades de itens que normalmente não caberiam em sua mochila. Mineradores os usam para carregar grandes quantidades de minério, lingotes e algumas ferramentas."
  },
  "1048066": {
    "ENU": "Pack horses are loyal to their masters unless they are not fed.  Apples or pears are foods that the pack horses appreciate and will keep them loyal.",
    "PTB": "Cavalos de carga são leais a seus donos, a menos que não sejam alimentados. Maçãs ou peras são alimentos que os cavalos de carga apreciam e os manterão leais."
  },
  "1048067": {
    "ENU": "Once you have renamed your pack horse, you can have your pet obey commands.  The most common commands are 'follow me' and 'stay'.  However, your pet must be in range to hear you.",
    "PTB": "Depois de renomear seu cavalo de carga, você pode fazer seu animal de estimação obedecer a comandos. Os comandos mais comuns são 'me siga' e 'fique'. No entanto, seu animal de estimação deve estar ao alcance para ouvi-lo."
  },
  "1048068": {
    "ENU": "All pets you own can be renamed.  Click and hold the left mouse button on the pack horse and drag its health bar.",
    "PTB": "Todos os animais de estimação que você possui podem ser renomeados. Clique e segure o botão esquerdo do mouse no cavalo de carga e arraste sua barra de saúde."
  },
  "1048069": {
    "ENU": "Try walking away from your pack horse and tell it to follow you by left-clicking on the pack horse and select the command 'follow'.",
    "PTB": "Tente se afastar do seu cavalo de carga e diga a ele para seguir você clicando com o botão esquerdo no cavalo de carga e selecionando o comando 'seguir'."
  },
  "1048070": {
    "ENU": "To get your pet to stay, you would tell it to stay by left-clicking on the pack horse and select the command 'stay' from the command list.",
    "PTB": "Para fazer seu animal de estimação ficar, você deve dizer a ele para ficar clicando com o botão esquerdo no cavalo de carga e selecionando o comando 'ficar' da lista de comandos."
  },
  "1048071": {
    "ENU": "Mine 40 piles of ore from the mountains and use your pack horse to haul the piles of ore.  Visit Uzeraan at his mansion once you have the 40 piles of ore."
  },
  "1048072": {
    "ENU": "Now that you know how to handle your pack horse, use your new pack horse to haul 40 large piles of ore from the mountains.  You will need to tinker a couple more shovels to be able to mine the ore."
  },
  "1048073": {
    "ENU": "You can double-click on your pack horse to open its backpack.  While open, you can load your pack horse by dropping items into its backpack."
  },
  "1048074": {
    "ENU": "Uzeraan encourages you to practice to 70 skill in blacksmithing.  You do not have to train immediately.  When you have reached 70 skill, visit Uzeraan."
  },
  "1048075": {
    "ENU": "Uzeraan says: Congratulations!  You have mastered the basics of mining and blacksmithing.  I am giving you 500 gold for your ore.  You may keep your pack horse."
  },
  "1048076": {
    "ENU": "Now that you have accomplished so much, you should train your blacksmithing skill so you may perform a more difficult task.  It may take some time to train to 70 skill.  I have a task to ask of you when you have finished training."
  },
  "1048077": {
    "ENU": "You do not need to hurry out and train.  The world is waiting to be explored and some adventurers may need your skills.  Come visit me when you have trained to 70 skill (or higher)."
  },
  "1048078": {
    "ENU": "Now that you are an accomplished blacksmith, Uzeraan has another set of orders the armourers of Minoc would like you to fulfill.  Once completed, give them to an armourer or blacksmith in the city of Minoc."
  },
  "1048079": {
    "ENU": "Uzeraan says: Ah, I see that you are well on your way to mastering blacksmithing.  I have four order deeds that the armourers would like you to fulfill in Minoc."
  },
  "1048080": {
    "ENU": "One of the deeds is the large order, which must be combined to completed order deeds.  The three smaller deeds are for chainmail."
  },
  "1048081": {
    "ENU": "Combine the items requested in the order with the small deed.  Once the deed is completed, you can use the large order deed to combine with a smaller deed."
  },
  "1048082": {
    "ENU": "The large order deed, when it is filled with all of the small deeds, would then be dropped onto an armourer or blacksmith in Minoc.  They will make sure your goods go to those in need."
  },
  "1048083": {
    "ENU": "Visit Uzeraan once you have completed the orders for the armourers of Minoc."
  },
  "1048084": {
    "ENU": "Mastering blacksmithing"
  },
  "1048085": {
    "ENU": "Now that you have helped the blacksmiths of Minoc, you have proved your worthiness of mastering blacksmithing."
  },
  "1048086": {
    "ENU": "When you have reached 100 skill in blacksmithing, you will have the ability to mark your crafted items with your name."
  },
  "1048087": {
    "ENU": "Folk from around the world of Britannia can wear your signed armor and wield your signature weapons when you are a grandmaster blacksmith."
  },
  "1048088": {
    "ENU": "You have just slain your first 'Headless'. Now is a good time to check your health and heal yourself, if need be."
  },
  "1048089": {
    "ENU": "To check your health, single left-click + drag away from your avatar. This brings up your status bar. "
  },
  "1048090": {
    "ENU": "Double click the status bar to see detailed information. Check your hitpoints and determine if you would like to heal yourself at this point or not. "
  },
  "1048091": {
    "ENU": "To heal yourself you may use bandages (double click bandages and target yourself) or drink a heal potion (free one of your hands and double click the potion)."
  },
  "1048092": {
    "ENU": "Alternatively, if you know your way around spellbooks and such, you can cast the Heal or Greater Heal spells to recover lost hitpoints."
  },
  "1048093": {
    "ENU": "You have slain the leader of the pack."
  },
  "1048094": {
    "ENU": "Be sure to check his corpse (double click) for the red box which holds the key to the cage in which the apprentice is being held."
  },
  "1048095": {
    "ENU": "Cast the Unlock spell on the red box to open the lock."
  },
  "1048096": {
    "ENU": "Open (double click) the red box and find the key inside. Take the key (drag and drop into your pack)."
  },
  "1048097": {
    "ENU": "Use the key (double click) and target the door on the prison cage. This will unlock the door."
  },
  "1048098": {
    "ENU": "Now you can open the door (double click) to free the apprentice."
  },
  "1048099": {
    "ENU": "You have just slain your first 'Shadow Wisp'. Now is a good time to check your health and heal yourself if need be."
  },
  "1048100": {
    "ENU": "A Time For Healing"
  },
  "1048101": {
    "ENU": "The Leader Lies Dead"
  },
  "1048102": {
    "ENU": "You should have a bank check in your backpack (a yellow check).  Speak the word 'bank' to open your bank box, drag your bank check into the box, and double-click it to cash it in."
  },
  "1048103": {
    "ENU": "Visit Uzeraan after you have loaded 40 large piles of ore onto your pack horse."
  },
  "1048104": {
    "ENU": "To feed your pack horse, you would drag one apple or pear onto your pack horse.  A good practice is to feed your pack horse once an hour."
  },
  "1048105": {
    "ENU": "Click on the name on the health bar, delete its current name and type in a new name like 'Ed' or 'Trigger' (without spaces in the name)."
  },
  "1048106": {
    "ENU": "The pack horse should whinny and walk towards you (unless it is not well fed), after you target yourself with the target cursor."
  },
  "1048107": {
    "ENU": "If the list has not ever displayed, try holding the shift key and left-clicking on the pack horse.  Take your pack horse south to the mountains to receive further instructions."
  },
  "1048108": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>First, you need to open your paperdoll and your inventory. We're going to put your sword - a katana - in your hand; to do this, you click and hold your left mouse button on the katana, drag the katana onto your paperdoll, and then release the mouse button.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048109": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>First, you need to open your paperdoll and your inventory. We're going to put your smith's hammer in your hand; to do this, you click and hold your left mouse button on the hammer, drag the hammer onto your paperdoll, and then release the mouse button.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048110": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Even though you don't need to have your spellbook in your hand to cast a spell, it looks cool *grin*! To put your spellbook in your hand, you click and hold your left mouse button on the spellbook, drag the spellbook onto your paperdoll, and then release the mouse button.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048111": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>You're going to cast Magic Arrow on the mongbat. Open your spellbook by double left clicking it. On the first page, titled First Circle, you'll see the words <BASEFONT COLOR=#FFFFFF>Magic Arrow<BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048112": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>To cast this spell, you'll double click the words, <BASEFONT COLOR=#FFFFFF>Magic Arrow<BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>, in your spellbook, and then left click on the mongbat with the targeting cursor. Repeat this until you've defeated the mongbat.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048113": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Another good question: How do I know which mongbat to cast the spell on?</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048114": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Highlighting means that when you are casting a spell and are passing the cursor over a creature to target it,  that creature is given a highlight color over its entire body.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048115": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Be sure to exit War mode when you are finished with your attack. This is done by left clicking the red War button on your paperdoll. You may also use the keyboard shortcut, ALT-C, to toggle between War and Peace modes.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048116": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Great, let's begin. You'll have to attack and defeat the mongbat in order to get your gold back. The first thing we'll do is equip your spellbook... which just means you'll put it in your hand.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048117": {
    "ENU": "You sense that there are Horde Minions lurking about this area..."
  },
  "1048118": {
    "ENU": "A sense of tranquility overcomes you as you leave the Horde Minions' domain..."
  },
  "1048119": {
    "ENU": "You sense that there are Horde Minions lurking about this area..."
  },
  "1048120": {
    "ENU": "A sense of tranquility overcomes you as you leave the Horde Minions' domain..."
  },
  "1048121": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Equip your spellbook whenever you're ready.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1048122": {
    "ENU": "The chest refuses to be filled with treasure again."
  },
  "1048123": {
    "ENU": "You may not remove this treasure chest."
  },
  "1048124": {
    "ENU": "The old, rusted chest crumbles when you hit it."
  },
  "1048125": {
    "ENU": "When this treasure chest is removed, any items still inside of it will be lost."
  },
  "1048126": {
    "ENU": "Are you certain you're ready to remove this chest?"
  },
  "1048127": {
    "ENU": "Remove the Treasure Chest"
  },
  "1048128": {
    "ENU": "a Pitcher of Ale"
  },
  "1048129": {
    "ENU": "a Pitcher of Cider"
  },
  "1048130": {
    "ENU": "a Pitcher of Liquor"
  },
  "1048131": {
    "ENU": "a Pitcher of Milk"
  },
  "1048132": {
    "ENU": "a Pitcher of Wine"
  },
  "1048133": {
    "ENU": "a Pitcher of Water"
  },
  "1048134": {
    "ENU": "a Pitcher"
  },
  "1048135": {
    "ENU": "The furniture must be in your backpack to be painted."
  },
  "1048136": {
    "ENU": "You create the potion and pour it into a keg."
  },
  "1048137": {
    "ENU": "exceptional female plate"
  },
  "1048138": {
    "ENU": "This creature is sometimes used for its feathers."
  },
  "1048139": {
    "ENU": "Unfortunately you did not complete the quest in time."
  },
  "1048140": {
    "ENU": "The treasure guardians have relocated the treasure."
  },
  "1048141": {
    "ENU": "Go back to Uzeraan to receive another map."
  },
  "1048142": {
    "ENU": "I see the guardians have bested you this time, my friend."
  },
  "1048143": {
    "ENU": "Not to worry though, we're one step ahead of them!"
  },
  "1048144": {
    "ENU": "I have divined the new location of the treasure.  Here is the map."
  },
  "1048145": {
    "ENU": "Go forth and conquer the guardians friend!"
  },
  "1048146": {
    "ENU": "If you have a tool equipped, you must use that tool."
  },
  "1048147": {
    "ENU": "Your backpack can't hold anything else."
  },
  "1048148": {
    "ENU": "Visual Aid"
  },
  "1048149": {
    "ENU": "The 'Visual Aid' window shows you pictorial information regarding your current quest objective.  You can move the window around and position it anywhere you like. <BR><BR> Right clicking anywhere on the window closes it.  To re-open the Visual Aid window, you can open your quest log via the 'View Quest Log' or  'Show Visual Aid' context menu on your avatar."
  },
  "1048150": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive in the Alchemists' shop."
  },
  "1048151": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive in the music center."
  },
  "1048152": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive in the fishing wharf."
  },
  "1048153": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the weapon master's."
  },
  "1048154": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the local tailor."
  },
  "1048155": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the local wood worker."
  },
  "1048156": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the local farm."
  },
  "1048157": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the local archery range."
  },
  "1048158": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the city bank."
  },
  "1048159": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the magic shop."
  },
  "1048160": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the New Haven Inn."
  },
  "1048161": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the local map maker."
  },
  "1048162": {
    "ENU": "Lead on! Payment will be made when we arrive at the local woodsman's."
  },
  "1048163": {
    "ENU": "To find the 'Horde Minions', follow the path of glowing runes that starts just outside of this mansion.  It will lead you to them."
  },
  "1048164": {
    "ENU": "Page:"
  },
  "1048165": {
    "ENU": "Before you go, let me quickly explain 'Context Menus'."
  },
  "1048166": {
    "ENU": "You can bring up the status of your quest by bringing up your avatar's context menu (single left, or shift-left click yourself)."
  },
  "1048167": {
    "ENU": "Hands off! Property of Evocare."
  },
  "1048168": {
    "ENU": "Don't touch my clothes!       Alai"
  },
  "1048169": {
