  "1049660": {
    "ENU": "If you are leaving the mansion, you should learn about the Radar Map.<BR><BR>The Radar Map (or Overhead View) can be opened by pressing 'ALT-R' on your keyboard. It shows your immediate surroundings from a bird's eye view.<BR><BR>Pressing ALT-R twice, will enlarge the Radar Map a little.  Use the Radar Map often as you travel throughout the world to familiarize yourself with your surroundings."
