    "ENU": "Instead of using the teleporter, use your <a href=\"?ForceTopic108\">Sacred Journey</a> Paladin ability.<BR><BR>There is a <a href=\"?ForceTopic94\">marked</a> recall rune on the table <a href=\"?ForceTopic13\">North</a> of where Uzeraan is standing. The rune will take you to your quest destination."
