  "1061602": {
    "ENU": "Ægis"
  },
  "1061603": {
    "ENU": "You hear a metallic click, and the ancient stone block rises up into the ceiling."
  },
  "1061604": {
    "ENU": "You open the secret door."
  },
  "1061605": {
    "ENU": "You already have a familiar."
  },
  "1061606": {
    "ENU": "That familiar requires ~1_NECROMANCY~ Necromancy and ~2_SPIRIT~ Spirit Speak."
  },
  "1061607": {
    "ENU": "You are already bonded in a Blood Oath."
  },
  "1061608": {
    "ENU": "That player is already bonded in a Blood Oath."
  },
  "1061609": {
    "ENU": "That creature is already bonded in a Blood Oath."
  },
  "1061610": {
    "ENU": "You've just slain a creature.  Now is a good time to learn how to heal yourself as a Necromancer.<BR><BR>As a follower of the dark path, you are able to recover lost hitpoints by communing with the spirit world via the skill <a href=\"?ForceTopic133\">Spirit Speak</a>.  Learn more about it now, <a href=\"?ForceTopic73\">in the codex of Wisdom</a>."
  },
  "1061611": {
    "ENU": "You cannot cleanse that!"
  },
  "1061612": {
    "ENU": "Focus"
  },
  "1061613": {
    "ENU": "focus"
  },
  "1061614": {
    "ENU": "Chivalry"
  },
  "1061615": {
    "ENU": "chivalry"
  },
  "1061616": {
    "ENU": "Hanse's Hostel"
  },
  "1061617": {
    "ENU": "Eat at Joes"
  },
  "1061618": {
    "ENU": "Lantern of Souls"
  },
  "1061619": {
    "ENU": "a golden skull"
  },
  "1061620": {
    "ENU": "Your Blood Oath has been broken."
  },
  "1061621": {
    "ENU": "You cannot perform this action on an invulnerable target."
  },
  "1061622": {
    "ENU": "You cannot steal the sigil while in that form."
  },
  "1061623": {
    "ENU": "Layn's Liquor"
  },
  "1061624": {
    "ENU": "You do not have enough funds in your bank to cover the difference between your old house and your new one."
  },
  "1061625": {
    "ENU": "That item has no security settings to modify."
  },
  "1061626": {
    "ENU": "Anyone"
  },
  "1061627": {
    "ENU": "You can't do that while polymorphing."
  },
  "1061628": {
    "ENU": "You can't do that while polymorphed."
  },
  "1061629": {
    "ENU": "You can't do that while wearing savage kin paint."
  },
  "1061630": {
    "ENU": "You can't do that while incognito."
  },
  "1061631": {
    "ENU": "You can't do that while disguised."
  },
  "1061632": {
    "ENU": "You can't do that while carrying the sigil."
  },
  "1061633": {
    "ENU": "You cannot polymorph while in that form."
  },
  "1061634": {
    "ENU": "You cannot disguise yourself while in that form."
  },
  "1061635": {
    "ENU": "&lt"
  },
  "1061636": {
    "ENU": ">"
  },
  "1061637": {
    "ENU": "You are not allowed to access this."
  },
  "1061638": {
    "ENU": "A House Sign"
  },
  "1061639": {
    "ENU": "Name: ~1_NAME~"
  },
  "1061640": {
    "ENU": "Owner: ~1_OWNER~"
  },
  "1061641": {
    "ENU": "This House is Open to the Public"
  },
  "1061642": {
    "ENU": "This is a Private Home"
  },
  "1061643": {
    "ENU": "Wild"
  },
  "1061644": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Um... er... greetings. I... um... had some gold that I was supposed to give you... gold courtesy of Mardoth, who's a necromancer you'll meet later.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1061645": {
    "ENU": "Resistances"
  },
  "1061646": {
    "ENU": "Physical"
  },
  "1061647": {
    "ENU": "Fire"
  },
  "1061648": {
    "ENU": "Cold"
  },
  "1061649": {
    "ENU": "Poison"
  },
  "1061650": {
    "ENU": "Energy"
  },
  "1061651": {
    "ENU": "The essence of garlic burns you!"
  },
  "1061652": {
    "ENU": "The garlic in the potion would surely kill you."
  },
  "1061653": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>First, you need to open your paperdoll and your inventory. We're going to put your Broadsword into your hand; to do this, you click and hold your left mouse button on the Broadsword, drag the sword onto your paperdoll, and then release the mouse button.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1061654": {
    "ENU": "You cannot heal that which is not alive."
  },
  "1061655": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>You're going to cast \"Pain Spike\" on the mongbat. Open your spellbook by double left clicking it. On the second page, you'll see the words <BASEFONT COLOR=#FFFFFF>Pain Spike<BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1061656": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>To cast this spell, you'll double click the words, <BASEFONT COLOR=#FFFFFF>Pain Spike<BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>, in your spellbook, and then left click on the mongbat with the targeting cursor. Repeat this until you've defeated the mongbat.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1061657": {
    "ENU": "You study the item in an attempt to learn more of its craftsmanship and use."
  },
  "1061658": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Skip this Quest and go to Umbra</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1061659": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>To leave this area, take the stairs in the corner to the central chamber. Then ascend up the stairs in the middle of that chamber. This will take you to the city of Umbra where you'll meet Mardoth. He'll be waiting to speak with you.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1061660": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Oh, and... I beg of you... please don't tell Mardoth I lost your gold. Please!!</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1061661": {
    "ENU": "The brown fox did a lot of running and jumping."
  },
  "1061662": {
    "ENU": "Animate Dead"
  },
  "1061663": {
    "ENU": "The Animate Dead spell allows the Necromancer to animate the corpses of dead creatures, creating mindless, wandering undead.<BR><BR>The type of undead created from this spell is dependent on both the Necromancer's skill in Spirit Speak and Necromancy, as well as the type of creature and its fame when it was alive."
  },
  "1061664": {
    "ENU": "Summon Familiar"
  },
  "1061665": {
    "ENU": "This spell summons an evil familiar to the caster's side.<BR><BR>The caster may only have 1 familiar at a time, and they count towards a player's Follower limit. When a caster has summoned a particular type of familiar, the caster gains some special abilities:<BR><BR>- Horde Minion<BR>- Shadow Wisp<BR>- Dark Wolf<BR>- Death Adder<BR>- Vampire Bat<BR><BR>"
  },
  "1061666": {
    "ENU": "Book of Chivalry"
  },
  "1061667": {
    "ENU": "The Book of Chivalry, used by Paladins, is akin to the mage's spellbook.  Within the Book of Chivalry are icons used to activate the Paladin's special abilities.  In addition, the Paladin can also inspect the requirements and effects of each ability within the Book of Chivalry.<BR><BR>Books of Chivalry can be <a href = \"?ForceTopic33\">purchased</a from \"Keepers of Chivalry\" in the Paladin city of Luna.<BR><BR>Any new character starting with points in Chivalry skill, will find a Book of Chivalry in their pack upon entering the world."
  },
  "1061668": {
    "ENU": "Sacred Journey"
  },
  "1061669": {
    "ENU": "The Paladin ability Sacred Journey mimics the effect of the mage spell of <a href = \"?ForceTopic95\">Recall</a> almost exactly, in that it can transport the Paladin to any location to which he or she possesses a <a href = \"?ForceTopic94\">marked</a> rune.<BR><BR>  Successful use of this ability consumes Tithing points as well as mana.  The chance to succeed is based on Chivalry skill."
  },
  "1061670": {
    "ENU": "Close Wounds"
  },
  "1061671": {
    "ENU": "<I>Close Wounds<I> is the basic healing spell for a Paladin.  The Paladin uses the ability and then targets the creature he wishes to Heal.  The amount of Hit Points healed depends on the paladin’s <a href = \"?ForceTopic45\">Karma</a> & Chivalry."
  },
  "1061672": {
    "ENU": "If you release your familiar, everything in its backpack will be destroyed!  Are you sure you want to release your familiar?"
  },
  "1061673": {
    "ENU": "You have too many followers to summon a familiar."
  },
  "1061674": {
    "ENU": "The Necromancer"
  },
  "1061675": {
    "ENU": "Necromancers are those who have dedicated their lives to bring death, decay and destruction to Britannia by drawing on the powers of death itself.<BR><BR>Those who wield the power of death have at their disposal an impressive array of spells that aims to bring a gruesome and horrific end to anything that comes between the Necromancer and complete power.<BR><BR>In addition, Necromancers also make excellent melee warriors since any necromantic spell can be cast whilst wielding a weapon (unlike spells of conventional magery)."
  },
  "1061676": {
    "ENU": "Blood Oath"
  },
  "1061677": {
    "ENU": "Spells of Necromancy"
  },
  "1061678": {
    "ENU": "The spells of Necromancy may be cast by those who have sufficient skill in Necromancy.  All necromantic spells have a mana and <a href = \"?37\">reagent</a> cost attached to them.  Necromancy is a good compliment to the evil warrior, as all necromantic spells can be cast whilst wielding a weapon.<BR><BR><U>The Spells</U><BR><BR>-<a href = \"?116\">Animate Dead</a><BR>-<a href = \"?117\">Blood Oath</a><BR>-<a href = \"?118\">Corpse Skin</a><BR>-<a href = \"?119\">Curse Weapon</a><BR>-<a href = \"?120\">Evil Omen</a><BR>-<a href = \"?121\">Horrific Beast</a><BR>-<a href = \"?122\">Lich Form</a><BR>-<a href = \"?123\">Mind Rot</a><BR>-<a href = \"?124\">Pain Spike</a><BR>-<a href = \"?125\">Poison Strike</a><BR>-<a href = \"?126\">Strangle</a><BR>-<a href = \"?127\">Summon Familiar</a><BR>-<a href = \"?128\">Vampiric Embrace</a><BR>-<a href = \"?129\">Vengeful Spirit</a><BR>-<a href = \"?130\">Wither</a><BR>-<a href = \"?131\">Wraith Form</a><BR><BR>"
  },
  "1061679": {
    "ENU": "Spirit Speak"
  },
  "1061680": {
    "ENU": "The Spirit Speak skill is used to heal yourself by channeling spiritual energy.  Spiritual energy may be channeled from either a corpse or the person using the skill.  If a corpse is not available, then the user will channel their own energy, effectively trading mana for hit points.<BR><BR>The amount of damage healed depends on the amount of residual spirit energy that still lies within the corpse."
  },
  "1061681": {
    "ENU": "Leave House"
  },
  "1061682": {
    "ENU": "<b>Insured</b>"
  },
  "1061683": {
    "ENU": "This house doesn't have available lockdowns for another vendor or barkeep."
  },
  "1061684": {
    "ENU": "The magic of the sextant fails..."
  },
  "1061685": {
    "ENU": "Your Tithing Points have been adjusted."
  },
  "1061686": {
    "ENU": "Fences",
    "PTB": "Cercas"
  },
  "1061687": {
    "ENU": "You can breathe normally again.",
    "PTB": "Você pode respirar normalmente novamente."
  },
  "1061688": {
    "ENU": "Your skin returns to normal.",
    "PTB": "Sua pele volta ao normal."
  },
  "1061689": {
    "ENU": "Your skin turns dry and corpselike.",
    "PTB": "Sua pele fica seca e semelhante a de um cadáver."
  },
  "1061690": {
    "ENU": "Packing Crate",
    "PTB": "Caixa de Embalagem"
  },
  "1061691": {
    "ENU": "You have reached the maximum allowable number of fixtures for this house footprint.  You must remove doors or teleporters in order to place more.",
    "PTB": "Você atingiu o número máximo permitido de itens para esta área da casa. Você deve remover portas ou teleportadores para colocar mais."
  },
  "1061692": {
    "ENU": "If you are leaving the tower, you should learn about the Radar Map.<BR><BR>The Radar Map (or Overhead View) can be opened by pressing 'ALT-R' on your keyboard. It shows your immediate surroundings from a bird's eye view.<BR><BR>Pressing ALT-R twice, will enlarge the Radar Map a little. Use the Radar Map often as you travel throughout the world to familiarize yourself with your surroundings.",
    "PTB": "Se você está deixando a torre, deve aprender sobre o Mapa de Radar.<BR><BR>O Mapa de Radar (ou Vista Aérea) pode ser aberto pressionando 'ALT-R' no seu teclado. Ele mostra seus arredores imediatos de uma vista de pássaro.<BR><BR>Pressionando ALT-R duas vezes, o Mapa de Radar será um pouco ampliado. Use o Mapa de Radar frequentemente enquanto viaja pelo mundo para se familiarizar com seus arredores."
  },
  "1061693": {
    "ENU": "Ignores the Target’s Resists but deals slightly lower damage than the weapon's maximum potential.",
    "PTB": "Ignora as Resistências do Alvo, mas causa um pouco menos de dano do que o máximo potencial da arma."
  },
  "1061694": {
    "ENU": "Causes the target to bleed profusely, causing Direct Damage several times over the next few seconds. The amount of Damage dealt decreases each time.",
    "PTB": "Faz o alvo sangrar profusamente, causando Dano Direto várias vezes nos próximos segundos. A quantidade de Dano diminui a cada vez."
  },
  "1061695": {
    "ENU": "Does Direct Damage to the Target based on the difference between their current Hit Points and Mana.  The greater the difference, the more Damage they receive.",
    "PTB": "Causa Dano Direto no Alvo baseado na diferença entre seus Pontos de Vida atuais e Mana. Quanto maior a diferença, mais Dano eles recebem."
  },
  "1061696": {
    "ENU": "Does a substantial extra amount of damage directly to the Target.",
    "PTB": "Causa uma quantidade substancial de dano diretamente no Alvo."
  },
  "1061697": {
    "ENU": "Disarms Target and prevents them from rearming any weapon for a short duration.",
    "PTB": "Desarma o Alvo e impede que ele reequipe qualquer arma por um curto período."
  },
  "1061698": {
    "ENU": "Dislodges Target from their Mount and deals a moderate amount of Direct damage to them.",
    "PTB": "Derruba o Alvo de sua Montaria e causa uma quantidade moderada de Dano Direto nele."
  },
  "1061699": {
    "ENU": "The next Target the user strikes will be hit by the weapon twice.",
    "PTB": "O próximo Alvo que o usuário atingir será atingido pela arma duas vezes."
  },
  "1061700": {
    "ENU": "Attempts to apply a poisoned weapon’s poison to the Target. The higher the Poisoning skill of the user, the higher the chance the strength of the applied Poison will be increased by one.",
    "PTB": "Tenta aplicar o veneno de uma arma envenenada no Alvo. Quanto maior a habilidade de Envenenamento do usuário, maior a chance de aumentar a força do Veneno aplicado."
  },
  "1061701": {
    "ENU": "Prevents the Target from being healed by any means for a few Seconds.  This effect does not stop a Target from regenerating hit points.",
    "PTB": "Impede o Alvo de ser curado por qualquer meio por alguns Segundos. Este efeito não impede o Alvo de regenerar pontos de vida."
  },
  "1061702": {
    "ENU": "Allows archer to fire an arrow or bolt while moving. Or allows bladeweaver to throw his/her throwing weapon while moving. Normally an Archer or a Bladeweaver must be Stationary to attack a Target.",
    "PTB": "Permite que um arqueiro atire uma flecha ou virote enquanto se move. Ou permite que um esgrimista jogue sua arma de arremesso enquanto se move. Normalmente um Arqueiro ou Esgrimista deve estar parado para atacar um Alvo."
  },
  "1061703": {
    "ENU": "Paralyzes the target for a few seconds.",
    "PTB": "Paralisa o alvo por alguns segundos."
  },
  "1061704": {
    "ENU": "This attack does moderate extra Damage to the Target and immediately hides the user.  In order to attempt a Shadowstrike you must have a high amount of the Stealth skill.",
    "PTB": "Este ataque causa Dano extra moderado no Alvo e imediatamente esconde o usuário. Para tentar um Golpe de Sombra, você deve ter uma alta quantidade de habilidade de Furtividade."
  },
  "1061705": {
    "ENU": "Attacks all valid Targets within a one tile radius of the attacker.",
    "PTB": "Ataca todos os Alvos válidos dentro de um raio de um tile do atacante."
  },
  "1061706": {
    "ENU": "If you are on foot, dismounts your opponent and damages the ethereal's rider or the live mount (which must be healed before ridden again).  If you are mounted, damages and stuns the mounted opponent.<BR>Requires Bushido skill.",
    "PTB": "Se você estiver a pé, derruba o oponente de sua montaria e causa dano ao cavaleiro etéreo ou à montaria viva (que deve ser curada antes de ser montada novamente). Se você estiver montado, causa dano e atordoa o oponente montado.<BR>Requer habilidade de Bushido."
  },
  "1061707": {
    "ENU": "A quick attack to all enemies in range of your weapon that causes damage over time.<BR>Requires Bushido or Ninjitsu skill.",
    "PTB": "Um ataque rápido a todos os inimigos no alcance da sua arma que causa dano ao longo do tempo.<BR>Requer habilidade de Bushido ou Ninjitsu."
  },
  "1061710": {
    "ENU": "Does damage and paralyzes your opponent for a short time.<BR>Requires Bushido skill.",
    "PTB": "Causa dano e paralisa seu oponente por um curto período.<BR>Requer habilidade de Bushido."
  },
  "1061711": {
    "ENU": "Attack with increased damage with additional damage over time.<BR>Requires Ninjitsu skill.",
    "PTB": "Ataque com dano aumentado com dano adicional ao longo do tempo.<BR>Requer habilidade de Ninjitsu."
  },
  "1061712": {
    "ENU": "Gain a defensive advantage over your primary opponent for a short time.<BR>Requires Bushido or Ninjitsu skill.",
    "PTB": "Ganha uma vantagem defensiva sobre seu oponente principal por um curto período.<BR>Requer habilidade de Bushido ou Ninjitsu."
  },
  "1061714": {
    "ENU": "Send two arrows flying at your opponent if you're mounted.<BR>Requires Bushido or Ninjitsu skill.",
    "PTB": "Envie duas flechas voando contra seu oponente se estiver montado.<BR>Requer habilidade de Bushido ou Ninjitsu."
  },
  "1061715": {
    "ENU": "Strike your opponent with great force, partially bypassing their armor and inflicting greater damage.<BR>Requires either Bushido or Ninjitsu skill, depending on the weapon.",
    "PTB": "Atinja seu oponente com grande força, ignorando parcialmente sua armadura e causando maior dano.<BR>Requer habilidade de Bushido ou Ninjitsu, dependendo da arma."
  },
  "1061716": {
    "ENU": "The warrior becomes one with their weapon, allowing it to guide their hand.  The effects of this attack are unpredictable, but effective.",
    "PTB": "O guerreiro se torna um com sua arma, permitindo que ela guie sua mão. Os efeitos deste ataque são imprevisíveis, mas eficazes."
  },
  "1061718": {
    "ENU": "A charged arrow that arcs lightning into its target's allies.",
    "PTB": "Uma flecha carregada que lança raios nos aliados do alvo."
  },
  "1061720": {
    "ENU": "Fires a snake at the target, poisoning them in addition to normal damage with a successful hit.  The archer must be skilled in poisoning and nimble of hand to achieve success.",
    "PTB": "Dispara uma cobra no alvo, envenenando-o além do dano normal com um acerto bem-sucedido. O arqueiro deve ser habilidoso em envenenamento e ágil para alcançar o sucesso."
  },
  "1061721": {
    "ENU": "Enfuses the attacker with Nature's Fury, granting them unparalleled strength.  This dangerous channeling causes leafy vines to violently erupt from beneath the attacker's skin, dealing substantial physical and poison damage to them.",
    "PTB": "Infunde o atacante com a Fúria da Natureza, concedendo-lhe força incomparável. Este canal perigoso faz com que vinhas verdes irrompam violentamente sob a pele do atacante, causando dano físico e de veneno substancial."
  },
