  },
  "1062243": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>A Gift from the UO Team</CENTER>"
  },
  "1062244": {
    "ENU": "As our way of saying \"thank you\" for your continued patronage through the launch of <i>Ultima Online: Age of Shadows</i>, we would like to present you with a gift!<br><br>You may elect to receive your gift now, or you may wait and try again next time you log in.  Be sure to accept it soon, however, because these items are available for a limited time only!"
  },
  "1062245": {
    "ENU": "Yes!  Please give me the gift now!"
  },
  "1062246": {
    "ENU": "No.  I'm busy right now, but I'll select my gift later."
  },
  "1062247": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Choose your Item</CENTER>"
  },
  "1062248": {
    "ENU": "From the list below, please select the item you would like to receive.  If you wish to cancel and select a gift later, click \"CANCEL\" below, or simply right-click this menu.  You will be able to make your choice next time you log in."
  },
  "1062249": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Choose your Inscription</CENTER>"
  },
  "1062250": {
    "ENU": "From the list below, please select the text you would like engraved on your item.  If you wish to cancel and select a gift later, click \"CANCEL\" below, or simply right-click this menu.  You will be able to make your choice next time you log in."
  },
  "1062251": {
    "ENU": "To [your name], on behalf of your Age of Shadows team"
  },
  "1062252": {
    "ENU": "Thank you [your name], for supporting Ultima Online!"
  },
  "1062253": {
    "ENU": "To [your name], in recognition of the AoS launch"
  },
  "1062254": {
    "ENU": "To [your name], for helping to usher in the Age of Shadows"
  },
  "1062255": {
    "ENU": "[your name] was there for the Age of Shadows launch!"
  },
  "1062256": {
    "ENU": "[your name], Age of Shadows Early Settler"
  },
  "1062257": {
    "ENU": "[your name] roxxors Age of Shadows"
  },
  "1062258": {
    "ENU": "Noble Paladin [your name]"
  },
  "1062259": {
    "ENU": "Grim Necromancer [your name]"
  },
  "1062260": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Choose Additional Message</CENTER>"
  },
  "1062261": {
    "ENU": "From the list below, please select the optional additional message you would like engraved on your item.  If you wish to cancel and select a gift later, click \"CANCEL\" below, or simply right-click this menu.  You will be able to make your choice next time you log in."
  },
  "1062262": {
    "ENU": "I survived the Age of Shadows"
  },
  "1062263": {
    "ENU": "I survived the birth of Malas"
  },
  "1062264": {
    "ENU": "I helped usher in the Age of Shadows"
  },
  "1062265": {
    "ENU": "I helped bring forth the Age of Shadows"
  },
  "1062266": {
    "ENU": "I was an Early Settler in the Age of Shadows"
  },
  "1062267": {
    "ENU": "No Additional Message"
  },
  "1062268": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Choose Color</CENTER>"
  },
  "1062269": {
    "ENU": "Here you may choose either to permanently dye your item a special elemental color, or to make the item dyeable with a standard dye tub.  If you wish to cancel and select a gift later, click \"CANCEL\" below, or simply right-click this menu.  You will be able to make your choice next time you log in."
  },
  "1062270": {
    "ENU": "If you choose one of the colors below, the color will be permanent and the item cannot be dyed with any dye tub.  Choose carefully!"
  },
  "1062271": {
    "ENU": "I want to dye the item myself with a dye tub"
  },
  "1062272": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Confirm Choice</CENTER>"
  },
  "1062273": {
    "ENU": "These are the options you have selected.  Once you select \"This is what I Want\" below, the item will be created and you won't be able to exchange it for a different item.  If you wish to cancel and select a gift later, click \"CANCEL\" below, or simply right-click this menu.  You will be able to make your choice next time you log in."
  },
  "1062274": {
    "ENU": "Item Type:"
  },
  "1062275": {
    "ENU": "Engraving:"
  },
  "1062276": {
