  },
  "1062296": {
    "ENU": "You have chosen to raise a skill.  Please confirm this is what you want to do.  <b>Remember, this gift cannot increase a skill above its cap!</b>  If you wish to cancel and select a gift later, click \"CANCEL\" below, or simply right-click this menu.  You will be able to make your choice next time you log in."
  },
