  "1063294": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1063295": {
    "ENU": "Welcome to your new home, Samurai."
  },
  "1063296": {
    "ENU": "You may not use that teleporter at this time."
  },
  "1063297": {
    "ENU": "You have no shuriken in your ninja belt!"
  },
  "1063298": {
    "ENU": "You cannot throw another shuriken yet."
  },
  "1063299": {
    "ENU": "You must have a free hand to throw shuriken."
  },
  "1063300": {
    "ENU": "Ninja Belt"
  },
  "1063301": {
    "ENU": "You can only place shuriken in a ninja belt."
  },
  "1063302": {
    "ENU": "You cannot add any more shuriken."
  },
  "1063303": {
    "ENU": "Your target is too close!"
  },
  "1063304": {
    "ENU": "Your target is too far!"
  },
  "1063305": {
    "ENU": "Didn't your parents ever tell you not to run with scissors in your hand?!"
  },
  "1063306": {
    "ENU": "A whole new world."
  },
  "1063307": {
    "ENU": "The \"Samurai Empire\" expansion is required to attempt this item."
  },
  "1063308": {
    "ENU": "Guild"
  },
  "1063309": {
    "ENU": "They won’t find me here!"
  },
  "1063310": {
    "ENU": "Ah, a quiet hideout."
  },
  "1063311": {
    "ENU": "I wonder if I can find a sharpening stone around here."
  },
  "1063312": {
    "ENU": "Must have been strong ale to land me in this place."
  },
  "1063313": {
    "ENU": "Return to Ansella Gryen for your reward."
  },
  "1063314": {
    "ENU": "Terrible Hatchlings"
  },
  "1063315": {
    "ENU": "The Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings have trampled through my fields again, what a nuisance! Please help me get rid of the terrible hatchlings. If you kill 10 of them, you will be rewarded. The Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings live in The Waste - the desert close to this city.<BR><BR>Will you accept this challenge?"
  },
  "1063316": {
    "ENU": "Kill 10 Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings and return to Ansella Gryen."
  },
  "1063317": {
    "ENU": "<I>In case you change your mind later...</I><BR><BR>You may re-start this quest at any time while you are still considered (young). Simply return to Ansella Gryen and speak with her.<BR><BR>"
  },
  "1063318": {
    "ENU": "Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings killed:"
  },
  "1063319": {
    "ENU": "Continue killing Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings."
  },
  "1063320": {
    "ENU": "Great job! One less terrible hatchling in the Waste!<BR><BR> Once you've killed 10 of the Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings, return to Ansella for your reward!"
  },
  "1063321": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for helping me get rid of these vile beasts! You have been rewarded for your good deeds. If you wish to help me in the future, visit me again.<br><br>Farewell."
  },
  "1063322": {
    "ENU": "Before you can help me with the Terrible Hatchlings, you'll need to finish the quest you've already taken!"
  },
  "1063323": {
    "ENU": "The Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings live in The Waste - the desert close to this city."
  },
  "1063324": {
    "ENU": "I know you can take care of those nasty Deathwatch Beetle Hatchlings! No get to it!"
  },
  "1063325": {
    "ENU": "You have no fukiya darts!"
  },
  "1063326": {
