  },
  "1063446": {
    "ENU": "Failed to surrender from war.",
    "PTB": "Falha ao se render da guerra."
  },
  "1063447": {
    "ENU": "Failed to remove guild from alliance.",
    "PTB": "Falha ao remover guilda da aliança."
  },
  "1063448": {
    "ENU": "As you drink the potion you sense something approaching you.",
    "PTB": "Ao beber a poção, você sente algo se aproximando."
  },
  "1063449": {
    "ENU": "recovered from ~1_val~ (Paragon)",
    "PTB": "recuperado de ~1_val~ (Paragon)"
  },
  "1063450": {
    "ENU": "an ancient SOS",
    "PTB": "um SOS antigo"
  },
  "1063451": {
    "ENU": "a fabled fishing net",
    "PTB": "uma rede de pesca fabulosa"
  },
  "1063452": {
    "ENU": "a tattered, ingeniously drawn treasure map",
    "PTB": "um mapa do tesouro esfarrapado, engenhosamente desenhado"
  },
  "1063453": {
    "ENU": "an ingeniously drawn treasure map",
    "PTB": "um mapa do tesouro engenhosamente desenhado"
  },
  "1063454": {
    "ENU": "You have been removed from your guild.",
    "PTB": "Você foi removido da sua guilda."
  },
  "1063455": {
    "ENU": "Guild Members",
    "PTB": "Membros da Guilda"
  },
  "1063456": {
    "ENU": "You must upgrade to Samurai Empire in order to use that ability.",
    "PTB": "Você precisa atualizar para Samurai Empire para usar essa habilidade."
  },
  "1063457": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Um... er... greetings. I... um... had some gold to give you... gold courtesy of Daimyo Haochi, who's a samurai you'll meet later.</BASEFONT></BODY>",
    "PTB": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Hum... er... saudações. Eu... hum... tinha algumas moedas de ouro para te dar... ouro cortesia de Daimyo Haochi, um samurai que você conhecerá depois.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063458": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Skip this Quest and go to Haochi's Grounds</BASEFONT></BODY>",
    "PTB": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Pular essa Missão e ir para os Terrenos de Haochi</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063459": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Um... er... greetings. I... um... had some gold to give you... gold courtesy of Daimyo Emino, who's a ninja you'll meet later.</BASEFONT></BODY>",
    "PTB": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Hum... er... saudações. Eu... hum... tinha algumas moedas de ouro para te dar... ouro cortesia de Daimyo Emino, um ninja que você conhecerá depois.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063460": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Skip this Quest and go to Emino's Residence</BASEFONT></BODY>",
    "PTB": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Pular essa Missão e ir para a Residência de Emino</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063461": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>First, you need to open your paperdoll and your inventory. We're going to put your Tekagi into your hands; to do this, you click and hold your left mouse button on the Tekagi, drag the weapon onto your paperdoll, and then release the mouse button.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063462": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>First, you need to open your paperdoll and your inventory. We're going to put your Bokuto into your hand; to do this, you click and hold your left mouse button on the Bokuto, drag the weapon onto your paperdoll, and then release the mouse button.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063463": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>To leave this area, take the stairs in the corner to the central chamber. Then ascend up the stairs in the middle of that chamber. This will take you to Emino's Residence where you'll meet Emino. He'll be waiting to speak with you.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063464": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>To leave this area, take the stairs in the corner to the central chamber. Then ascend up the stairs in the middle of that chamber. This will take you to Haochi's Grounds where you'll meet Haochi. He'll be waiting to speak with you.</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063465": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Oh, and... I beg of you... please don't tell Emino I lost your gold. Please!!</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
  "1063466": {
    "ENU": "<BODY><BASEFONT COLOR=#DFDFC0>Oh, and... I beg of you... please don't tell Haochi I lost your gold. Please!!</BASEFONT></BODY>"
  },
