  "1071882": {
    "ENU": "* The plague beast's plague spores enter your bloodstream. You've contracted the plague! *"
  },
  "1071883": {
    "ENU": "* You've contracted the plague by coming into contact with this person's diseased flesh! *"
  },
  "1071884": {
    "ENU": "* You feel yourself resisting the effects of the plague! *"
  },
  "1071885": {
    "ENU": "a fibrous plant sac"
  },
  "1071886": {
    "ENU": "plague tree core"
  },
  "1071887": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1071888": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1071889": {
    "ENU": "This resource has already been applied towards the curing of the plague tree."
  },
  "1071890": {
    "ENU": "* You place the item inside the plague tree core. *"
  },
  "1071891": {
    "ENU": "This item would not be of any use towards curing the plague tree!"
  },
  "1071892": {
    "ENU": "This type of seed will not be of any use!"
  },
  "1071893": {
    "ENU": "This potion is not strong enough to be of any use!"
  },
  "1071894": {
    "ENU": "Choose the object you wish to place inside the plague tree core."
  },
  "1071895": {
    "ENU": "* You remove the diseased gland from the organ *"
  },
  "1071896": {
    "ENU": "This is too crude an implement for such a procedure."
  },
  "1071897": {
    "ENU": "You carefully cut into the organ."
  },
  "1071898": {
    "ENU": "You have already cut this organ open."
  },
  "1071899": {
    "ENU": "You begin cutting through the vein."
  },
  "1071900": {
    "ENU": "This vein has already been cut."
  },
  "1071901": {
    "ENU": "* As you cut the vein, a cloud of poison is expelled from the plague beast's organ, and the plague beast dissolves into a puddle of goo *"
  },
  "1071902": {
    "ENU": "* You cry out in agony as your brain begins to boil *"
  },
  "1071903": {
    "ENU": "* Your skin begins to itch as hideous boils cover your flesh *"
  },
  "1071904": {
    "ENU": "* You slice through the plague beast's amorphous tissue *"
  },
  "1071905": {
    "ENU": "* The swarm of insects bites and stings your flesh! *"
  },
  "1071906": {
    "ENU": "* You remove the plague mutation core from the plague beast, causing it to dissolve into a pile of goo *"
  },
  "1071907": {
    "ENU": "* The plague spawn burbles incoherently *"
  },
  "1071908": {
    "ENU": "* The plague spawn begins to dissolve *"
  },
  "1071909": {
    "ENU": "* ~1_VAL~ emits a hideous scream of pain! *"
  },
  "1071910": {
    "ENU": "* Your skin burns and bubbles, creating a horrible stench *"
  },
  "1071911": {
    "ENU": "* Your hair begins to fall out, and your skin feels hot to the touch *"
  },
  "1071912": {
    "ENU": "* ~1_Val~ is covered with hideous boils! *"
  },
  "1071913": {
    "ENU": "You place the organ in the fleshy receptacle near the core."
  },
  "1071914": {
    "ENU": "* You rip the organ out of the plague beast's flesh *"
  },
  "1071915": {
    "ENU": "This seems to be in an acceptable location. You decide not to move it."
  },
  "1071916": {
    "ENU": "* You patch up the wound with a bandage *"
  },
  "1071917": {
    "ENU": "* You attempt to tear open the amorphous flesh, but it resists *"
  },
  "1071918": {
    "ENU": "You can't cut through the plague beast's amorphous skin with scissors!"
  },
  "1071919": {
    "ENU": "* ~1_VAL~ slices through the plague beast's amorphous tissue *"
  },
  "1071920": {
    "ENU": "* The plague beast's amorphous flesh hardens and becomes immobilized *"
  },
  "1071921": {
    "ENU": "* The plague beast begins to bubble and dissolve! *"
  },
  "1071922": {
    "ENU": "The plague beast is still bleeding from open wounds.  You must seal any bleeding wounds before the core will open!"
  },
  "1071923": {
    "ENU": "*begins to fall apart due to lack of maintenance*"
  },
  "1071924": {
    "ENU": "* ~1_VAL~ is stung by a swarm of insects *"
  },
  "1071925": {
    "ENU": "* The open flame begins to scatter the swarm of insects! *"
  },
  "1071926": {
    "ENU": "* The swarm of insects extinguishes your flame! *"
  },
  "1071927": {
    "ENU": "* This creature remains loyal, but seems shaken *"
  },
  "1071928": {
    "ENU": "* This creature is charmed and confused, as it cannot see its master *",
    "PTB": "* Esta criatura está enfeitiçada e confusa, pois não consegue ver seu mestre *"
  },
  "1071929": {
    "ENU": "* This creature is charmed by the meer's power! *",
    "PTB": "* Esta criatura está enfeitiçada pelo poder do meer! *"
  },
  "1071930": {
    "ENU": "Creature of nature, I command thee to revolt against thy master!",
    "PTB": "Criatura da natureza, eu te ordeno a revoltar-se contra teu mestre!"
  },
  "1071931": {
    "ENU": "I call a plague of insects to sting your flesh!",
    "PTB": "Eu chamo uma praga de insetos para picar sua carne!"
  },
  "1071932": {
    "ENU": "Creatures of the forest, I call to thee!  Aid me in the fight against all that is evil!",
    "PTB": "Criaturas da floresta, eu vos chamo! Ajudai-me na luta contra todo o mal!"
  },
  "1071933": {
    "ENU": "That is not a faction guard!",
    "PTB": "Esse não é um guarda de facção!"
  },
  "1071934": {
    "ENU": "Target the guard you wish to dismiss",
    "PTB": "Selecione o guarda que deseja dispensar"
  },
  "1071935": {
    "ENU": "The item could not fit in your backpack or bank box",
    "PTB": "O item não coube em sua mochila ou banco"
  },
  "1071936": {
    "ENU": "You cannot equip that.",
    "PTB": "Você não pode equipar isso."
  },
  "1071937": {
    "ENU": "You cannot use that while your pet is fighting.",
    "PTB": "Você não pode usar isso enquanto seu animal de estimação está lutando."
  },
  "1071938": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1071939": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1071940": {
    "ENU": "You are not quite sure how to use this.",
    "PTB": "Você não tem certeza de como usar isso."
  },
  "1071941": {
    "ENU": "You failed to create the golem.",
    "PTB": "Você falhou em criar o golem."
  },
  "1071942": {
    "ENU": "You are too drained to make another golem.  You must wait approximately one day to construct another.",
    "PTB": "Você está muito exausto para fazer outro golem. Você deve esperar aproximadamente um dia para construir outro."
  },
  "1071943": {
    "ENU": "You must be a Journeyman or higher Tinker to construct a golem.",
    "PTB": "Você deve ser um Artífice Viajante ou superior para construir um golem."
  },
  "1071944": {
    "ENU": "The clockwork assembly must be in your backpack to construct a golem.",
    "PTB": "A montagem mecânica deve estar em sua mochila para construir um golem."
  },
  "1071945": {
    "ENU": "You need a power crystal to construct a golem.",
    "PTB": "Você precisa de um cristal de energia para construir um golem."
  },
  "1071946": {
    "ENU": "You need more gears to construct a golem.",
    "PTB": "Você precisa de mais engrenagens para construir um golem."
  },
  "1071947": {
    "ENU": "You need more bronze ingots to construct a golem.",
    "PTB": "Você precisa de mais lingotes de bronze para construir um golem."
  },
  "1071948": {
    "ENU": "You need more iron ingots to construct a golem.",
    "PTB": "Você precisa de mais lingotes de ferro para construir um golem."
  },
  "1071949": {
    "ENU": "You cannot buy this item right now.  Please wait one minute and try again.",
    "PTB": "Você não pode comprar este item agora. Por favor, espere um minuto e tente novamente."
  },
  "1071950": {
    "ENU": "I'm sorry, but I'm only holding ~1_VAL~ gold for you.",
    "PTB": "Desculpe, mas estou guardando apenas ~1_VAL~ de ouro para você."
  },
  "1071951": {
    "ENU": "Very well. I will hold on to the money for now then.",
    "PTB": "Muito bem. Vou guardar o dinheiro por enquanto."
  },
  "1071952": {
    "ENU": "The vendor is too far away.  You may attempt to access it via the house sign.  To do so, stand on the ground outisde the house within 5 steps of the house sign and open the context-sensitive menu on the sign.",
    "PTB": "O vendedor está muito longe. Você pode tentar acessá-lo através da placa da casa. Para isso, fique no chão fora da casa, a menos de 5 passos da placa da casa, e abra o menu sensível ao contexto na placa."
  },
  "1071953": {
    "ENU": "The vendor is too far away and cannot be temporarily moved to your location right now.",
