  },
  "1072240": {
    "ENU": "You will be teleported shortly.  Repeated usage within a 24 hour period will result in longer average wait times."
  },
  "1072241": {
    "ENU": "Contents: ~1_COUNT~/~2_MAXCOUNT~ items, ~3_WEIGHT~/~4_MAXWEIGHT~ stones"
  },
  "1072242": {
    "ENU": "Filthy Pests!"
  },
  "1072243": {
    "ENU": "A Fine Feast."
  },
  "1072244": {
    "ENU": "They're Breeding Like Rabbits"
  },
  "1072245": {
    "ENU": "Wild Boar Cull"
  },
  "1072246": {
    "ENU": "A Hero in the Making"
  },
  "1072247": {
    "ENU": "Bullfighting ... Sort Of"
  },
  "1072248": {
    "ENU": "They'll Eat Anything"
  },
  "1072249": {
    "ENU": "Thinning the Herd"
  },
  "1072250": {
    "ENU": "Forced Migration"
  },
  "1072251": {
    "ENU": "No Good, Fish Stealing ..."
  },
  "1072252": {
    "ENU": "Overpopulation"
  },
  "1072253": {
    "ENU": "They're everywhere I tell you!  They crawl in the walls, they scurry in the bushes.  Disgusting critters.  Say ... I don't suppose you're up for some sewer rat killing?  Sewer rats now, not any other kind of squeaker will do."
  },
  "1072254": {
    "ENU": "You there! Yes, you.  Listen, I've got a little problem on my hands, but a brave, bold hero like yourself should find it a snap to solve.  Bottom line -- we need some of the bulls in the area culled.  You're welcome to any meat or hides, and of course, I'll give you a nice reward."
  },
  "1072255": {
    "ENU": "Human"
  },
  "1072256": {
    "ENU": "Elf"
  },
  "1072257": {
    "ENU": "Are you new around here?  Well, nevermind that.  You look ready for adventure, I can see the gleam of glory in your eyes!  Nothing is more valiant, more noble, more praiseworthy than mongbat slaying."
  },
  "1072258": {
    "ENU": "You failed to complete an objective in time!"
  },
  "1072259": {
    "ENU": "Aaaahhhh!  They're everywhere!  Aaaaahhh!  Ahem.  Actually, friend, how do you feel about rabbits?  Well, we're being overrun by them.  We're finding fuzzy bunnies everywhere. Aaaaahhh!"
  },
  "1072260": {
    "ENU": "A pity really.  With the balance of nature awry, we have no choice but to accept the responsibility of making it all right.  It's all a part of the circle of life, after all. So, yes, the boars are running rampant. There are far too many in the region.  Will you shoulder your obligations as a higher life form?"
  },
  "1072261": {
    "ENU": "Mmm, I do love mutton!  It's slaughtering time again and my usual hirelings haven't turned up.  I've arranged for a butcher to come by and cut everything up but the basic sheep killing part I haven't gotten worked out yet.  Are you up for the task?"
  },
  "1072262": {
    "ENU": "Pork is the fruit of the land!  You can barbeque it, boil it, bake it, sautee it.  There's pork kebabs, pork creole, pork gumbo, pan fried, deep fried, stir fried.  There's apple pork, peppered pork, pork soup, pork salad, pork and potatoes, pork burger, pork sandwich, pork stew, pork chops, pork loins, shredded pork.  So, let's get some piggies butchered!"
  },
  "1072263": {
    "ENU": "Psst!  Hey ... psst!  Listen, I need some help here but it's gotta be hush hush.  I don't want THEM to know I'm onto them.  They watch me.  I've seen them, but they don't know that I know what I know.  You know?  Anyway, I need you to scare them off by killing a few of them.  That'll send a clear message that I won't suffer goats watching me! "
  },
  "1072264": {
    "ENU": "Chirp chirp ... tweet chirp.  Tra la la.  Bloody birds and their blasted noise.  I've tried everything but they just won't stop that infernal clamor.  Return me to blessed silence and I'll make it worth your while."
  },
  "1072265": {
    "ENU": "Mighty creatures they are, aye.  Fierce and strong, can't blame 'em for wanting to feed themselves an' all.  Blame or no, they're eating all the fish up, so they got to go.  Lend a hand?"
  },
  "1072266": {
    "ENU": "An arrow imbeds itself into your flesh!"
  },
  "1072267": {
    "ENU": "I just can't bear it any longer.  Sure, it's my job to thin the deer out so they don't overeat the area and starve themselves come winter time.  Sure, I know we killed off the predators that would do this naturally so now we have to make up for it.  But they're so graceful and innocent.  I just can't do it.  Will you?"
  },
  "1072268": {
    "ENU": "A small bag of trinkets."
  },
  "1072269": {
    "ENU": "Quest Giver"
  },
  "1072270": {
    "ENU": "Well, okay. But if you decide you are up for it after all, c'mon back and see me."
  },
  "1072271": {
    "ENU": "You're not quite done yet.  Get back to work!"
  },
  "1072272": {
    "ENU": "Thanks for helping me out.  Here's the reward I promised you."
  },
  "1072273": {
    "ENU": "You've completed a quest!  Don't forget to collect your reward."
  },
  "1072274": {
    "ENU": "The acrid air is poisonous!"
  },
