  },
  "1072533": {
    "ENU": "oak"
  },
  "1072534": {
    "ENU": "ash"
  },
  "1072535": {
    "ENU": "yew"
  },
  "1072536": {
    "ENU": "heartwood"
  },
  "1072537": {
    "ENU": "You must have this item in your inventory to use it.",
    "PTB": "Você deve ter este item em seu inventário para usá-lo."
  },
  "1072538": {
    "ENU": "bloodwood"
  },
  "1072539": {
    "ENU": "frostwood"
  },
  "1072540": {
    "ENU": "You chop some ordinary logs and put them into your backpack.",
    "PTB": "Você corta alguns troncos comuns e os coloca em sua mochila."
  },
  "1072541": {
    "ENU": "You chop some oak logs and put them into your backpack.",
    "PTB": "Você corta alguns troncos de carvalho e os coloca em sua mochila."
  },
  "1072542": {
    "ENU": "You chop some ash logs and put them into your backpack.",
    "PTB": "Você corta alguns troncos de freixo e os coloca em sua mochila."
  },
  "1072543": {
    "ENU": "You chop some yew logs and put them into your backpack.",
    "PTB": "Você corta alguns troncos de teixo e os coloca em sua mochila."
  },
  "1072544": {
    "ENU": "You chop some heartwood logs and put them into your backpack.",
    "PTB": "Você corta alguns troncos de madeira do coração e os coloca em sua mochila."
  },
  "1072545": {
    "ENU": "You chop some bloodwood logs and put them into your backpack.",
    "PTB": "Você corta alguns troncos de madeira de sangue e os coloca em sua mochila."
  },
  "1072546": {
    "ENU": "You chop some frostwood logs and put them into your backpack.",
    "PTB": "Você corta alguns troncos de madeira de gelo e os coloca em sua mochila."
  },
  "1072547": {
    "ENU": "You found a switch!",
    "PTB": "Você encontrou uma alavanca!"
  },
  "1072548": {
    "ENU": "You found a bark fragment!",
    "PTB": "Você encontrou um fragmento de casca!"
  },
  "1072549": {
    "ENU": "You found a parasitic plant!",
    "PTB": "Você encontrou uma planta parasitária!"
  },
  "1072550": {
    "ENU": "You found a luminescent fungi!",
    "PTB": "Você encontrou um fungo luminescente!"
  },
  "1072551": {
    "ENU": "You found a brilliant amber!",
    "PTB": "Você encontrou um âmbar brilhante!"
  },
  "1072552": {
    "ENU": "Lenley isn't seen.  Why you see me? Lenley is sneaking.  Lenley runs away.  You help Lenley to not get dead?  We go out past pig-men orcs?  Yes? Yes? You say yes?"
  },
  "1072553": {
    "ENU": "You no like Lenley? No hurt Lenley!  No see Lenley.  Go 'way."
  },
  "1072554": {
    "ENU": "Lenley not run away yet.  Go, go, Lenley not past pig-men orcs.  You go, Lenley go after you.  Go!"
  },
  "1072555": {
    "ENU": "You have successfully escorted Lenley to safety!  Don't forget to collect your reward from him."
  },
  "1072556": {
    "ENU": "Lenley so happy!  Lenley not get dead.  You have best Lenley shiny!"
  },
  "1072557": {
    "ENU": "Electricity builds up around the crystal patterns. Something is changing."
  },
  "1072558": {
    "ENU": "The crystal patterns shift dramatically!"
  },
  "1072559": {
    "ENU": "You have fallen prey to an ambush!"
  },
  "1072560": {
    "ENU": "Leader of the Pack"
  },
  "1072561": {
    "ENU": "You there!  Yes, you.  Kill Moug-Guur, the leader of the orcs in this depressing place, and I'll make it worth your while."
  },
  "1072562": {
    "ENU": "You have found a flawless diamond!"
  },
  "1072563": {
    "ENU": "You have found a heart of sosaria!"
  },
  "1072564": {
    "ENU": "You have found a fire ruby!"
  },
  "1072565": {
    "ENU": "You have found a flame gem!"
  },
  "1072566": {
    "ENU": "You have found a perfect emerald!"
  },
  "1072567": {
    "ENU": "You have found a dark sapphire!"
  },
  "1072568": {
    "ENU": "You have found a turquoise!"
  },
  "1072569": {
    "ENU": "You have found a blackrock!"
  },
  "1072570": {
    "ENU": "You have found an Ecru Citrine!"
  },
  "1072571": {
    "ENU": "Fine. It's no skin off my teeth."
  },
  "1072572": {
    "ENU": "Small words.  Kill Moug-Guur.  Go.  Now!"
  },
  "1072573": {
    "ENU": "You're better than I thought you'd be.  Not particularly bad, but not entirely inept."
  },
  "1072574": {
    "ENU": "Well now that Moug-Guur is no more -- and I can't say I'm weeping for his demise -- it's time for the ratmen to experience a similar loss of leadership.  Slay Chiikkaha.  In return, I'll satisfy your greed temporarily."
  },
  "1072575": {
    "ENU": "Alright, if you'd rather not, then run along and do whatever worthless things you do when I'm not giving you direction."
  },
  "1072576": {
    "ENU": "How difficult is this?  The rats live in the tunnels.  Go into the tunnels and find the biggest, meanest rat and execute him.  Loitering around here won't get the task done."
  },
  "1072577": {
    "ENU": "It's about time!  Could you have taken longer?"
  },
  "1072578": {
    "ENU": "Hmm, maybe you aren't entirely worthless.  I suspect a demoness of Szavetra's calibre will tear you apart ...  We might as well find out.  Kill the succubus, yada yada, and you'll be richly rewarded. "
  },
  "1072579": {
    "ENU": "Hah!  I knew you couldn't handle it."
  },
  "1072580": {
    "ENU": "TEMP: You have cast Ethereal Voyage."
  },
  "1072581": {
    "ENU": "Hahahaha!  I can see the fear in your eyes.  Pathetic.  Szavetra is waiting for you."
  },
  "1072582": {
    "ENU": "Amazing!  Simply astonishing ... you survived.  Well, I supposed I should indulge your avarice with a reward."
  },
  "1072583": {
    "ENU": "A bag of treasure."
  },
  "1072584": {
    "ENU": "A strongbox."
  },
  "1072585": {
    "ENU": "*looks around nervously*  Do you travel to The Heartwood?  I have an urgent letter that must be delivered there in the next 30 minutes -- to Ahie the Cloth Weaver.  Will you undertake this journey?  "
  },
  "1072586": {
    "ENU": "You cannot cast Ethereal Voyage while you are in combat."
  },
  "1072587": {
    "ENU": "*looks disappointed* Let me know if you change your mind."
  },
  "1072588": {
    "ENU": "You haven't lost the letter have you?  It must be delivered to Ahie directly.  Give it into no other hands."
  },
  "1072589": {
    "ENU": "The battered, old bucket is inscribed with barely legible writing that indicates it belongs to someone named \"Dallid\".  Maybe they'd pay for its return?"
  },
  "1072590": {
    "ENU": "You're right, who cares if Dallid might pay for his battered old bucket back.  This way you can carry it around with you!"
  },
  "1072591": {
    "ENU": "Whoever this \"Dallid\" might be, he's probably looking for his bucket."
  },
  "1072592": {
    "ENU": "You are very kind.  Thank you."
  },
  "1072593": {
    "ENU": "Those gargoyles need to get knocked down a peg or two, if you ask me.  They're always flying over here and lobbing things at us.  What a nuisance.  Drop a dozen of them for me, would you?"
  },
  "1072594": {
    "ENU": "Don't tell me you're a gargoyle sympathizer?  *spits*"
  },
  "1072595": {
    "ENU": "Those blasted gargoyles hang around the old tower.  That's the best place to hunt them down."
  },
  "1072596": {
    "ENU": "That showed them!"
  },
  "1072597": {
    "ENU": "You have found a white pearl!"
  },
  "1072598": {
    "ENU": "Hail!"
  },
  "1072599": {
    "ENU": "Thank thee for the cracker!"
  },
  "1072600": {
    "ENU": "Shiver me timbers!"
  },
  "1072601": {
    "ENU": "Don't make me into a feathered hat!"
  },
  "1072602": {
    "ENU": "I just flew in from ~1_CITYNAME~ and boy are my wings tired!"
  },
  "1072603": {
    "ENU": "Wind in the sails!  Wind in the sails!"
  },
  "1072604": {
    "ENU": "Arrrr, matey!"
  },
  "1072605": {
    "ENU": "Loot and plunder!  Loot and plunder!"
  },
  "1072606": {
    "ENU": "I want a cracker!"
  },
  "1072607": {
    "ENU": "I'm just a house pet!"
  },
  "1072608": {
    "ENU": "You must upgrade to the Mondain's Legacy expansion in order to enter here."
  },
  "1072609": {
    "ENU": "Ver Lor Reg"
  },
  "1072610": {
    "ENU": "Zento"
  },
  "1072611": {
    "ENU": "Lenmir Anfinmotas"
  },
  "1072612": {
    "ENU": "Target the Parrot Perch you wish to place this Parrot upon."
  },
  "1072613": {
