  },
  "1072654": {
    "ENU": "A keg of fiery liquid."
  },
  "1072655": {
    "ENU": "A keg of lifeless liquid."
  },
  "1072656": {
    "ENU": "A keg of muddled liquid."
  },
  "1072657": {
    "ENU": "*mutter* I'll have my revenge.  Oh!  You there.  Fancy some orc extermination?  I despise them all.  Bombers, brutes -- you name it, if it's orcish I want it killed."
  },
  "1072658": {
