    "ENU": "There are no source containers nearby."
  },
  "1072674": {
    "ENU": "Mangy, lice encrusted furballs!  Those filthy ratmen have been sneaking into camp again, the signs are obvious.  They've fouled the water stores again and stolen what they couldn't eat.  Are you up to cleaning up the rat warrens?  "
  },
  "1072675": {
    "ENU": "~1_QUANTITY~ pieces of ammo were transferred to the quiver due to low stock."
  },
  "1072676": {
    "ENU": "You may only transport your corpse while you are still dead."
  },
  "1072677": {
    "ENU": "You have been transported out of this room."
  },
  "1072678": {
    "ENU": "You have awakened the master of this realm. You need to hurry to defeat it in time!"
  },
  "1072679": {
    "ENU": "Your realm offering has reset. You will need to start over."
  },
  "1072680": {
    "ENU": "You have been given the key to the boss."
  },
  "1072681": {
    "ENU": "The master of this realm has been slain! You may only stay here so long."
  },
  "1072682": {
    "ENU": "This is not the proper key."
  },
  "1072683": {
    "ENU": "~1_NAME~ has already activated the Prism, please wait..."
  },
  "1072684": {
    "ENU": "I understand.  The stench in those tunnels is unbearable."
  },
  "1072685": {
    "ENU": "The ratmen have holes all over the place that lead to their warrens.  Sometimes they're loitering around on the surface too.  Either way, they're not hard to find."
  },
  "1072686": {
    "ENU": "What a miserable place we live in.  Look around you at the changes we've wrought. The trees are sprouting leaves once more and the grass is reclaiming the blood-soaked soil.  Who would have imagined we'd find ourselves here?  Our \"neighbors\" are anything but friendly and those ogres are the worst of the lot.  Maybe you'd be interested in helping our community by disposing of some of our least amiable neighbors?"
  },
  "1072687": {
    "ENU": "I quite understand your reluctance.  If you reconsider, I'll be here."
  },
  "1072688": {
    "ENU": "You can't miss those ogres, they're huge and just outside the gates here."
  },
  "1072689": {
    "ENU": "Cowards!"
  },
  "1072690": {
    "ENU": "Token of Love"
  },
  "1072691": {
    "ENU": "Bearing Gifts"
  },
  "1072692": {
    "ENU": "The Brains of the Operation"
  },
  "1072693": {
    "ENU": "The Brawn"
  },
  "1072694": {
    "ENU": "The Bigger They Are ..."
  },
  "1072695": {
    "ENU": "The unbless failed."
  },
  "1072696": {
    "ENU": "The unblessed failed.  Make sure there is room in your pack for the deed."
  },
  "1072697": {
    "ENU": "When you were exterminating those untidy vermin, you must have noticed the archers amongst them?  Those cowardly rats have been peppering us with arrows and then running away before we can retaliate.  Can I count on you to handle this for me?"
  },
  "1072698": {
    "ENU": "Argh!  I knew those ratmen were up to no good!  They have stolen the ring I was making for my beloved Ciala.  The sparkle must have caught their greedy eyes.  Find the ring please!  I beg you."
  },
  "1072699": {
    "ENU": "Please, I beg of you, reconsider!"
  },
  "1072700": {
    "ENU": "The stolen ring is easy enough to recognize.  It has an inscription on it declaring my love for Ciala.  Please find this token of love for me!"
  },
  "1072701": {
    "ENU": "Ah my friend, thank you again for your timely aid!  The ring is finally complete and I'm ready to reveal to Ciala my love for her.  Would you ... could you present her with my token?"
  },
  "1072702": {
    "ENU": "I know that this is a lot to ask.  Thank you for hearing my request."
  },
  "1072703": {
    "ENU": "arcane circle"
  },
  "1072704": {
    "ENU": "My beloved Ciala is the most wonderful, most perfect, most delightful woman.  Please bring her the token quickly!  I can't bear the wait for her joyous response."
  },
  "1072705": {
    "ENU": "You must be standing on an arcane circle, pentagram or abbatoir to use this spell."
  },
  "1072706": {
    "ENU": "A large bag of treasure."
  },
  "1072707": {
    "ENU": "*sigh*  We have so much to do to clean this area up.  Even the fine work you did on those ogres didn't have much of an impact on the community.  It's the ogre lords that direct the actions of the other ogres, let's strike at the leaders and perhaps that will thwart the miserable curs."
  },
  "1072708": {
    "ENU": "Reluctance doesn't become a hero like you.  But, as you wish."
  },
  "1072709": {
    "ENU": "Ogre Lords are pretty easy to recognize.  They're the ones ordering the other ogres about in a lordly manner.  Striking down their leadership will throw the ogres into confusion and dismay!"
  },
  "1072710": {
    "ENU": "Inconceiveable!  We've learned that the ogre leadership has recruited some heavy-duty guards to their cause.  I've never personally fought a cyclopian warrior, but I'm sure you could easily best a few and report back how much trouble they'll cause to our growing community?"
  },
  "1072711": {
    "ENU": "Oh, I see.  *sigh*  Perhaps I overestimated your abilities."
  },
  "1072712": {
    "ENU": "Make sure you fully assess all of the cyclopian tactical abilities!"
  },
  "1072713": {
    "ENU": "The ogre insurgency has taken a turn for the worse!  I've just been advised that the titans have concluded their discussions with the ogres and they've allied.  We have virtually no information about titans.  Engage them and appraise their mettle."
  },
  "1072714": {
    "ENU": "Certainly.  You've done enough to merit a breather.  When you're ready for more, report back to me."
  },
  "1072715": {
    "ENU": "Those titans don't skulk very well.  You should be able to track them easily ... their footsteps are easily the largest around."
  },
  "1072716": {
    "ENU": "Friends of the Library"
  },
  "1072717": {
    "ENU": "Bureaucratic Delay"
  },
  "1072718": {
    "ENU": "The Secret Ingredient"
  },
  "1072719": {
    "ENU": "Special Delivery"
  },
  "1072720": {
    "ENU": "Shhh!  *angry whisper*  This is a library, not some bawdy house!  If you wish to become a friend of the library you'll learn to moderate your volume.  And, of course, you'll take this application and have it notarized by Sarakki the Notary.  Until you've become an official friend of the library, I can't allow you to make donations.  It wouldn't be proper."
  },
  "1072721": {
    "ENU": "Hrmph!"
  },
  "1072722": {
    "ENU": "*glare*  Shhhh!  You need to visit the notary.  She can be found near the castle."
  },
  "1072723": {
    "ENU": "Access to the Stacks"
  },
  "1072724": {
    "ENU": "What do you have there?  Oh.  *look of dismay*  It seems everyone is interested in helping the library -- but no one warned me to stock up on sealing wax.  I'm afraid I'm out of the mixture we use to notarize offical documents.  There will be a delay ... unless you'd like to take matters into your own hands and retrieve more for me from Petrus?"
  },
  "1072725": {
    "ENU": "I do apologize for being unprepared. Perhaps when you return later I'll have more wax in stock."
  },
  "1072726": {
    "ENU": "Petrus lives in Ilshenar, past the Compassion gate and beyond the gypsy camp."
  },
  "1072727": {
    "ENU": "What's this?  Sealing wax ... Sarakki ... official documents ... Oh, I see.  Can do, can do.  You will need to get me the poison sacs of course.  They are so volatile they aren't viable after an hour or so ... yes, yes.  Right, well off you go, speckled scorpions are the only critters that have the right poison.  They live in the desert near here."
  },
  "1072728": {
    "ENU": "I see. I see.  Well good luck to you."
  },
  "1072729": {
    "ENU": "Hello, hello!  Speckled, that's what they are.  All covered with spots and speckles when you look very closely.  Speckled scorpion poison sacs will do the trick."
  },
  "1072730": {
    "ENU": "The manor lord is unavailable. Please use the teleporter on your right."
  },
  "1072731": {
    "ENU": "Your foot brushes against a wire, tripping a hidden trap!"
  },
  "1072732": {
    "ENU": "Your presence here has not gone unnoticed. Citadel protectors spring forth from the shadows!"
  },
  "1072733": {
    "ENU": "The air suddenly stirs around you. From the darkness you feel the sting of the Serpent's Fang!"
  },
  "1072734": {
    "ENU": "The floor crackles beneath your feet, alerting the protectors. The Flame of the Dragon is upon you!"
  },
  "1072735": {
    "ENU": "From the dark corners spring the Claw of the Tiger."
  },
  "1072736": {
    "ENU": "The Serpent's Fang Sect leaps from the shadows with their blades drawn!"
  },
  "1072737": {
    "ENU": "The sickening crunch under your feet alerts you of another trap filled with murderous fiends."
  },
  "1072738": {
    "ENU": "Dragon Smithing"
  },
  "1072739": {
    "ENU": "You hear a click behind the wall."
  },
  "1072740": {
    "ENU": "An arcane focus appears in your backpack."
  },
  "1072741": {
    "ENU": "Good good!  The wax is just cooling now and will be ready by the time you get it back to Sarakki.  You still want the wax, right?"
  },
  "1072742": {
    "ENU": "Friends of the Library Application."
  },
  "1072743": {
    "ENU": "Sealing Wax Order"
  },
  "1072744": {
    "ENU": "Official Sealing Wax"
  },
  "1072745": {
    "ENU": "Notarized Application."
  },
  "1072746": {
    "ENU": "Sorry, sorry.  I'll hold onto your order in case you change your mind."
  },
  "1072747": {
    "ENU": "Hello, hello.  No rush of course.  I'm sure Sarakki is patient and doesn't mind waiting for the wax."
  },
  "1072748": {
    "ENU": "There you are!  *pleased smile*  Don't you just love when a form is all filled in like that?  All of the sections are complete, everything is neat and tidy and the official seal is perfectly formed and in exactly the right spot.  It's comforting.  Here you are.  All you need to do now is return the form to Librarian Verity.  Have a nice day!"
  },
  "1072749": {
    "ENU": "Friends of the Library Membership Token."
  },
  "1072750": {
    "ENU": "Oh dear!  You've changed your mind?  *looks flustered*  I'll file your notarized application then, in case you decide at a future date to become a friend of the library."
  },
  "1072751": {
    "ENU": "The librarian can always be found in the Library.  *admiring tone*  She's got a really strong work ethic."
  },
  "1072752": {
    "ENU": "Discipline"
  },
  "1072753": {
    "ENU": "Patience"
  },
  "1072754": {
    "ENU": "Needs of the Many - Sanctuary"
  },
  "1072755": {
    "ENU": "Making a Contribution - Sanctuary"
  },
  "1072756": {
    "ENU": "Supplies for Sanctuary"
  },
  "1072757": {
    "ENU": "The Human Blight"
  },
  "1072758": {
    "ENU": "Unnatural Creations"
  },
  "1072759": {
    "ENU": "The Way of the Arcanist"
  },
  "1072760": {
    "ENU": "Supplies for The Heartwood"
  },
  "1072761": {
    "ENU": "Learning to weave spells and control the forces of nature requires sacrifice, discipline, focus, and an unwavering dedication to Sosaria herself.  We do not teach the unworthy.  They do not comprehend the lessons nor the dedication required.  If you would walk the path of the Arcanist, then you must do as I require without hesitation or question.  Your first task is to rid our home of rats ... 50 of them in the next hour."
  },
  "1072762": {
    "ENU": "Learning to weave spells and control the forces of nature requires sacrifice, discipline, focus, and an unwavering dedication to Sosaria herself.  We do not teach the unworthy.  They do not comprehend the lessons nor the dedication required.  If you would walk the path of the Arcanist, then you must do as I require without hesitation or question.  Your first task is to gather miniature mushrooms ... 20 of them from the branches of our mighty home.  I give you one hour to complete the task."
  },
  "1072763": {
    "ENU": "The way of the Arcanist involves cooperation with others and a strong committment to the community of your people.  We have run low on the cotton we use to pack wounds and our people have need.  Bring 10 bales of cotton to me."
  },
  "1072764": {
    "ENU": "We must look to the defense of our people!  Bring boards for new arrows."
  },
  "1072765": {
    "ENU": "With health and defense assured, we need look to the need of the community for food and drink.  We will feast on fish steaks, sweets, and wine.  You will supply the ingredients, the cooks will prepare the meal.  As a Arcanist relies upon others to build focus and lend their power to her workings, the community needs the effort of all to survive."
  },
  "1072766": {
    "ENU": "You have proven your desire to contribute to the community and serve the people.  Now you must demonstrate your willingness to defend Sosaria from the greatest blight that plagues her.  The human vermin that have spread as a disease, despoiling the land are the greatest blight we face.  Kill humans and return to me the proof of your actions. Bring me 30 human ears."
  },
  "1072767": {
    "ENU": "*nods* Not everyone has the temperment to undertake the way of the Arcanist."
  },
  "1072768": {
    "ENU": "You endanger your progress along the path with your unwillingness."
  },
  "1072769": {
    "ENU": "The people have need of these items.  You are proving yourself inadequate to the demands of a member of this community."
  },
  "1072770": {
    "ENU": "Do not falter now.  You have begun to show promise."
  },
  "1072771": {
    "ENU": "You must serve Sosaria with all your heart and strength.  Your unwillingness does not reflect favorably upon you."
  },
  "1072772": {
    "ENU": "Spellweaving Skill."
  },
  "1072773": {
    "ENU": "You waste my time.  The task is simple. Kill 50 rats in an hour."
  },
  "1072774": {
    "ENU": "The mushrooms I seek can be found growing here in The Heartwood. Seek them out and gather them.  You are running out of time."
  },
  "1072775": {
    "ENU": "I care not where you acquire the cotton, merely that you provide it."
  },
  "1072776": {
    "ENU": "The requirements are simple -- 250 boards."
  },
  "1072777": {
    "ENU": "Where are the items you've been tasked to supply for the feast?"
  },
  "1072778": {
    "ENU": "Why do you delay?  The human blight must be averted."
  },
  "1072779": {
    "ENU": "Every moment you procrastinate, these unnatural creatures damage Sosaria."
  },
  "1072780": {
    "ENU": "You have proven your desire to contribute to the community and serve the people.  Now you must demonstrate your willingness to defend Sosaria from the greatest blight that plagues her.  Unnatural creatures, brought to a sort of perverted life, despoil our fair world.  Destroy them -- 5 Exodus Overseers and 2 Exodus Minions."
  },
  "1072781": {
    "ENU": "Elven Heritage - Sanctuary"
  },
  "1072782": {
    "ENU": "Seasons"
  },
  "1072783": {
    "ENU": "Caretaker of the Land"
  },
  "1072784": {
    "ENU": "Wisdom of the Sphynx"
  },
  "1072785": {
    "ENU": "Defending the Herd"
  },
  "1072786": {
    "ENU": "The Balance of Nature"
  },
  "1072787": {
    "ENU": "The Joys of Life"
  },
  "1072788": {
    "ENU": "Weight: ~1_WEIGHT~ stone"
  },
  "1072789": {
    "ENU": "Weight: ~1_WEIGHT~ stones"
  },
  "1072790": {
    "ENU": "The wall becomes transparent, and you push your way through it."
  },
  "1072791": {
    "ENU": "You must upgrade to Mondain's Legacy in order to use that item."
  },
  "1072792": {
    "ENU": "Balanced"
  },
  "1072793": {
    "ENU": "Velocity ~1_val~%"
  },
  "1072794": {
    "ENU": "Your arrow hits its mark with velocity!"
  },
  "1072795": {
    "ENU": "You have been hit by an arrow with velocity!"
  },
  "1072796": {
    "ENU": "You already have an arcane focus."
  },
  "1072797": {
    "ENU": "Needs of the Many - The Heartwood"
  },
  "1072798": {
    "ENU": "Making a Contribution - The Heartwood"
  },
  "1072799": {
    "ENU": "Elven Heritage - The Heartwood"
  },
  "1072800": {
    "ENU": "Welcome Seeker.  Do you wish to embrace your elven heritage, casting aside your humanity, and accepting the responsibilities of a caretaker of our beloved Sosaria.  Then seek out Darius the Wise in Moonglow.  He will place you on the path."
  },
  "1072801": {
    "ENU": "Human.  Do you crave the chance to denounce your humanity and prove your elven ancestry.  Do you yearn to accept the responsibilities of a caretaker of our beloved Sosaria and so redeem yourself.  Then human, seek out Darius the Wise in Moonglow."
  },
  "1072802": {
    "ENU": "*rumbling growl* *sniff* ... not-smell ... seek-fight ... not-smell ... fear-stench ... *rumble* ... cold-soon-time comes ... hungry ... eat-fish ... sleep-soon-time ... *deep fang-filled yawn* ... much-fish. "
  },
  "1072803": {
    "ENU": "The boon of Maul."
  },
  "1072804": {
    "ENU": "The boon of Strongroot."
  },
  "1072805": {
    "ENU": "The boon of Enigma."
  },
  "1072806": {
    "ENU": "The boon of Bravehorn."
  },
  "1072807": {
    "ENU": "The boon of the Huntsman."
  },
  "1072808": {
    "ENU": "advanced character"
  },
  "1072809": {
    "ENU": "The boon of Arielle."
  },
  "1072810": {
    "ENU": "*yawn* ... cold-soon-time ... *growl*"
  },
  "1072811": {
    "ENU": "*sniff* *sniff* ... not-much-fish ... hungry ... *grumble*"
  },
  "1072812": {
    "ENU": "Hrrrrr.  Hurrrr.  Huuuman.  *creaking branches*  Suuun on baaark, roooooots diiig deeeeeep, wiiind caaaresses leeeaves … Hrrrrr.  Saaap of Sooosaria feeeeeeds us.  Hrrrrr.  Huuuman leeearn.  Caaaretaker of plaaants … teeend … prooove.<br>"
  },
  "1072813": {
    "ENU": "Hrrrrr.  Hrrrrr.  Huuuman."
  },
  "1072814": {
    "ENU": "Hrrrr. Hrrrr.  Roooooots neeeeeed saaap of Sooosaria.  Hrrrrr.  Roooooots tiiingle neeeaaar Yeeew.  Seeeaaarch.  Hrrrr!"
  },
  "1072815": {
    "ENU": "This Collection is too full to accept this item right now."
  },
  "1072816": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for your donation!"
  },
  "1072817": {
    "ENU": "You have earned ~1_POINTS~ reward points for this donation."
  },
  "1072818": {
    "ENU": "The Collection has been awarded ~1_POINTS~ points"
  },
  "1072819": {
    "ENU": "Current Tier: ~1_TIER~"
  },
  "1072820": {
    "ENU": "Current Points: ~1_POINTS~"
  },
  "1072821": {
    "ENU": "Points until next tier: ~1_POINTS~"
  },
  "1072822": {
    "ENU": "I greet thee human and divine my boon thou seek.  Convey hence the object of my riddle and I shall reward thee with thy desire.<br><br>Three lives have I.<br>Gentle enough to soothe the skin,<br>Light enough to caress the sky,<br>Hard enough to crack rocks<br>What am I?"
  },
  "1072823": {
    "ENU": "As thou wish, human."
  },
  "1072824": {
    "ENU": "I give thee a hint then human.  The answer to my riddle must be held carefully or it cannot be contained at all.  Bring this elusive item to me in a suitable container."
  },
  "1072825": {
    "ENU": "*snort* ... guard-mates ... guard-herd *hoof stomp* ... defend-with-hoof-and-horn ... thirsty-drink.  *proud head-toss*"
  },
  "1072826": {
    "ENU": "*snort*"
  },
  "1072827": {
    "ENU": "*impatient hoof stomp* ... thirsty herd ... water scent."
  },
  "1072828": {
    "ENU": "Your arcane focus is renewed."
  },
  "1072829": {
    "ENU": "Ho, there human.  Why do you seek out the Huntsman?  The hunter serves the land by culling both predators and prey.  The hunter maintains the essential balance of life and does not kill for sport or glory.  If you seek my favor, human, then demonstrate you are capable of the duty.  Cull the wolves nearby."
  },
  "1072830": {
    "ENU": "Then begone. I have no time to waste on you, human."
  },
  "1072831": {
    "ENU": "The timber wolves are easily tracked, human."
  },
  "1072832": {
    "ENU": "*giggle*  So serious, so grim!  *tickle*  Enjoy life!  Have fun!  Laugh!  Be merry!  *giggle*  Find three of my baubles ... *giggle* I hid them! *giggles hysterically*  Hid them!  La la la!  Bring them quickly!  They are magical and will hide themselves again if you are too slow."
  },
  "1072833": {
    "ENU": "*giggle* Too serious.  Too thinky!"
  },
  "1072834": {
    "ENU": "Magical baubles hidden, find them as you're bidden!  *giggle*"
  },
