  },
  "1073966": {
    "ENU": "I will be in your debt if you bring me grave dust"
  },
  "1073967": {
    "ENU": "You obtained what you seek, now receive your reward."
  },
  "1073968": {
    "ENU": "My thanks for your service. Now, I shall teach you of elven archery."
  },
  "1073969": {
    "ENU": "My thanks for your service. Now, I will show you something of elven carpentry."
  },
  "1073970": {
    "ENU": "Enjoy my thanks for your service. Prepare for the delights of elven cooking."
  },
  "1073971": {
    "ENU": "My thanks for your service.  Here is something for you to enjoy."
  },
  "1073972": {
    "ENU": "Enjoy my thanks for your service. Perhaps, I can now show you something of the elven arts?"
  },
  "1073973": {
    "ENU": "I appreciate your service. Now, see what elven hands can create."
  },
  "1073974": {
    "ENU": "I say truly -- that is a magnificent garment! You have more than earned a reward."
  },
  "1073975": {
    "ENU": "It is not without a certain charm, I suppose. Here, let me teach you of elven garments."
  },
  "1073976": {
    "ENU": "Truly, it is worse than I feared. Still, I appreciate your efforts on my behalf."
  },
  "1073977": {
    "ENU": "Now, I shall see what an elf can invent!"
  },
  "1073978": {
    "ENU": "Enjoy my thanks for your service."
  },
  "1073979": {
    "ENU": "It is quite the formidable creation. For bringing it to me, I shall show you elven wisdom."
  },
  "1073980": {
    "ENU": "Such a delightful sound, I think I shall never tire of it."
  },
  "1073981": {
    "ENU": "Truly, that is a big sword human. "
  },
  "1073982": {
    "ENU": "The dragon armor is most majestic and impressive my friend. Here, I will show you something of elven lore."
  },
  "1073983": {
    "ENU": "You have brought fuzzy bundles of delight human! Thank you!"
  },
  "1073984": {
    "ENU": "The human fascination with death is unsettling but I thank you for your work."
  },
  "1073985": {
    "ENU": "Greetings!"
  },
  "1073986": {
    "ENU": "Hello, hello."
  },
  "1073987": {
    "ENU": "Fine, fine.  Do you have them?"
  },
  "1073988": {
    "ENU": "Oh welcome back!  Do you have my wax?"
  },
  "1073989": {
    "ENU": "Shhh!"
  },
  "1073990": {
    "ENU": "Shhhh!"
  },
  "1073991": {
    "ENU": "As you open the gates, your surroundings mysteriously change!"
  },
  "1073992": {
    "ENU": "The Excavator's Guild Presents: The Prism of Light"
  },
  "1073993": {
    "ENU": "Line starts here. Ticket holders only please."
  },
  "1073994": {
    "ENU": "Your title will be:"
  },
  "1073995": {
    "ENU": "[No Title]"
  },
  "1073996": {
    "ENU": "ACCEPT"
  },
  "1073997": {
    "ENU": "NEXT"
  },
  "1073998": {
    "ENU": "Blessings of Sosaria to you and merry met, friend."
  },
  "1073999": {
    "ENU": "I am glad for your company and wonder if you seek the heritage of your people?  I sense within you an elven bloodline -- the purity of which was lost when our brothers and sisters were exiled here in the Rupture."
  },
  "1074000": {
    "ENU": "If it is your desire to reclaim your place amongst the people, you must demonstrate that you understand and embrace the responsibilities expected of you as an elf."
  },
  "1074001": {
    "ENU": "The most basic lessons of our Sosaria are taught by her humblest children.  Seek Maul, the great bear, who understands instictively the seasons."
  },
  "1074002": {
    "ENU": "You have begun to walk the path of reclaiming your heritage, but you have not learned all the lessons before you."
  },
  "1074003": {
    "ENU": "You yet must perform these services: "
  },
  "1074004": {
    "ENU": "You have carved a path in history, sought to understand the way from our sage companions."
  },
  "1074005": {
    "ENU": "And now you have returned full circle to the place of your origin within the arms of Mother Sosaria. There is but one thing left to do if you truly wish to embrace your elven heritage. "
  },
  "1074006": {
    "ENU": "To be born once more an elf, you must strip of all worldly possessions. Nothing of man or beast much touch your skin."
  },
  "1074007": {
    "ENU": "Then you may step forth into history."
  },
  "1074008": {
    "ENU": "You change your Reward Title to \"~1_TITLE~\"."
  },
  "1074009": {
    "ENU": "You decide to leave your title as it is."
  },
  "1074010": {
    "ENU": "You elect to hide your Reward Title."
  },
  "1074011": {
    "ENU": "Elf quest 1"
  },
  "1074012": {
    "ENU": "Elf quest 2"
  },
  "1074013": {
    "ENU": "Elf quest 3"
  },
  "1074014": {
    "ENU": "Elf quest 4"
  },
  "1074015": {
    "ENU": "Elf quest 5"
  },
  "1074016": {
    "ENU": "Elf quest 6"
  },
  "1074017": {
    "ENU": "He's too busy right now, so he ignores you."
  },
  "1074018": {
    "ENU": "Broken Shaft"
  },
