    "ENU": "Food Added: ~1_CUR~ Feed: ~2_NEED~ Improve: ~3_GROW~"
  },
  "1074254": {
    "ENU": "Water Added: ~1_CUR~ Maintain: ~2_NEED~ Improve: ~3_GROW~"
  },
  "1074255": {
    "ENU": "Please select a hue for your Reward:"
  },
  "1074256": {
    "ENU": "More Hues"
  },
  "1074257": {
    "ENU": "Accepting this item would overload you."
  },
  "1074258": {
    "ENU": "As you examine the crate, your surroundings mysteriously change!"
  },
  "1074259": {
    "ENU": "~1_NUM~ unit(s) of food have been added to the aquarium."
  },
  "1074260": {
    "ENU": "~1_NUM~ unit(s) of water have been added to the aquarium."
  },
  "1074261": {
    "ENU": "broken crystal"
  },
  "1074262": {
    "ENU": "crushed crystal pieces"
  },
  "1074263": {
    "ENU": "pieces of crystal"
  },
  "1074264": {
    "ENU": "scattered crystals"
  },
  "1074265": {
    "ENU": "jagged crystal shards"
  },
  "1074266": {
    "ENU": "shattered crystal"
  },
  "1074267": {
    "ENU": "a decorative bright ~1_COLOR~ ~2_TYPE~"
  },
  "1074268": {
    "ENU": "As you examine the column, your surroundings mysteriously change!"
  },
  "1074269": {
    "ENU": "prismatic crystal"
  },
  "1074270": {
    "ENU": "You have too many followers to summon another one."
  },
  "1074271": {
    "ENU": "A new follower could not be summoned."
  },
  "1074272": {
    "ENU": "You have no way to lower yourself safely into the enormous sinkhole."
  },
  "1074273": {
    "ENU": "You must speak with Librarian Verity before you can donate to this collection. "
  },
  "1074274": {
    "ENU": "You dance in the fairy ring, but nothing happens."
  },
  "1074275": {
    "ENU": "You are unable to push your way through the tangling roots of the mighty tree."
  },
  "1074276": {
    "ENU": "You press and push on the iron maiden, but nothing happens."
  },
  "1074277": {
    "ENU": "No admission without a ticket."
  },
  "1074278": {
    "ENU": "You realize that your eyes are playing tricks on you. That crate isn't really shimmering."
  },
  "1074279": {
    "ENU": "Mercy"
  },
  "1074280": {
    "ENU": "Reptilian Dentist"
  },
  "1074281": {
    "ENU": "pet parrot"
  },
  "1074282": {
    "ENU": "Craftsman's Satchel"
  },
  "1074283": {
    "ENU": "Fiendish Friends"
  },
  "1074284": {
    "ENU": "Friend of the Fey"
  },
  "1074285": {
    "ENU": "It is true that a skilled arcanist can summon and dominate an imp to serve at their pleasure.  To do such at thing though, you must master the miserable little fiends utterly by demonstrating your superiority.  Rough them up some -- kill a few.  That will do the trick."
  },
  "1074286": {
    "ENU": "The children of Sosaria understand the dedication and committment of an arcanist -- and will, from time to time offer their friendship.  If you would forge such a bond, first seek out a goodwill offering to present.  Pixies enjoy sweets and pretty things."
  },
  "1074287": {
    "ENU": "You're probably right.  They're not worth the effort."
  },
  "1074288": {
    "ENU": "There's always time to make new friends."
  },
  "1074289": {
    "ENU": "Surely you're not having difficulties swatting down those annoying pests?"
  },
  "1074290": {
    "ENU": "I think honey and some sparkly beads would please a pixie."
  },
  "1074291": {
    "ENU": "Hah!  You showed them!"
  },
  "1074292": {
    "ENU": "What have we here? Oh yes, gifts for a pixie."
  },
  "1074293": {
    "ENU": "Token of Friendship"
  },
  "1074294": {
    "ENU": "Alliance"
  },
  "1074295": {
    "ENU": "Cracking the Whip"
  },
  "1074296": {
    "ENU": "Iron Will"
  },
  "1074297": {
    "ENU": "I've wrapped your gift suitably to present to a pixie of discriminating taste.  Seek out Arielle and give her your offering."
  },
  "1074298": {
    "ENU": "*giggle* Mean reapers make pixies unhappy.  *light-hearted giggle*  You could fix them!"
  },
  "1074299": {
    "ENU": "Elven Leafweave"
  },
  "1074300": {
    "ENU": "Now that you've shown those mini pests your might, you should collect suitable implements to use to train your summoned pet.  I suggest a stout whip."
  },
  "1074301": {
    "ENU": "Hunter's Garb"
  },
  "1074302": {
    "ENU": "Now you just need to make the little buggers fear you -- if you can slay an arcane daemon, you'll earn their subservience."
  },
  "1074303": {
    "ENU": "Plate of Honor"
  },
  "1074304": {
    "ENU": "Assassin Armor"
  },
  "1074305": {
    "ENU": "Death's Essence"
  },
  "1074306": {
    "ENU": "Myrmidon Armor"
  },
  "1074307": {
    "ENU": "Greymist Armor"
  },
  "1074308": {
    "ENU": "Swiftflight (Marksman Set)"
  },
  "1074309": {
    "ENU": "Evocaricus (Juggernaut Set)"
  },
  "1074310": {
    "ENU": "I'll hold onto this gift in case you change your mind."
  },
  "1074311": {
    "ENU": "*giggle* Okies!"
  },
  "1074312": {
    "ENU": "Maleki's Honor (Juggernaut Set)"
  },
  "1074313": {
    "ENU": "Heh. Changed your mind, eh?"
  },
  "1074314": {
    "ENU": "If you're not up for it, so be it."
  },
  "1074315": {
    "ENU": "Arielle wanders quite a bit, so I'm not sure exactly where to find her.  I'm sure she's going to love your gift."
  },
  "1074316": {
    "ENU": "Mean reapers are all around trees!  *giggle*  You fix them up, please."
  },
  "1074317": {
    "ENU": "Well, hurry up.  If you don't get a whip how do you expect to control the little devil?"
  },
  "1074318": {
    "ENU": "You need to vanquish an arcane daemon before the imps will fear you properly."
  },
  "1074319": {
    "ENU": "*giggle*  Oooh!  For me?"
  },
  "1074320": {
    "ENU": "*giggle* Mean reapers got fixed!  Pixie friend now! *giggle* When mean thingies bother you, a brave pixie will help."
  },
  "1074321": {
    "ENU": "That's a well-made whip.  No imp will ignore the sting of that lash."
  },
  "1074322": {
    "ENU": "You've demonstrated your strength, got a means of control, and taught the imps to fear you.  You're ready now to summon them."
  },
  "1074323": {
    "ENU": "swing speed increase ~1_val~% (total)"
  },
  "1074324": {
    "ENU": "Feathernock (Marksman Set)"
  },
  "1074325": {
    "ENU": "increased weapon damage ~1_val~%"
  },
  "1074326": {
    "ENU": "partially digested torso"
  },
  "1074327": {
    "ENU": "coagulated legs"
  },
  "1074328": {
    "ENU": "gelatanous skull"
  },
  "1074329": {
    "ENU": "spleen of the putrefier"
  },
  "1074330": {
    "ENU": "slimy ointment"
  },
  "1074331": {
    "ENU": "blighted cotton"
  },
  "1074332": {
    "ENU": "gnaw's fang"
  },
  "1074333": {
    "ENU": "lissith's silk"
  },
  "1074334": {
    "ENU": "thorny briar"
  },
  "1074335": {
    "ENU": "irk's brain"
  },
  "1074336": {
    "ENU": "sabrix's eye"
  },
  "1074337": {
    "ENU": "essence of the wind"
  },
  "1074338": {
    "ENU": "Magical Rope"
  },
  "1074339": {
    "ENU": "Glimmering Machete"
  },
  "1074340": {
    "ENU": "Prism of Light Admission Ticket"
  },
  "1074341": {
    "ENU": "serpent fang key"
  },
  "1074342": {
    "ENU": "tiger claw key"
  },
  "1074343": {
    "ENU": "dragon flame key"
  },
  "1074344": {
    "ENU": "black order key"
  },
  "1074345": {
    "ENU": "dryad's blessing"
  },
  "1074346": {
    "ENU": "dryad's curse"
  },
  "1074347": {
    "ENU": "librarian's key"
  },
  "1074348": {
    "ENU": "master key"
  },
  "1074349": {
    "ENU": "Embracing Humanity"
  },
  "1074350": {
    "ENU": "Ingenuity"
  },
  "1074351": {
    "ENU": "Heave Ho!"
  },
  "1074352": {
    "ENU": "Responsibility"
  },
  "1074353": {
    "ENU": "All Season Adventurer"
  },
  "1074354": {
    "ENU": "Odds and Ends"
  },
  "1074355": {
    "ENU": "Strong Back"
  },
  "1074356": {
    "ENU": "gift for arielle"
  },
  "1074357": {
    "ENU": "Well, I don't mind saying it -- I'm flabbergasted!  Absolutely astonished.  I just heard that some elves want to convert themselves to humans through some magical process.  My cousin Nedrick does whatever needs doing.  I guess you could check it out for yourself if you're curious.  Anyway, I wonder if you'll bring my cousin, Drithen, this here treat my wife baked up for him special."
  },
  "1074358": {
    "ENU": "No reward is pending."
  },
  "1074359": {
    "ENU": "The reward would not fit in your pack."
  },
  "1074360": {
    "ENU": "You receive a reward: ~1_REWARD~"
  },
  "1074361": {
    "ENU": "The reward could not be given.  Make sure you have room in your pack."
  },
  "1074362": {
    "ENU": "A reward is available!"
  },
  "1074363": {
    "ENU": "A toy boat"
  },
  "1074364": {
    "ENU": "Waterlogged boots"
  },
  "1074365": {
    "ENU": "A new creature has hatched overnight in the tank."
  },
  "1074366": {
    "ENU": "An unfortunate accident has left a creature floating upside-down.  It is starting to smell."
  },
  "1074367": {
    "ENU": "The tank looks healthier today."
  },
  "1074368": {
    "ENU": "The tank looks worse than it did yesterday."
  },
  "1074369": {
    "ENU": "The water looks clearer today."
  },
  "1074370": {
    "ENU": "This tank can use more water."
  },
  "1074371": {
    "ENU": "Brine shrimp have hatched overnight in the tank."
  },
  "1074372": {
    "ENU": "A mutant creature has hatched overnight in the tank."
  },
  "1074373": {
    "ENU": "A sea horse has hatched overnight in the tank."
  },
  "1074374": {
    "ENU": "You attack your enemy with the force of nature!"
  },
  "1074375": {
    "ENU": "You are assaulted with great force!"
  },
  "1074376": {
    "ENU": "Your enemy shrugs off the poisonous bite."
  },
  "1074377": {
    "ENU": "You allure the humanoid to follow and protect you."
  },
  "1074378": {
    "ENU": "The humanoid becomes enraged by your charming attempt and attacks you."
  },
  "1074379": {
    "ENU": "You cannot charm that!"
  },
  "1074380": {
    "ENU": "This humanoid is already controlled by someone else."
  },
  "1074381": {
    "ENU": "You fire an arrow of pure force."
  },
  "1074382": {
    "ENU": "You are struck by a force arrow!"
  },
  "1074383": {
    "ENU": "Your shot sends forth a wave of psychic energy."
  },
  "1074384": {
    "ENU": "Your mind is attacked by psychic force!"
  },
  "1074385": {
    "ENU": "Mid Long"
  },
  "1074386": {
    "ENU": "Long Feather"
  },
  "1074387": {
    "ENU": "Short"
  },
  "1074388": {
    "ENU": "Mullet"
  },
  "1074389": {
    "ENU": "Flower"
  },
  "1074390": {
    "ENU": "Long"
  },
  "1074391": {
    "ENU": "Topknot"
  },
  "1074392": {
    "ENU": "Long Braid"
  },
  "1074393": {
    "ENU": "Buns"
  },
  "1074394": {
    "ENU": "Spiked"
  },
  "1074395": {
    "ENU": "<div align=right>Use Permanent Hair Dye</div>"
  },
  "1074396": {
    "ENU": "This special hair dye is made of a unique mixture of leaves, permanently changing one's hair color until another dye is used."
  },
  "1074397": {
    "ENU": "spellweaving"
  },
  "1074398": {
    "ENU": "Seek Strongroot, the great treefellow, whose very roots reach to the heart of the world.  Seek Enigma, whose wisdom can only be conveyed in riddles and rhymes.  Seek Bravehorn, the great hart, who exemplifies the fierce dedication of a protector of his people."
  },
  "1074399": {
    "ENU": "Seek the Huntsman, the centuar tasked with maintaining the balance.  And lastly seek Arielle, the pixie, who has perhaps the most important lesson -- not to take yourself too seriously."
  },
  "1074400": {
    "ENU": "Or do none of these things.  You must choose your own path in the world, and what use you'll make of your existence."
  },
  "1074401": {
    "ENU": "You are bald!"
  },
  "1074402": {
    "ENU": "Special Hair Dye"
  },
  "1074403": {
    "ENU": "Greetings, traveler and welcome."
  },
  "1074404": {
    "ENU": "Perhaps you have heard of the service I offer?  Perhaps you wish to avail yourself of the opportunity I lay before you."
  },
  "1074405": {
    "ENU": "Elves and humans; we lived together once in peace.  Mighty relics that attest to our friendship remain, of course.  Yet, memories faded when the Gem was shattered and the world torn asunder.  Alone in The Heartwood, our elven brothers and sisters wondered what terrible evil had befallen Sosaria."
  },
  "1074406": {
    "ENU": "Violent change marked the sundering of our ties.  We are different -- elves and humans.  And yet we are much alike.  I can give an elf the chance to walk as a human upon Sosaria.  I can undertake the transformation."
  },
  "1074407": {
    "ENU": "But you must prove yourself to me.  Humans possess a strength of character and back.  Humans are quick-witted and able to pick up a smattering of nearly any talent.  Humans are tough both mentally and physically.  And of course, humans defend their own -- sometimes with their own lives."
  },
  "1074408": {
    "ENU": "Seek Sledge the Versatile and learn about human ingenuity and creativity.  Seek Patricus and demonstrate your integrity and strength."
  },
  "1074409": {
    "ENU": "Seek out a human in need and prove your worth as a defender of humanity.  Seek Belulah in Nu'Jelm and heartily challenge the elements in a display of toughness to rival any human."
  },
  "1074410": {
    "ENU": "You have proven yourself capable and commited and so I will grant you the transformation you seek."
  },
  "1074411": {
    "ENU": "Or turn away and embrace your heritage.  It matters not to me."
  },
  "1074412": {
    "ENU": "You have made a good start but have more yet to do."
  },
  "1074413": {
    "ENU": "You must yet perform these deeds: "
  },
  "1074414": {
    "ENU": "A sea horse"
  },
  "1074415": {
    "ENU": "Brine shrimp"
  },
  "1074416": {
    "ENU": "Elven Whitewood Walls"
  },
  "1074417": {
    "ENU": "Heartwood Walls"
  },
  "1074418": {
    "ENU": "Kiawood Walls"
  },
  "1074419": {
    "ENU": "Tanglewood Walls"
  },
  "1074420": {
    "ENU": "Barkscale Roof"
  },
  "1074421": {
    "ENU": "Twisted Vine Roof"
  },
  "1074422": {
    "ENU": "A very unusual live aquarium creature"
  },
  "1074423": {
    "ENU": "A live aquarium creature of unusual color"
  },
  "1074424": {
    "ENU": "A very unusual dead aquarium creature"
  },
  "1074425": {
    "ENU": "A dead aquarium creature of unusual color"
  },
  "1074426": {
    "ENU": "~1_NUM~ event(s) to view!"
  },
  "1074427": {
    "ENU": "The aquarium is in vacation mode."
  },
  "1074428": {
    "ENU": "The aquarium will be in vacation mode for ~1_DAYS~ days"
  },
  "1074429": {
    "ENU": "Vacation mode has been cancelled."
  },
  "1074430": {
    "ENU": "Vacation days left: ~1_DAYS~"
  },
  "1074431": {
    "ENU": "An aquarium flake sphere"
  },
  "1074432": {
    "ENU": "Vacation days: ~1_DAYS~"
  },
  "1074433": {
    "ENU": "Bound to the Land"
  },
  "1074434": {
    "ENU": "Oh help! Help me!  I don't want to end up like my sisters, enslaved by the cruel Melisande.  I cannot flee, I am bound here by the evil of the harpy Saliva.  Won't you please help me and redeem my sisters at the same time?  I will grant you my blessing in return."
  },
  "1074435": {
    "ENU": "Please, I'm so frightened.  I don't want to become twisted and corrupt.  Please free me!"
  },
  "1074436": {
    "ENU": "Until my sisters have been treated with mercy and released from their twisted existence and until the vile Saliva is slain, I cannot feel safe or bestow my blessing."
  },
  "1074437": {
    "ENU": "Oh!  You've returned.  I cannot thank you enough for saving me.  I only hope Melisande doesn't return them to life once more.  Bless you, fair adventurer. Bless you.  If you wish to face Melisande in battle, place the token of my blessing in the basket.  May you be triumphant and redeem us all through your efforts."
  },
  "1074438": {
    "ENU": "Misplaced"
  },
  "1074439": {
    "ENU": "Shhh!  *nervous chuckle* Oh, sorry about that.  I forget that I'm not in the library any longer -- and instead that THING has taken over.  If that wasn't distressing enough, I've misplaced my thesis pages and they've been gathered up by the shambling dead.  Could you retrieve them for me?"
  },
  "1074440": {
    "ENU": "Disintegrating Thesis Notes"
  },
  "1074441": {
    "ENU": "*tense sigh* Of course, I understand.  If you change your mind, I'll be waiting."
  },
  "1074442": {
    "ENU": "Most of the creatures here wouldn't be interested in my thesis.  *nervous chuckle*  Master Gnosos would argue that no one is -- not even the undead.  Still, I'd wager that the more powerful undead have my pages."
  },
  "1074443": {
    "ENU": "Ah!  You've got my pages?  Oh no ... they've been damaged.  Here, take this key.  Perhaps you can find the podium and gain access to the library.  My poor books are being ravaged by that horror and you'd do well to put things right."
  },
  "1074444": {
    "ENU": "Wonders of the Natural World"
  },
  "1074445": {
    "ENU": "Step right up!  Step right up!  Lords and Ladies, this is your opportunity to view the find of a lifetime!  What magical energy caused the fascinating play of light and darkness within these subterranean passageways?  What mysterious forces are at work deep within the Prism of Light?  Admission tickets are good for a full day of adventure and excitement and well worth the price at 10,000 gold. Whadda ya say?"
  },
  "1074446": {
    "ENU": "C'mon now Lords and Ladies -- you're passing up the opportunity of a lifetime.  Is 10,000 gold too much to pay for your enlightenment?"
  },
  "1074447": {
    "ENU": "Dig into those pockets Lords and Ladies!  Just ten-thousand-shiny-gold-coins and you'll be walking in the bootsteps of the famous Lord Denthe himself!"
  },
  "1074448": {
    "ENU": "Step right up!  Thank you, enjoy the amazing caverns."
  },
  "1074449": {
    "ENU": "Dangerous Crossing"
  },
  "1074450": {
    "ENU": "Ho there!  If you wish to cross and test yourself in the Blighted Grove, you'll need a special machete.  Luckily I have one right here and it's for sale!  Only 1,000 gold each."
  },
  "1074451": {
    "ENU": "Yah, you didn't like like you could handle it.  Probably just as well."
  },
  "1074452": {
    "ENU": "What kind of adventurer are you that you can't afford to outlay some gold on good equipment.  You'll need this machete to get under those roots.  It's a good price."
  },
  "1074453": {
    "ENU": "Best of luck!  Watch out for Lady Melisande.  She's a nasty one."
  },
  "1074454": {
    "ENU": "Watch Your Step"
  },
  "1074455": {
    "ENU": "You won't be able to get into the sinkhole with any normal rope.  It's a big drop, sure, but the real problem is the acid and poison gas.  See, most ropes can't stand up to that kind of treatment, even for a short period of time.  So you'll need a special rope -- a magical rope. Like these ones I happen to have available here for a mere 5,000 gold each."
  },
  "1074456": {
    "ENU": "I sure don't want to go down there either.  You won't hear me chiding you. In fact, I commend your intellect."
  },
  "1074457": {
    "ENU": "The price isn't going to change.  It's 5,000 per rope please."
  },
  "1074458": {
    "ENU": "Be careful down there. I don't like losing customers."
  },
  "1074459": {
    "ENU": "That's okay, I'll find someone else to make the delivery."
  },
  "1074460": {
    "ENU": "If I knew where my cousin was, I'd make the delivery myself."
  },
  "1074461": {
    "ENU": "Oh, hello there.  What do you have for me?"
  },
  "1074462": {
    "ENU": "The best thing about my job is that I do a little bit of everything, every day.  It's what we're good at really.  Just picking up something and making it do something else.  Listen, I'm really low on parts.  Are you interested in fetching me some supplies?"
  },
  "1074463": {
    "ENU": "An aquarium fishing net"
  },
  "1074464": {
    "ENU": "mounted Dread Horn"
  },
  "1074465": {
    "ENU": "You can only use this on a full keg of poison."
  },
  "1074466": {
    "ENU": "Monstrous Interred Grizzle Armor"
  },
  "1074467": {
    "ENU": "Tunic of the Grizzle"
  },
  "1074468": {
    "ENU": "Greaves of the Grizzle"
  },
  "1074469": {
    "ENU": "Skull Helm of the Grizzle"
  },
  "1074470": {
    "ENU": "Vambraces of the Grizzle"
  },
  "1074471": {
    "ENU": "Gauntlets of the Grizzle"
  },
  "1074472": {
    "ENU": "That poison would not be affected."
  },
  "1074473": {
    "ENU": "You pour the noxious liquid into the keg."
  },
  "1074474": {
    "ENU": "You decided that drinking this would be a bad idea.  However, drop this into a full keg of poison would increase the deadliness."
  },
  "1074475": {
    "ENU": "Grizzled Mare Statuette"
  },
  "1074476": {
    "ENU": "Bone throne"
  },
  "1074477": {
    "ENU": "Bone couch"
  },
  "1074478": {
    "ENU": "Bone table"
  },
  "1074479": {
    "ENU": "Disturbing portrait"
  },
  "1074480": {
    "ENU": "Unsettling portrait"
  },
  "1074481": {
    "ENU": "Creepy portrait"
  },
  "1074482": {
    "ENU": "Mounted pixie"
  },
  "1074483": {
    "ENU": "Haunted mirror"
  },
  "1074484": {
    "ENU": "Bed of nails"
  },
  "1074485": {
    "ENU": "Grizzled Mare"
  },
  "1074486": {
    "ENU": "You could not hold the creature."
  },
  "1074487": {
    "ENU": "The creatures are too quick for you!"
  },
  "1074488": {
    "ENU": "You could not hold the creature."
  },
  "1074489": {
    "ENU": "A live creature jumps into the fish bowl in your pack!"
  },
  "1074490": {
    "ENU": "A live creature flops around in your pack before running out of air."
  },
  "1074491": {
    "ENU": "You can only use this net in water!"
  },
  "1074492": {
    "ENU": "You plunge the net into the water..."
  },
  "1074493": {
    "ENU": "Mark of Travesty"
  },
  "1074494": {
    "ENU": "Contains: ~1_CREATURE~"
  },
  "1074495": {
    "ENU": "The creature has been removed from the fish bowl."
  },
  "1074496": {
    "ENU": "There is no room in your pack for the creature."
  },
  "1074497": {
    "ENU": "Large Aquarium (north)"
  },
  "1074498": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1074499": {
    "ENU": "A fish bowl"
  },
  "1074500": {
    "ENU": "Tragic Remains of the Travesty"
  },
  "1074501": {
    "ENU": "Large Aquarium (east)"
  },
  "1074502": {
    "ENU": "It looks explosive."
  },
  "1074503": {
    "ENU": "Shimmering Effusion Statuette"
  },
  "1074504": {
    "ENU": "Fetid Essence Statuette"
  },
  "1074505": {
    "ENU": "Mantra Effervescence Statuette"
  },
  "1074506": {
    "ENU": "Corporeal Brume Statuette"
  },
  "1074507": {
    "ENU": "Gasping for air"
  },
  "1074508": {
    "ENU": "Okay.  Best of luck with your other endeavors."
  },
  "1074509": {
    "ENU": "Lord overseers are the best source I know for power crystals of the type I need.  Iron golems too, can have them but they're harder to find."
  },
  "1074510": {
    "ENU": "Do you have those power crystals?  I'm ready to put the finishing touches on my latest experiment."
  },
  "1074511": {
    "ENU": "You put the creature into a fish bowl."
  },
  "1074512": {
    "ENU": "You put the gasping creature into your pack."
  },
  "1074513": {
    "ENU": "You put the item into your pack."
  },
  "1074514": {
    "ENU": "You have no place to put it."
  },
  "1074515": {
    "ENU": "fish flake"
  },
  "1074516": {
    "ENU": "fish sphere - automated feeder"
  },
  "1074517": {
    "ENU": "Special Treat for Drithen"
  },
  "1074518": {
    "ENU": "Contains a Remnant of Melisande's Life Force"
  },
  "1074519": {
    "ENU": "Ho there!  There's nothing quite like a day's honest labor to make you appreciate being alive.  Hey, maybe you'd like to help out with this project?  These crates need to be delivered to Sledge.  The only thing is -- it's a bit of a rush job and if you don't make it in time, he won't take them.  Can I trust you to help out?"
  },
  "1074520": {
    "ENU": "Crate for Sledge"
  },
  "1074521": {
    "ENU": "Oh yah, if you're too busy, no problem."
  },
  "1074522": {
    "ENU": "Sledge can be found in Buc's Den.  Better hurry, he won't take those crates if you take too long with them."
  },
  "1074523": {
    "ENU": "Hey, if you have cargo for me, you can start unloading over here."
  },
  "1074524": {
    "ENU": "Oh!  I just don't know what to do.  My mother is away and my father told me not to talk to strangers ... *worried frown*  But my grandfather has sent word that he has been hurt and needs me to tend his wounds.  He has a small farm southeast of here.  Would you ... could you ... escort me there safely?"
  },
  "1074525": {
    "ENU": "I hope my grandfather will be alright."
  },
  "1074526": {
    "ENU": "Grandfather's farm is a ways west of the Shrine of Spirituality. So, we're not quite there yet.  Thank you again for keeping me safe."
  },
  "1074527": {
    "ENU": "It's all about hardship, suffering, struggle and pain.  Without challenges, you've got nothing to test yourself against -- and that's what life is all about.  Self improvement!  Honing your body and mind!  Overcoming obstacles ... You'll see what I mean if you take on my challenge."
  },
  "1074528": {
    "ENU": "My way of life isn't for everyone, that's true enough."
  },
  "1074529": {
    "ENU": "You're not making much progress in the honing-mind-and-body department, are you?"
  },
  "1074530": {
    "ENU": "Ahhhh!  Don't you feel great?  Struggle is good for the soul."
  },
  "1074531": {
    "ENU": "The first time you were born, you entered the world bare of all possessions and concerns.  So too as you transform to your new life as a human, you must remove all worldly goods from the touch of your flesh."
  },
  "1074532": {
    "ENU": "I call upon all nearby to witness your rebirth!"
  },
  "1074533": {
    "ENU": "Fragment of a Map"
  },
  "1074534": {
    "ENU": "The Ancient World"
  },
  "1074535": {
    "ENU": "The lore of my people mentions Mondain many times.  In one tale, it is revealed that he created and enslaved a race -- a sort of man bull, known as a 'minotaur'.  The tales speak of mighty warriors who charged with blood-soaked horns into the heat of battle.  But, alas, the fate of the bull-men is unknown after the rupture.  Will you seek information about their civilization?",
    "PTB": "A lenda do meu povo menciona Mondain muitas vezes. Em uma história, revela-se que ele criou e escravizou uma raça - uma espécie de homem-touro, conhecido como 'minotauro'. As histórias falam de guerreiros poderosos que carregavam com chifres ensanguentados para o calor da batalha. Mas, infelizmente, o destino dos homens-touros é desconhecido após a ruptura. Você procurará informações sobre sua civilização?"
  },
  "1074536": {
    "ENU": "Warriors of the Gemkeeper",
    "PTB": "Guerreiros do Guardião da Gema"
  },
  "1074537": {
    "ENU": "Here we honor the Gemkeeper's Apprentice and seek to aid her efforts against the humans responsible for the death of her teacher -- and the destruction of the elven way of life.  Our tales speak of a fierce race of servants of the Gemkeeper, the men-bulls whose battle-skill was renowned.  It is desireable to discover the fate of these noble creatures after the Rupture.  Will you seek information?",
    "PTB": "Aqui honramos o Aprendiz do Guardião da Gema e buscamos ajudar seus esforços contra os humanos responsáveis pela morte de seu mestre - e pela destruição do modo de vida élfico. Nossas histórias falam de uma raça feroz de servos do Guardião da Gema, os homens-touros, cuja habilidade de batalha era renomada. É desejável descobrir o destino dessas nobres criaturas após a Ruptura. Você procurará informações?"
  },
  "1074538": {
    "ENU": "I am disappointed, but I respect your decision.",
    "PTB": "Estou desapontado, mas respeito sua decisão."
  },
  "1074539": {
    "ENU": "A traveler has told me that worshippers of Mondain still exist and wander the land.  Perhaps their lore speaks of whether the bull-men survived.  I do not think they share their secrets gladly.  You may need to be 'persuasive'.",
    "PTB": "Um viajante me contou que adoradores de Mondain ainda existem e vagam pela terra. Talvez sua lore fale sobre se os homens-touros sobreviveram. Não acho que compartilhem seus segredos de bom grado. Você pode precisar ser 'persuasivo'."
  },
  "1074540": {
    "ENU": "I care not how you get the information.  Kill as many humans as you must ... but find the fate of the minotaurs.  Perhaps another of the Gemkeeper's servants has the knowledge we seek.",
    "PTB": "Não me importa como você obterá a informação. Mate quantos humanos for necessário... mas encontre o destino dos minotauros. Talvez outro servo do Guardião da Gema tenha o conhecimento que buscamos."
  },
  "1074541": {
    "ENU": "You have discovered an important clue!",
    "PTB": "Você descobriu uma pista importante!"
  },
  "1074542": {
    "ENU": "What have you found?",
    "PTB": "O que você encontrou?"
  },
  "1074543": {
    "ENU": "The Golden Horn",
    "PTB": "O Chifre Dourado"
  },
  "1074544": {
    "ENU": "Close Enough",
    "PTB": "Suficientemente Perto"
  },
  "1074545": {
    "ENU": "Ah ha!  You see here ... and over here ... The map fragment places the city of the bull-men, Labyrinth, on that piece of Sosaria that was thrown into the sky.  Hmmm, I would have you go there and find any artifacts that remain that help tell the story.  But, legend speaks of a mighty barrier to prevent invasion of the city.  Take this map to Braen and explain the problem. Perhaps he can devise a solution.",
    "PTB": "Ah ha! Veja aqui... e aqui... O fragmento do mapa coloca a cidade dos homens-touros, Labirinto, naquela parte de Sosaria que foi jogada no céu. Hmm, eu gostaria que você fosse lá e encontrasse quaisquer artefatos que ajudem a contar a história. Mas a lenda fala de uma barreira poderosa para impedir a invasão da cidade. Leve este mapa para Braen e explique o problema. Talvez ele possa elaborar uma solução."
  },
  "1074546": {
    "ENU": "Ah ha!  You see here ... and over here ... The map fragment places the city of the bull-men, Labyrinth, on that piece of Sosaria that was thrown into the sky.  Hmmm, I would have you go there and seek out these warriors to see if they might join our cause.  But, legend speaks of a mighty barrier to prevent invasion of the city.  Take this map to Canir and explain the problem. Perhaps she can devise a solution.<br>"
  },
  "1074547": {
    "ENU": "Braen is nearby, run and speak with him."
  },
  "1074548": {
    "ENU": "Canir is nearby, run and speak with her."
  },
  "1074549": {
    "ENU": "Yes?  What do you want?  I'm very busy."
  },
  "1074550": {
    "ENU": "Bullish"
  },
  "1074551": {
    "ENU": "Taking the Bull by the Horns"
  },
  "1074552": {
    "ENU": "Oh, I see. I will need some materials to infuse you with the essence of a bull-man, so you can fool their defenses.  The most similar beast to the original Baratarian bull that the minotaur were bred from is undoubtedly the mighty Gaman, native to the Lands of the Feudal Lords.  I need horns, in great quantity to undertake this magic."
  },
  "1074553": {
    "ENU": "Interesting.  I believe I have a way.  I will need some materials to infuse you with the essence of a bull-man, so you can fool their defenses.  The most similar beast to the original Baratarian bull that the minotaur were bred from is undoubtedly the mighty Gaman, native to the Lands of the Feudal Lords.  I need horns, in great quantity to undertake this magic."
  },
  "1074554": {
    "ENU": "Oh come now, don't be afraid.  The magic won't harm you."
  },
  "1074555": {
    "ENU": "I cannot grant you the ability to pass through the bull-men's defenses without the gaman horns."
  },
  "1074556": {
    "ENU": "You've returned at last!  Give me just a moment to examine what you've brought and I can perform the magic that will allow you enter the Labyrinth."
  },
  "1074557": {
    "ENU": "Gaman Horns"
  },
  "1074558": {
    "ENU": "That doesn't look very appealing."
  },
  "1074559": {
    "ENU": "It looks unappetizing, but you're hungry..."
  },
  "1074560": {
    "ENU": "recipe scroll"
  },
  "1074561": {
    "ENU": "Portal to Yew"
  },
  "1074562": {
    "ENU": "Portal to Heartwood"
  },
  "1074563": {
    "ENU": "You haven't forged a friendship with the fey and are unable to summon their aid."
  },
  "1074564": {
    "ENU": "You haven't demonstrated mastery to summon a fiend."
  },
  "1074565": {
    "ENU": "The acid river burns your skin."
  },
  "1074566": {
    "ENU": "The acid river has gotten deeper. The concentration of acid is significantly stronger."
  },
  "1074567": {
    "ENU": "The acid river is much stronger here. You realize that allowing the acid to touch your flesh will surely kill you."
  },
  "1074568": {
    "ENU": "You sink into the depths of the lake. The corrosive acid strips the flesh from your bones."
  },
  "1074569": {
    "ENU": "Slayers of innocent souls are not welcome to enter here!"
  },
  "1074570": {
    "ENU": "chilling ice from a snowstorm"
  },
  "1074571": {
    "ENU": "Captain Blackheart's Fishing Pole"
  },
  "1074572": {
    "ENU": "Crafty's Fishing Hat"
  },
  "1074573": {
    "ENU": "Mistaken Identity"
  },
  "1074574": {
    "ENU": "What do you want?  Wonderful, another whining request for a refund on tuition.  You know, experiences like that are invaluable ... and infrequent.  Having the opportunity to test yourself under such realistic situations isn't something the college offers all students.  Fine. Fine.  You'll need to submit a refund request form in triplicate before I can return your 1,000,000 gold tuition.  You'll need to get some signatures and a few other odds and ends."
  },
  "1074575": {
    "ENU": "You have activated this object!"
  },
  "1074576": {
    "ENU": "The cold energy from the pool penetrates your skin and coalesces in your bones."
  },
  "1074577": {
    "ENU": "Food Added: ~1_CUR~ Needed: ~2_NEED~ "
  },
  "1074578": {
    "ENU": "Water Added: ~1_CUR~ Needed: ~2_NEED~"
  },
  "1074579": {
    "ENU": "Yes, can I help you?"
  },
  "1074580": {
    "ENU": "Is that my bucket? I had to ditch my favorite bucket when a group of ratmen jumped me!"
  },
  "1074581": {
    "ENU": "Well hello there. Oh.  Wait a minute, you're not here to plead the case of that traitor Danoel are you?"
  },
  "1074582": {
    "ENU": "Ah!  You found my property.  Thank you for your honesty in returning it to me."
  },
  "1074583": {
    "ENU": "Isn't that interesting?  Someone was willing to pay a lot of gold to see me gone.  You've earned a reward for bringing this to me."
  },
  "1074584": {
    "ENU": "You have discovered a private letter from the sorceress Minax to her dear friend \"Travesty\" that implicates some very important people in her pay.  Will you risk drawing attention to yourself by delivering the bundle to the castle in Britain?<br>"
  },
  "1074585": {
    "ENU": "Probably a wise choice to keep a low profile."
  },
  "1074586": {
    "ENU": "It might be safest to deliver the letter to someone trustworthy that isn't too important.  Sarakki the Notary might be a good choice."
  },
  "1074587": {
    "ENU": "*smile* Greetings!  Oh ... oh my.  Oh, goodness ... *startled gasp*  Did you read ... we must report this at once."
  },
  "1074588": {
    "ENU": "Coral"
  },
  "1074589": {
    "ENU": "Britain Crown Fish"
  },
  "1074590": {
    "ENU": "Small Mouth Sucker Fin"
  },
  "1074591": {
    "ENU": "Fandancer Fish"
  },
  "1074592": {
    "ENU": "Albino Courtesan Fish"
  },
  "1074593": {
    "ENU": "Jellyfish"
  },
  "1074594": {
    "ENU": "Stripped Sosarian Swill"
  },
  "1074595": {
    "ENU": "Stripped Flake Fish"
  },
  "1074596": {
    "ENU": "Shrimp"
  },
  "1074597": {
    "ENU": "A Full Moon Fish  "
  },
  "1074598": {
    "ENU": "A shell"
  },
  "1074599": {
    "ENU": "A shell"
  },
  "1074600": {
    "ENU": "An island statue"
  },
  "1074601": {
    "ENU": "Fish bones"
  },
  "1074602": {
    "ENU": "An unusual creature has hatched overnight in the tank."
  },
  "1074603": {
    "ENU": "You rub the slimy ointment on your body, temporarily protecting yourself from the corrosive river."
  },
  "1074604": {
    "ENU": "The slimy ointment continues to protect you from the corrosive river."
  },
  "1074605": {
    "ENU": "You're not getting a refund without the proper forms and signatures."
  },
  "1074606": {
    "ENU": "If you're not willing to follow the proper process then go away."
  },
  "1074607": {
    "ENU": "Oh blast!  Not another of those forms.  I'm so sick of this endless paperwork."
  },
  "1074608": {
    "ENU": "You Scratch My Back"
  },
  "1074609": {
    "ENU": "Heh.  Heheheh.  Good one.  You're not a Bedlam student and you're definitely not eligible for a tuition refund.  Heheheh. That old witch Aernya doesn't see as well as she used to you know.  Otherwise, she would have ... hmmm, wait a minute.  I sense a certain 'opportunity' here.  I'll sign your forms in return for a little help with a project of my own.  What do you say?"
  },
  "1074610": {
    "ENU": "Tuition Reimbursement Form (in triplicate)"
  },
  "1074611": {
    "ENU": "Unicorn Ribs"
  },
  "1074612": {
    "ENU": "Ki-Rin Brains"
  },
  "1074613": {
    "ENU": "Pixie Leg"
  },
  "1074614": {
    "ENU": "Signed Tuition Reimbursement Form"
  },
  "1074615": {
    "ENU": "Hehehe.  Your choice."
  },
  "1074616": {
    "ENU": "I'm something of a gourmet, you see.  It's tough getting some of the ingredients, though.  Bring me back some pixie legs, unicorn ribs and ki-rin brains and I'll sign your form."
  },
  "1074617": {
    "ENU": "Oh excellent, you're back.  I'll get the oven going.  That thing about pixie legs, you see, is that they burn and dry out if you're not really careful.  Taste just like chicken too!"
  },
  "1074618": {
    "ENU": "Fooling Aernya"
  },
  "1074619": {
    "ENU": "Now that I've signed your papers you'd better get back to that witch Aernya.  Mmmm mmm smell those ribs!"
  },
  "1074620": {
    "ENU": "Giving up on your scheme eh?  Suit yourself."
  },
  "1074621": {
    "ENU": "You better hurry back to Mistress Aernya with that signed form.  The college only has so much money and with enough claims you may find yourself unable to get your tuition refunded.  *wink*"
  },
  "1074622": {
    "ENU": "What?  Hrmph.  Gorrow signed your form did he?  Let me see that.  *squint*"
  },
  "1074623": {
    "ENU": "Not Quite That Easy"
  },
  "1074624": {
    "ENU": "I wouldn't be too smug just yet, whiner.  You still need Master Gnosos' signature before I can cut your refund.  Last I heard, he's coordinating the recovery of the portions of the college that are currently overrun.  *nasty smile*  Off with you."
  },
  "1074625": {
    "ENU": "Completed Tuition Reimbursement Form"
  },
  "1074626": {
    "ENU": "Coward."
  },
  "1074627": {
    "ENU": "What are you waiting for?  The iron maiden is still the portal to Bedlam."
  },
  "1074628": {
    "ENU": "Made it through did you?  Did you happen to see Red Death out there?  Big horse, skeletal ... burning eyes?  No?  What's this?  Forms?  FORMS?  I'm up to my eyebrows in ravenous out-of-control undead and you want a signature?"
  },
  "1074629": {
    "ENU": "Convince Me"
  },
  "1074630": {
    "ENU": "I'm not signing any forms until the situation here is under control.  So, you can either help out or you can forget getting your tuition refund.  Which will it be?  Help control the shambling dead?"
  },
  "1074631": {
    "ENU": "No signature for you."
  },
  "1074632": {
    "ENU": "No signature for you until you kill off some of the shambling dead out there and destroy that blasted horse."
  },
  "1074633": {
    "ENU": "Pulled it off huh?  Well then you've earned this signature!"
  },
  "1074634": {
    "ENU": "Tuition Reimbursement"
  },
  "1074635": {
    "ENU": "Well, there you are.  I've added my signature to that of Gorrow, so you should be set to return to Mistress Aernya and get your tuition refunded."
  },
  "1074636": {
    "ENU": "Great! If you're going to stick around here, I know we have more tasks for you to perform."
  },
  "1074637": {
    "ENU": "Just head out the main gates there and you'll find yourself embracing the iron maiden in the Bloodletter's Guild."
  },
  "1074638": {
    "ENU": "*disinterested stare*  What?  Oh, you've gotten your form filled in.  How nice.  *glare*  And I'd hoped you'd drop this charade before I was forced to rub your nose in it.  *nasty smile*  You're not even a student and as such, you're not eligible for a refund -- you've never paid tuition.  For your services, Master Gnosos has recommended you receive pay.  So here.  Now go away."
  },
  "1074639": {
    "ENU": "Orders from Minax"
  },
  "1074640": {
    "ENU": "Pointy Ears"
  },
  "1074641": {
    "ENU": "I've heard ... there's some that will pay a good bounty for pointed ears, much like we used to pay for each wolf skin.  I've got nothing personal against these elves.  It's just business.  You want in on this?  I'm not fussy who I work with."
  },
  "1074642": {
    "ENU": "Suit yourself."
  },
  "1074643": {
    "ENU": "I can't pay a bounty if you don't bring bag the ears."
  },
  "1074644": {
    "ENU": "Here to collect on a bounty?"
  },
  "1074645": {
    "ENU": "Dreadhorn"
  },
  "1074646": {
    "ENU": "Can you comprehend it? I cannot, I confess.  The most pristine and perfect Lord of Sosaria has fallen prey to the blight.  From the depths of my heart I mourn his corruption; my thoughts are filled with pity for this glorious creature now tainted.  And my blood boils with fury at those responsible for the innocent creature's undoing.  Will you find Dread Horn, as he is now called, and free him from this misery?"
  },
  "1074647": {
    "ENU": "How can you not feel as I do?"
  },
  "1074648": {
    "ENU": "The lush and fertile land where Dread Horn now lives is twisted and tainted, a result of his corruption.  The fey folk have sealed the land off through their magics, but you can enter through an enchanted mushroom fairy circle."
  },
  "1074649": {
    "ENU": "Thank you.  I haven't the words to express my gratitude."
  },
  "1074650": {
    "ENU": "You have discovered a blood-stained journal that details the adventures of Lord Denthe.  The pages make for fascinating reading, telling the tale of the great man's efforts to uncover the secrets of the Prism of Light.  Will you donate the journal to a library so others may hear the tale of Lord Denthe's final expedition?"
  },
  "1074651": {
    "ENU": "Or, you could keep the journal for your private library."
  },
  "1074652": {
    "ENU": "The librarian in Britain would be glad of your donation of Lord Denthe's journal."
  },
  "1074653": {
    "ENU": "Shhhh!  What have YOU done to that book?  It's covered in ... is that blood?  *furious glare*  Let me see that.  Oh.  Oh, I see.  Do you realize how important this journal is?  Here, take this for your trouble."
  },
  "1074654": {
    "ENU": "The most incredible tale has reached my ears!  Deep within the bowels of Sosaria, somewhere under the city of Nu'Jelm, a twisted creature feeds.  What created this abomination, no one knows ... though there is some speculation that the fumbling initial efforts to open the portal to The Heartwood, brought it into existence.  Regardless of it's origin, it must be destroyed before it damages Sosaria.  Will you undertake this quest? "
  },
  "1074655": {
    "ENU": "Perhaps I thought too highly of you."
  },
  "1074656": {
    "ENU": "An explorer discovered the cave system under Nu'Jelm.  He made multiple trips into the place bringing back fascinating crystals and artifacts that suggested the hollow place in Sosaria was inhabited by other creatures at some point.  You'll need to follow in his footsteps to find this abomination and destroy it."
  },
  "1074657": {
    "ENU": "I am overjoyed with your efforts!  Your devotion to Sosaria is noted and appreciated."
  },
  "1074658": {
    "ENU": "Oh, the trauma!  *weeps loudly*  My lucky dagger has been lost.  It was given to me by my father, as a final gift before he died.  That blade has been an heirloom of my family for generations.  I must have it back.  *sniffles pathetically*  Please, find my lucky dagger."
  },
  "1074659": {
    "ENU": "*wailing cries* Then begone if you will not help a poor man in need."
  },
  "1074660": {
    "ENU": "*sniffles*  The dagger was stolen by some dishonest man.  Or perhaps I dropped it.  That doesn't matter though.  All that matters is that you find my dagger and return it."
  },
  "1074661": {
    "ENU": "You've found it?  My lucky dagger!"
  },
  "1074662": {
    "ENU": "You look strong and brave, my friend.  Are you strong and brave?  I only ask because I am known to be too generous to those that find for me interesting -- things -- to use in my smithing.  What do you say?"
  },
  "1074663": {
    "ENU": "*nods*"
  },
  "1074664": {
    "ENU": "I can't be generous, my friend, until you bring me those essences."
  },
  "1074665": {
    "ENU": "I can't be generous, my friend, until you bring me those crystalline fragments."
  },
  "1074666": {
    "ENU": "I can't be generous, my friend, until you bring me those icy hearts."
  },
  "1074667": {
    "ENU": "My friend, you've returned -- with items for me, I hope?  I have a generous reward for you."
  },
  "1074668": {
    "ENU": "Good, you're here.  The presence of a twisted creature deep under the earth near Nu'Jelm has corrupted the natural growth of crystals in that region.  They've become infused with the twisting energy -- they've come to a sort of life.  This is an abomination that festers within Sosaria.  You must eradicate the crystal daemons."
  },
  "1074669": {
    "ENU": "Good, you're here.  The presence of a twisted creature deep under the earth near Nu'Jelm has corrupted the natural growth of crystals in that region.  They've become infused with the twisting energy -- they've come to a sort of life.  This is an abomination that festers within Sosaria.  You must eradicate the crystal lattice seekers."
  },
  "1074670": {
    "ENU": "Good, you're here.  The presence of a twisted creature deep under the earth near Nu'Jelm has corrupted the natural growth of crystals in that region.  They've become infused with the twisting energy -- they've come to a sort of life.  This is an abomination that festers within Sosaria.  You must eradicate the crystal vortices."
  },
  "1074671": {
    "ENU": "These abominations must not be permitted to fester!"
  },
  "1074672": {
    "ENU": "You must not waste time. Do not suffer these crystalline abominations to live."
  },
  "1074673": {
    "ENU": "You have done well.  Enjoy this reward."
  },
  "1074674": {
    "ENU": "Good, you're here.  The presence of a twisted creature deep under the earth near Nu'Jelm has corrupted the natural growth of crystals in that region.  They've become infused with the twisting energy -- they've come to a sort of life.  This is an abomination that festers within Sosaria.  You must eradicate the crystal hydras."
  },
  "1074675": {
    "ENU": "Primitive Fetish"
  },
  "1074676": {
    "ENU": "Grobu's Fur"
  },
  "1074677": {
    "ENU": "I've always been fascinated by primitive cultures -- especially the artifacts.  I'm a collector, you see.  I'm working on building my troglodyte display and I'm saddened to say that I'm short on examples of religion and superstition amongst the creatures.  If you come across any primitive fetishes, I'd be happy to trade you something interesting for them."
  },
  "1074678": {
    "ENU": "I don't really want to know where you get the primitive fetishes, as I can't support the destruction of their lifestyle and culture. That would be wrong."
  },
  "1074679": {
    "ENU": "Bravo!  These fetishes are just what I needed.  You've earned this reward."
  },
  "1074680": {
    "ENU": "I don't know if you can handle it, but I'll give you a go at it.  Troglodyte chief -- name of Lurg and his mangy wolf pet need killing.  Do the deed and I'll reward you."
  },
  "1074681": {
    "ENU": "A Trog and His Dog"
  },
  "1074682": {
    "ENU": "The trog chief and his mutt should be easy enough to find.  Just kill them and report back.  Easy enough."
  },
  "1074683": {
    "ENU": "Not half bad.  Here's your prize."
  },
  "1074684": {
    "ENU": "New Cloak"
  },
  "1074685": {
    "ENU": "I have created a masterpiece!  And all I need to finish it off is the fur of a bear.  But not just ANY bear -- oh no, no, that wouldn't do.  I've heard tales of a mighty beast, Grobu, who is bonded to the leader of the troglodytes.  Only Grobu's fur will do.  Will you retrieve it for me? "
  },
  "1074686": {
    "ENU": "I've told you all I know of the creature.  Until you return with Grobu's fur I can't finish my cloak."
  },
  "1074687": {
    "ENU": "Ah! So soft, so supple.  What a wonderful texture.  Here you are ... my thanks."
  },
  "1074688": {
    "ENU": "Troglodytes!"
  },
  "1074689": {
    "ENU": "Oh nevermind, you don't look capable of my task afterall.  Haha!  What was I thinking -- you could never handle killing troglodytes.  It'd be suicide.  What?  I don't know, I don't want to be responsible ... well okay if you're really sure?"
  },
  "1074690": {
    "ENU": "Probably the wiser course of action."
  },
  "1074691": {
    "ENU": "You still need to kill those troglodytes, remember?"
  },
  "1074692": {
    "ENU": "Some of the most horrific creatures have slithered out of the sinkhole there and begun terrorizing the surrounding area.  The plague creatures are one of the most destruction of the minions of Paroxysmus.  Are you willing to do something about them?"
  },
  "1074693": {
    "ENU": "Vile creatures have exited the sinkhole and begun terrorizing the surrounding area.  The demons are bad enough, but the elementals are an abomination, their poisons seeping into the fertile ground here.  Will you enter the sinkhole and put a stop to their depredations?"
  },
  "1074694": {
    "ENU": "The daemons that have congregated to worship Paroxysmus pose a tremendous danger. Will you enter the lair and see to their destruction?"
  },
  "1074695": {
    "ENU": "The moloch daemons that have congregated to worship Paroxysmus pose a tremendous danger. Will you enter the lair and see to their destruction?<br>"
  },
  "1074696": {
    "ENU": "The succubi that have congregated within the sinkhole to worship Paroxysmus pose a tremendous danger. Will you enter the lair and see to their destruction?<br>"
  },
  "1074697": {
    "ENU": "The arcane daemons that worship Paroxysmus pose a tremendous danger. Will you enter the lair and see to their destruction?<br>"
  },
  "1074698": {
    "ENU": "You have discovered an acid covered strongbox.  Perhaps the owner would pay for its return before the corrosive substance destroys it.  Do you wish to return the box?"
  },
  "1074699": {
    "ENU": "The box doesn't look like it will survive the acid for much longer anyway."
  },
  "1074700": {
    "ENU": "The steaming box is etched with the name of Aeluva."
  },
  "1074701": {
    "ENU": "The disintegrating strongbox belonged to Jelrice."
  },
  "1074702": {
    "ENU": "The acid damaged coffer is etched with the name 'Belulah'."
  },
  "1074703": {
    "ENU": "Hello.  Oh, what's that?  My trunk!  What happened to it?  Well nevermind that.  Thank you!  Here's payment for your trouble."
  },
  "1074704": {
    "ENU": "Please, please I beg of you ... help out of here.  I was trying to find one of my sheep that went missing and I fell down this hole.  Then these ... *hysterical weeping*.  Please, get me out of here!"
  },
  "1074705": {
    "ENU": "Please!  PLEASE!  Don't let me die here."
  },
  "1074706": {
    "ENU": "*whimper* Please ... hurry.  I am a good climber and could get out the way you came in, if you can just get me there."
  },
  "1074707": {
    "ENU": "You've saved my life!  Oh thank you!  I can't repay you for your kindness but please, take this."
  },
  "1074708": {
    "ENU": "A Bad Seed"
  },
  "1074709": {
    "ENU": "The plight of the forest is staggering, all the more so because some of the tainted creatures are reproducing.  I am working to develop a natural means to prevent these corrupted seedlings from taking root, but without samples of such seeds, I'm forced to guess wildly what might work.  Will you harvest some tainted bogling seeds for me?"
  },
  "1074710": {
    "ENU": "I'm working on a striking necklace -- something really unique -- and I know just what I need to finish it up.  A huge fang!  Won't that catch the eye?  I would like to employ you to find me such an item, perhaps a snake would make the ideal donor.  I'll make it worth your while, of course."
  },
  "1074711": {
    "ENU": "Scale Armor"
  },
  "1074712": {
    "ENU": "Here's what I need ... there are some creatures called hydra, fearsome beasts, whose scales are especially suitable for a new sort of armor that I'm developing.  I need a few such pieces and then some supple alligator skin for the backing.  I'm going to need a really large piece that's shaped just right ... the tail I think would do nicely.  I appreciate your help."
  },
  "1074713": {
    "ENU": "The Medallion"
  },
  "1074714": {
    "ENU": "You have discovered an insciption on the back of the medallion that reads 'love always, your Belulah'.  Since the wearer of the necklace has met a grisly end, perhaps you'd be willing to track down Belulah?"
  },
  "1074715": {
    "ENU": "You are already protected with this slimy ointment."
  },
  "1074716": {
    "ENU": "You are no longer under the protection of the slimy ointment."
  },
  "1074717": {
    "ENU": "Certain tamed animals are accepted as donations by transfering the pet to the collection box."
  },
  "1074718": {
    "ENU": "Tainted seeds please.  Look for the bigggest, meanest bogling you can find."
  },
  "1074719": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Food Decoration Tool</CENTER>"
  },
  "1074720": {
    "ENU": "This is perfect!"
  },
  "1074721": {
    "ENU": "Do you have it?  *gasp* What a tooth!  Here … I must get right to work."
  },
  "1074722": {
    "ENU": "Those really big snakes like swamps, I've heard.  You might try the blighted grove."
  },
  "1074723": {
    "ENU": "I understand.  I don't like snakes much either.  They're so creepy."
  },
  "1074724": {
    "ENU": "Hydras have been spotted in the Blighted Grove.  You won't get those scales without getting your feet wet, I'm afraid."
  },
  "1074725": {
    "ENU": "I can't wait to get to work now that you've returned with my scales."
  },
  "1074726": {
    "ENU": "A Tale of Tail"
  },
  "1074727": {
    "ENU": "I've heard of you, adventurer.  Your reputation is impressive, and now I'll put it to the test. This is not something I ask lightly, for this task is fraught with danger, but it is vital.  Seek out the vile hydra Abscess, slay it, and return to me with its tail."
  },
  "1074728": {
    "ENU": "Well, the beast will still be there when you are ready I suppose."
  },
  "1074729": {
    "ENU": "Em, I thought I had explained already.  Abscess, the hydra, you know? Lots of heads but just the one tail.  I need the tail. I have my reasons. Go go go."
  },
  "1074730": {
    "ENU": "Ah, the tail.  You did it!  You know the rumours about dried ground hydra tail powder are all true?  Thank you so much!"
  },
  "1074731": {
    "ENU": "Or you could keep the medallion instead."
  },
  "1074732": {
    "ENU": "The name 'Belulah' is the only clue you find on the medallion."
  },
  "1074733": {
    "ENU": "Greets!  How can I … oh.  Oh no!  Is that … my darling Thorvald!  *quiet weeping*  Thank you for your kindness in returning this to me.  It means … a lot.  *sniffle*"
  },
  "1074734": {
    "ENU": "The hero returns from the glorious battle and - oh, such a small feather?"
  },
  "1074735": {
    "ENU": "If you're going to get anywhere in the adventuring game, you have to take some risks.  A harpy, well, it's bad, but it's not a dragon."
  },
  "1074736": {
    "ENU": "The path to greatness isn't for everyone obviously."
  },
  "1074737": {
    "ENU": "I've seen how you strut about, as if you were something special. I have some news for you, you don't impress me at all. It's not enough to have a fancy hat you know.  That may impress people in the big city, but not here. If you want a reputation you have to climb a mountain, slay some great beast, and then write about it.  Trust me, it's a long process.  The first step is doing a great feat.  If I were you, I'd go pluck a feather from the harpy Saliva, that would give you a good start."
  },
  "1074738": {
    "ENU": "A Feather in Yer Cap"
  },
  "1074739": {
    "ENU": "Guile, Irk and Spite"
  },
  "1074740": {
    "ENU": "You know them, don't you.  The three?  They look like you, you'll see. They looked like me, I remember, they looked like, well, you'll see.  The three.  They'll drive you mad too, if you let them.  They are trouble, and they need to be slain.  Seek them out."
  },
  "1074741": {
    "ENU": "Drool"
  },
  "1074742": {
    "ENU": "When I was a child I was savaged by a Cu'Sidhe.  It ran up and slobbered all over me. Long story short:  it was horrible, I was traumatized and I've never been the same since.  Look at me now.  Kill them, kill them all.  Well at least a few."
  },
  "1074743": {
    "ENU": "I don't think I'm asking anything unreasonable here."
  },
  "1074744": {
    "ENU": "Slaughter me some  -- Cu'Sidhe.  I'm a poet!"
  },
  "1074745": {
    "ENU": "You just don't understand the gravity of the situation.  If you did, you'd agree to my task."
  },
  "1074746": {
    "ENU": "Perhaps I was unclear.  You'll know them when you see them, because you'll see you, and you, and you.  Hurry now."
  },
  "1074747": {
    "ENU": "Are you one of THEM?  Ahhhh!  Oh, wait, if you were them, then you'd be me.  So you're -- you.  Good job!"
  },
  "1074748": {
    "ENU": "It's rare to find someone who shares my aversions and is willing to take immediate measures.  I'm glad we met."
  },
  "1074749": {
    "ENU": "Ha ha!  This just goes to prove that there's no request that someone is not willing to fuffilll.  Well done my friend!"
  },
  "1074750": {
    "ENU": "Momento!"
  },
  "1074751": {
    "ENU": "I was going to march right out there and get it myself, but no ... Master Gnosos won't let me.  But you see, that bridle means so much to me.  A momento of happier, less-dead ... well undead horseback riding.  Could you fetch it for me?  I think my horse, formerly known as 'Resolve', may still be wearing it."
  },
  "1074752": {
    "ENU": "Hrmph."
  },
  "1074753": {
    "ENU": "The bridle would be hard to miss on him now ... since he's skeletal.  Please do what you need to do to retreive it for me."
  },
  "1074754": {
    "ENU": "I'd know that jingling sound anywhere!  You have recovered my bridle.  Thank you."
  },
  "1074755": {
    "ENU": "Culinary Crisis"
  },
  "1074756": {
    "ENU": "You have NO idea how impossible this is.  Simply intolerable!  How can one expect an artiste' like me to create masterpieces of culinary delight without the best, fresh ingredients?  Ever since this whositwhatsit started this uproar, my thrice-daily produce deliveries have ended.  I can't survive another hour without produce!"
  },
  "1074757": {
    "ENU": "You have no artistry in your soul."
  },
  "1074758": {
    "ENU": "I must have fresh produce and cheese at once!"
  },
  "1074759": {
    "ENU": "Those dates look bruised!  Oh no, and you fetched a soft cheese.  *deep pained sigh*  Well, even I can only do so much with inferior ingredients.  BAM!"
  },
  "1074760": {
    "ENU": "A hydra scale."
  },
  "1074761": {
    "ENU": "Resolve's Bridle"
  },
