  "1074812": {
    "ENU": "Stout Whip"
  },
  "1074813": {
    "ENU": "You have failed to complete your delivery."
  },
  "1074814": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Are you sure you want to teleport <BR>yourself to an unknown area?</CENTER>"
  },
  "1074815": {
    "ENU": "If you die in a teleported place, your corpse will remain there and you may not be able to recover items. Is this ok?"
  },
  "1074816": {
    "ENU": "Charger of the Fallen Statuette"
  },
  "1074817": {
    "ENU": "Sacrificial altar"
  },
  "1074818": {
    "ENU": "Sacrificial Altar"
  },
  "1074819": {
    "ENU": "Aquarium food"
  },
  "1074820": {
    "ENU": "Pet Beetles"
  },
  "1074821": {
    "ENU": "Unusual Riding Creatures"
  },
  "1074822": {
    "ENU": "You have already learned the art of spellweaving."
  },
  "1074823": {
    "ENU": "Lost Civilization"
  },
  "1074824": {
    "ENU": "Emissary to the Minotaur"
  },
  "1074825": {
    "ENU": "*whew*  It is done!  The fierce essence of the bull has been infused into your aura.  You are able now to breach the ancient defenses of the city.  Go forth and seek the minotaur -- and then return with wondrous tales and evidence of your visit to the Labyrinth."
  },
  "1074826": {
    "ENU": "Minotaur Artifact"
  },
  "1074827": {
    "ENU": "As you wish.  I can't understand why you'd pass up such a remarkable opportunity.  Think of the adventures you would have."
  },
  "1074828": {
    "ENU": "You won't reach the minotaur city by loitering around here!  What are you waiting for?  You need to get to Malas and find the access point for the island.  You'll be renowned for your discovery!"
  },
  "1074829": {
    "ENU": "Oh! You've returned at last!  I can't wait to hear the tales ... but first, let me see those artifacts.  You've certainly earned this reward."
  },
  "1074830": {
    "ENU": "Felucca: ~1_PHASE~"
  },
  "1074831": {
    "ENU": "Trammel: ~1_PHASE~"
  },
  "1074832": {
    "ENU": "Earthen Mixtures"
  },
  "1074833": {
    "ENU": "Huntsman's Forest"
  },
  "1074834": {
    "ENU": "Please enter [ to reply to the GM."
  },
  "1074835": {
    "ENU": "Bedlam"
  },
  "1074836": {
    "ENU": "The container cannot hold that type of object."
  },
  "1074837": {
    "ENU": "I cannot accept such an item."
  },
  "1074838": {
    "ENU": "Word of Death has no effect on this creature."
  },
  "1074839": {
    "ENU": "As you examine the ticket, your surroundings mysteriously change!"
  },
  "1074840": {
    "ENU": "This ticket can only be used while you are in the Prism of Light dungeon."
  },
  "1074841": {
    "ENU": "Double click to transport out of the Prism of Light dungeon"
  },
