    "ENU": "Wildfire Removal"
  },
  "1074844": {
    "ENU": "Wildfire has been removed!"
  },
  "1074845": {
    "ENU": "Wildfire has been removed from your target!"
  },
  "1074846": {
    "ENU": "A tasty bite of the enchanted apple lifts all curses from your soul."
  },
  "1074847": {
    "ENU": "The grapes of wrath invigorate you for a short time, allowing you to deal extra damage."
  },
  "1074848": {
    "ENU": "Interactive Quagmire Contribution Statue from the Britannia Royal Zoo."
  },
  "1074849": {
    "ENU": "Interactive Bake Kitsune Contribution Statue from the Britannia Royal Zoo."
  },
  "1074850": {
    "ENU": "Interactive Changeling Contribution Statue from the Britannia Royal Zoo."
  },
  "1074851": {
    "ENU": "Interactive Polar Bear Contribution Statue from the Britannia Royal Zoo."
  },
  "1074852": {
    "ENU": "Interactive Reptalon Contribution Statue from the Britannia Royal Zoo."
  },
  "1074853": {
    "ENU": "You have been given ~1_name~"
  },
  "1074854": {
    "ENU": "Here, take this..."
  },
  "1074855": {
    "ENU": "Gone Native"
  },
  "1074856": {
    "ENU": "Pathetic really.  I must say, a senior instructor going native -- forgetting about his students and peers and engaging in such disgraceful behavior!  I'm speaking, of course, of Theophilus.  Master Theophilus to you. He may have gone native but he still holds a Mastery Degree from Bedlam College!  But, well, that's neither here nor there.  I need you to take care of my colleague.  Convince him of the error of his ways.  He may resist.  In fact, assume he will and kill him.  We'll get him resurrected and be ready to cure his folly.  What do you say?"
  },
  "1074857": {
    "ENU": "I understand.  A Master of Bedlam, even one entirely off his rocker, is too much for you to handle."
  },
  "1074858": {
    "ENU": "You had better get going.  Master Theophilus isn't likely to kill himself just to save me this embarrassment."
  },
  "1074859": {
    "ENU": "You look a bit worse for wear!  He put up a good fight did he?  Hah!  That's the spirit … a Master of Bedlam is a match for most."
  },
  "1074860": {
    "ENU": "invisibility"
  },
  "1074861": {
    "ENU": "You do not have everything you need!"
  },
  "1074862": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>NOTICE</CENTER>"
  },
  "1074863": {
    "ENU": "The house cannot be customized when add-on containers such as aquariums, elven furniture containers, vanities, boiling cauldrons, and raised garden bed are present in the house. Please re-deed the add-on containers before customizing the house."
  },
