  "1075223": {
    "ENU": "<body>Part of the Virtue armor set.<br>Physical Resist 8%<br>Fire Resist 8%<br>Cold Resist 7%<br>Poison Resist 9%<br>Energy Resist 8%</body>"
  },
  "1075224": {
    "ENU": "<body>Part of the Virtue armor set.<br>Physical Resist 6%<br>Fire Resist 6%<br>Cold Resist 8%<br>Poison Resist 6%<br>Energy Resist 9%</body>"
  },
  "1075225": {
    "ENU": "<body>Parrying +5<br>Hit Point Increase 5<br>Hit Point Regeneration 1<br>Physical Resist 1%<br>Energy Resist 1%</body>"
  },
  "1075226": {
    "ENU": "<body>Soak up to 10 bandages a day in the rejuvenating waters of this fountain. Soaked bandages grant +10 to Healing effectiveness.</body>"
  },
  "1075227": {
    "ENU": "<body>Select one of 4 randomly chosen music tracks when used. Additional tracks can be found as loot and added to the music box.</body>"
  },
  "1075228": {
    "ENU": "<body>Necromancy +10<br>Mana Regeneration 1<br>Faster Casting 1<br>Increased Karma Loss 5%</body>"
  },
  "1075229": {
    "ENU": "<body>When a ninja equips the Talisman of the Fey, it will permit him to use his Animal Form ability to transform into one of the newly-discovered creatures.</body>"
  },
  "1075230": {
    "ENU": "<body>Damage Modifier: 10%<br>Defense Chance Increase 5%<br>Lower Ammo Cost 20%<br>Weight Reduction 30%</body>"
  },
