  "1076231": {
    "ENU": "Statue of ~1_Name~"
  },
  "1076232": {
    "ENU": "*** Gold, spellbooks, potions, and reagents have been placed in your bank box ***"
  },
  "1076233": {
    "ENU": "To receive extra items in bank, say 'give resources' or 'give armor' and 'give arties' - 1 use per character"
  },
  "1076234": {
    "ENU": "You feel uneasy... but nothing happens."
  },
  "1076235": {
    "ENU": "You feel a strange rush of energy... but nothing happens."
  },
  "1076236": {
    "ENU": "You lose control of the wild energies!"
  },
  "1076237": {
    "ENU": "For a moment strange words fill your mind, but they're gone before you can fully grasp them."
  },
  "1076238": {
    "ENU": "Again, 'you' of this plane attempt to make use of a simple invocation of magical energy."
  },
  "1076239": {
    "ENU": "By what name do 'you' wish to be addressed at this time?"
  },
  "1076240": {
    "ENU": "Very well, '~1_name~.' Do 'you' have memory of previous discussions with 'myself?'"
  },
  "1076241": {
    "ENU": "Good. Tedious repetition should then be unnecessary on this occasion."
  },
  "1076242": {
    "ENU": "So be it. 'I' must often repeat information when conversing with the life of Britannia, it seems."
  },
  "1076243": {
    "ENU": "Those which 'you' know of as 'wisp' in Britannia are projections of life in Xorinia."
  },
  "1076244": {
    "ENU": "However, these 'wisp' are weaker projections, as 'your' plane is a variant of the prime."
  },
  "1076245": {
    "ENU": "Xorinia serves as a conduit for information between different planes."
  },
  "1076246": {
    "ENU": "Do 'you' wish to exchange information?"
  },
  "1076247": {
    "ENU": "'I' will wait while 'you' supply a reasonably dense source of information."
  },
  "1076248": {
    "ENU": "Then 'I' will initiate cessation of proximity between 'us.'"
  },
  "1076249": {
    "ENU": "When 'you' have prepared information of interest contact 'me' again."
  },
  "1076250": {
    "ENU": "In accordance with 'your' custom: Goodbye, '~1_name~.'"
  },
  "1076251": {
    "ENU": "Your pet was unable to join you while you are a ghost.  Please re-login once you have ressurected to claim your pets."
  },
  "1076252": {
    "ENU": "You have been removed from the game for 2 minutes for use of an illegal 3rd party program.  Please make sure you have removed the following program from your computer:  ~2_PROGRAM~.  At this time your account is being reviewed, and action may be taken for this violation.  Continued logins while using unauthorized third party programs may result in further penalties. Please see support.uo.com for further information. ~1_REASON~"
  },
