  "1076311": {
    "ENU": "Good morning, Sherry"
  },
  "1076312": {
    "ENU": "Good afternoon, Sherry"
  },
  "1076313": {
    "ENU": "Good evening, Sherry"
  },
  "1076314": {
    "ENU": "Excuse me"
  },
  "1076315": {
    "ENU": "Pardon me"
  },
  "1076316": {
    "ENU": "Indeed"
  },
  "1076317": {
    "ENU": "Be careful whither thou walketh!"
  },
  "1076318": {
    "ENU": "Mind thy way, mouse."
  },
  "1076319": {
    "ENU": "Ah, excuse me"
  },
  "1076320": {
    "ENU": "Oh, pardon me"
  },
  "1076321": {
    "ENU": "Eek! A rat!"
  },
  "1076322": {
    "ENU": "Ack! It's talking!"
  },
  "1076323": {
    "ENU": "Hail, milady Sherry"
  },
  "1076324": {
    "ENU": "Good day, milady Sherry"
  },
  "1076325": {
    "ENU": "Good day, milady"
  },
  "1076326": {
    "ENU": "Ah! 'Tis our finest food critic!"
  },
  "1076327": {
    "ENU": "Oh ho! Hail, milady!"
  },
  "1076328": {
    "ENU": "Oh! 'Tis Sherry!"
  },
  "1076329": {
    "ENU": "Why if it isn't Sherry!"
  },
  "1076330": {
    "ENU": "Aha! I thought I heard the pitter-patter of little feet!"
  },
  "1076331": {
    "ENU": "Hello Sherry!"
  },
  "1076332": {
    "ENU": "Good day to thee, Sherry"
  },
  "1076333": {
    "ENU": "And hello to ye as well, Sherry"
  },
  "1076334": {
    "ENU": "Sherry! 'Tis good to see thee"
  },
  "1076335": {
    "ENU": "Greetings, Sherry"
  },
  "1076336": {
    "ENU": "Hi Sherry!"
  },
  "1076337": {
    "ENU": "Oh, Sherry!"
  },
  "1076338": {
    "ENU": "Aha, 'tis Sherry!"
  },
  "1076339": {
    "ENU": "Cheerful as always, eh Sherry?"
  },
  "1076340": {
    "ENU": "Good day, Sherry"
  },
  "1076341": {
    "ENU": "Hello"
  },
  "1076342": {
    "ENU": "Hi"
  },
  "1076343": {
    "ENU": "Hail"
  },
  "1076344": {
    "ENU": "Good day to thee"
  },
  "1076345": {
    "ENU": "Greetings"
  },
  "1076346": {
    "ENU": "Hello there"
  },
  "1076347": {
    "ENU": "Why hello"
  },
  "1076348": {
    "ENU": "Good day"
  },
  "1076349": {
    "ENU": "Stay away from me"
  },
  "1076350": {
    "ENU": "I'm too busy to talk"
  },
  "1076351": {
    "ENU": "A talking rat?"
  },
  "1076352": {
    "ENU": "Move along, vermin"
  },
  "1076353": {
    "ENU": "Please, leave me be"
  },
  "1076354": {
    "ENU": "Ick, stay away from me"
  },
  "1076355": {
    "ENU": "Rat!!!"
  },
  "1076356": {
    "ENU": "Oh dear... is it, is it talking?"
  },
  "1076357": {
    "ENU": "Eek!"
  },
  "1076358": {
    "ENU": "Please, go away"
  },
  "1076359": {
    "ENU": "zzz"
  },
  "1076360": {
    "ENU": "Zzz"
  },
  "1076361": {
    "ENU": "zzZz"
  },
  "1076362": {
    "ENU": "zz.. Zzz..."
  },
  "1076363": {
    "ENU": "Zzz.. Zzz..."
  },
  "1076364": {
    "ENU": "Milord... where didst thou go?"
  },
  "1076365": {
    "ENU": "... where?"
  },
  "1076366": {
    "ENU": "Why didst thou..."
  },
  "1076367": {
    "ENU": "friends..."
  },
  "1076368": {
    "ENU": "Everyone..."
  },
  "1076369": {
    "ENU": "... miss thee"
  },
  "1076370": {
    "ENU": "... story time?"
  },
  "1076371": {
    "ENU": "... kersplash!"
  },
  "1076372": {
    "ENU": "cold..."
  },
  "1076373": {
    "ENU": "little lonely... 'tis all..."
  },
  "1076374": {
    "ENU": "\"Hubert's Hair-Raising Adventure\""
  },
  "1076375": {
    "ENU": "\"Hubert the Lion was haughty and vain\""
  },
  "1076376": {
    "ENU": "\"And especially proud of his elegant mane.\""
  },
  "1076377": {
    "ENU": "\"But conceit of this sort isn't proper at all\""
  },
  "1076378": {
    "ENU": "\"And Hubert the Lion was due for a fall.\""
  },
  "1076379": {
    "ENU": "\"One day as he sharpened his claws on a rock\""
  },
  "1076380": {
    "ENU": "\"He received a most horrible, terrible shock.\""
  },
  "1076381": {
    "ENU": "\"A flaming hot spark flew up into the air,\""
  },
  "1076382": {
    "ENU": "\"Came down on his head and ignited his hair.\""
  },
  "1076383": {
    "ENU": "\"With a roar of surprise he took off like a streak,\""
  },
  "1076384": {
    "ENU": "\"Away through the jungle to Zamboozi Creek.\""
  },
  "1076385": {
    "ENU": "\"He leaped in kersplash! with a shower of bubbles,\""
  },
  "1076386": {
    "ENU": "\"And came bobbing up with a head full of stubbles.\""
  },
  "1076387": {
    "ENU": "\"At first he just stared with a wide-open mouth\""
  },
  "1076388": {
    "ENU": "\"At the cloud of black smoke drifting off to the south.\""
  },
  "1076389": {
    "ENU": "\"Then he felt with his paws just in back of his ears\""
  },
  "1076390": {
    "ENU": "\"And he suddenly realized the worst of his fears.\""
  },
  "1076391": {
    "ENU": "\"'I'm ruined,' he shouted, oh what'll I do! I'd rather be dead or go live in a zoo!'\""
  },
  "1076392": {
    "ENU": "\"'And if anyone sees me, oh what a disgrace, So I'd better discover a good hiding place!'\""
  },
  "1076393": {
    "ENU": "Oh, but I told it just a bit ago... mayhaps later?"
  },
  "1076394": {
    "ENU": "'Tis very spacious! It containeth the royal throne, a commemorative shield, and the Serpent Crest."
  },
  "1076395": {
    "ENU": "Many a day and eve my lord sat there upon... *teehee* Yet it hath such an odd shape!"
  },
  "1076396": {
    "ENU": "Oh yes, not like those from Magincia or Nujel'm 'tall!"
  },
  "1076397": {
    "ENU": "The red one over on yonder wall. It hath a wonderful inscription, but I do not know who Govannon Mac Lyr was"
  },
  "1076398": {
    "ENU": "May Truth Be My Sword, Courage My Shield, And Love Guide Them Both. It speaketh well of the Three Principles"
  },
  "1076399": {
    "ENU": "The silver serpent stands boldly 'pon the red field, a symbol of strength for all!"
  },
  "1076400": {
    "ENU": "A truly magical creature, rarely seen in these modern times"
  },
  "1076401": {
    "ENU": "I hath but seen one once, yet now know why my liege feeleth so strongly of their power and dignity"
  },
  "1076402": {
    "ENU": "Oh it's so pretty! I had forgotten how peaceful a place it could be"
  },
  "1076403": {
    "ENU": "'Twas once reserved for only the finest of horses for the Royal Guard, yet now anyone canst purchase a steed therein"
  },
  "1076404": {
    "ENU": "Hmm, I wonder what 'twas built for..."
  },
  "1076405": {
    "ENU": "*teehee* Sometimes I sneak through the walls to fetch a quick snack. The guards sometimes leave out rations"
  },
  "1076406": {
    "ENU": "They art quite kind, yet mostly stern in their duties"
  },
  "1076407": {
    "ENU": "Most of these nobles visit from far away places, like Magincia or Moonglow. Some are very friendly!"
  },
  "1076408": {
    "ENU": "We hath the finest cooks in all of Britannia here! Yep!"
  },
  "1076409": {
    "ENU": "I eat there every day, I highly recommend the brie!"
  },
  "1076410": {
    "ENU": "The nobles get odd looks upon their faces if I go there during meals... so I eat in the kitchen"
  },
  "1076411": {
    "ENU": "'Tis a wonderful library full of rare books and histories. A pity I am so small, or I would read more!"
  },
  "1076412": {
    "ENU": "Lord British once slept in that very room! It also hath a secret!"
  },
  "1076413": {
    "ENU": "Uh-huh! And we would read stories before bedtime, 'twas wonderful! I sleep on a pillow near the bed"
  },
  "1076414": {
    "ENU": "The good Commander leant it to me, 'twas most kind!"
  },
  "1076415": {
    "ENU": "If thou examineth the north wall most carefully, ye should find the entrance to milord's study!"
  },
  "1076416": {
    "ENU": "Oh, but please be careful therein, the castle staff oft forget to clean it methinks"
  },
  "1076417": {
    "ENU": "Many of the land's finest artists come here to paint portraits"
  },
  "1076418": {
    "ENU": "Be veryyy careful in there! Nystul used to make things explode all the time! Clainin is no better!"
  },
  "1076419": {
    "ENU": "I asked Clainin what happened to him... but no one seemeth to have a good answer for me"
  },
  "1076420": {
    "ENU": "He's nice, but I miss the funny old man!"
  },
  "1076421": {
    "ENU": "'Tis so big! I used to sit in 'pon many a meeting between Lord British and his Council"
  },
  "1076422": {
    "ENU": "Aye, there is a council of Lords and Ladies that manage the kingdom in my lord's... absence"
  },
  "1076423": {
    "ENU": "The Commander gave me a fluffy pillow!"
  },
  "1076424": {
    "ENU": "Oh! Would you like to know about the castle? I can tell you about its history or even the layout!"
  },
  "1076425": {
    "ENU": "This isn't the first castle, of course! 'Tis built upon the remains of older castles as the kingdom grew"
  },
  "1076426": {
    "ENU": "Oh yes! The foundations are buried right beneath us! I once explored some of the passages"
  },
  "1076427": {
    "ENU": "Yes, quite a few are intertwined with the castle's sewer, but people are too big to fit!"
  },
  "1076428": {
    "ENU": "'Tis separate from the city's, yet almost as complex!"
  },
  "1076429": {
    "ENU": "Well, wouldst thou like to know more about the grounds or the inside?"
  },
  "1076430": {
    "ENU": "I think the most interesting things are the garden, stables, barracks, blacksmithing, training area, or that odd tower"
  },
  "1076431": {
    "ENU": "'Tis behind the castle's southwest wing. There was a time when it bustled with activity!"
  },
  "1076432": {
    "ENU": "One of Britannia's finest smithys, I canst not count how many of our guards wear the Order shields forged there"
  },
  "1076433": {
    "ENU": "Oh, there's the throne room, dining hall, kitchen, meeting hall, studio, laboratory, library, and my lord's bedroom"
  },
  "1076434": {
    "ENU": "My liege, the sovereign ruler of Britannia, yet he hath gone..."
  },
  "1076435": {
    "ENU": "I know not where, but I shall wait for him!"
  },
  "1076436": {
    "ENU": "Now the Council rules in his stead"
  },
  "1076437": {
    "ENU": "Oh, well, 'tis been a hard time for Britannia, yet the Council seemeth able to stay the course"
  },
  "1076438": {
    "ENU": "Lord British has been Britannia's ruler since its inception"
  },
  "1076439": {
    "ENU": "Our proud country's borders extend across the waves! E'en be it Trammel or Felucca, many call it home"
  },
  "1076440": {
    "ENU": "This land was brought about by Lord British and Nystul, to stay a horrible evil brought upon us by Minax"
  },
  "1076441": {
    "ENU": "Our homeland, from which many fled as Minax's armies laid waste to the kingdom..."
  },
  "1076442": {
    "ENU": "I hope she rots."
  },
  "1076443": {
    "ENU": "May his name be cursed for ever and ever, 'tis his fault that so many troubles were wrought upon my lord"
  },
  "1076444": {
    "ENU": "With the shards of the Gem and... oh, I do carry on don't I?"
  },
  "1076445": {
    "ENU": "I canst not even comprehend that strange and horrible being"
  },
  "1076446": {
    "ENU": "After all, who shall read me stories?"
  },
  "1076447": {
    "ENU": "Yes! My lord read me many a story from a strange and wonderful land called... 'Urth?' I think 'twas."
  },
  "1076448": {
    "ENU": "My favorite is about 'Hubert the Lion'"
  },
  "1076449": {
    "ENU": "Wouldst thou like to hear the story?"
  },
  "1076450": {
    "ENU": "Lord British once drew a map of it, I wonder what happened to it? It had many countries"
  },
  "1076451": {
    "ENU": "That's a silly way to pronounce it!"
  },
  "1076452": {
    "ENU": "He told me he wast named after his birth place, how odd!"
  },
  "1076453": {
    "ENU": "The world which we know was once Sosaria, but now is one kingdom"
  },
  "1076454": {
    "ENU": "Aye! Rule, Britannia!"
  },
  "1076455": {
    "ENU": "After the Stranger defeated Mondain, my lord bound together the shattered remnants of our world into one kingdom"
  },
  "1076456": {
    "ENU": "I often wonder what happened to him... so I wrote a book when I found out!"
  },
  "1076457": {
    "ENU": "Hast thou read, 'My Story?' It recordeth many a strange thing about our world"
  },
  "1076458": {
    "ENU": "Oh yes, there were once many kingdoms in Sosaria, Lord British himself united several in his early days"
  },
  "1076459": {
    "ENU": "Akalabeth and the Lands of the Lost King became the Lands of Lord British, and the capital of Akalabeth became Britain"
  },
  "1076460": {
    "ENU": "Lord British was given the title 'Champion of the White Light,' and drove Mondain from these lands for a great time"
  },
  "1076461": {
    "ENU": "Truth, Love and Courage - from which flow all the Eight Virtues"
  },
  "1076462": {
    "ENU": "Ver!"
  },
  "1076463": {
    "ENU": "Amo!"
  },
  "1076464": {
    "ENU": "Cor!"
  },
  "1076465": {
    "ENU": "Oh! So few know the mantra of the Axiom of Infinity! How wonderful!"
  },
  "1076466": {
    "ENU": "Veramocor!"
  },
  "1076467": {
    "ENU": "Aye, 'tis represented in this very castle!"
  },
  "1076468": {
    "ENU": "Honesty, Compassion, Valor, Justice, Sacrifice, Honor, Spirituality, and Humility"
  },
  "1076469": {
    "ENU": "Ahm!"
  },
  "1076470": {
    "ENU": "Mu!"
  },
  "1076471": {
    "ENU": "Ra!"
  },
  "1076472": {
    "ENU": "Beh!"
  },
  "1076473": {
    "ENU": "Cah!"
  },
  "1076474": {
    "ENU": "Summ!"
  },
  "1076475": {
    "ENU": "Om!"
  },
  "1076476": {
    "ENU": "Lum!"
  },
  "1076477": {
    "ENU": "I'm Sherry!"
  },
  "1076478": {
    "ENU": "Yes?"
  },
  "1076479": {
    "ENU": "Oh! You said it right!"
  },
  "1076480": {
    "ENU": "Hehe, I write books, eat cheese, and talk to people"
  },
  "1076481": {
    "ENU": "I love cheese! Dost thou have any?"
  },
  "1076482": {
    "ENU": "Some people think 'tis an odd thing, but I'm even trying to learn new languages!"
  },
  "1076483": {
    "ENU": "Aye! One day I wish to be able to talk to every intelligent race in the world"
  },
  "1076484": {
    "ENU": "Oh, for some time I hath been traveling, seeking answers"
  },
  "1076485": {
    "ENU": "I canst not tell thee more, for I am sworn to secrecy"
  },
  "1076486": {
    "ENU": "Aye! I am a mouse!"
  },
  "1076487": {
    "ENU": "... I'm sorry to see what happened to him"
  },
  "1076488": {
    "ENU": "I... I canst not tell thee of that"
  },
  "1076489": {
    "ENU": "*Squeak*"
  },
  "1076490": {
    "ENU": "*Squeek*"
  },
  "1076491": {
    "ENU": "*Squirk*"
  },
  "1076492": {
    "ENU": "*Squeak, squirk?*"
  },
  "1076493": {
    "ENU": "*Squeeeeeek!*"
  },
  "1076494": {
    "ENU": "*Eeeek!*"
  },
  "1076495": {
    "ENU": "*Nitters fiblik*"
  },
  "1076496": {
    "ENU": "Ne'er have I seen such a grim game as the one played that eve. For every move there was found a counter!"
  },
  "1076497": {
    "ENU": "A pawn for a pawn, a knight for a knight, and then the field was left with naught but lonely kings."
  },
  "1076498": {
    "ENU": "And alone, neither could overturn the other..."
  },
  "1076499": {
    "ENU": "The very air was torn asunder, as though the air had been peeled away. Beyond it lay darkness and stars"
  },
  "1076500": {
    "ENU": "T'were not unlike the night sky, yet deeper and more ethereal"
  },
  "1076501": {
    "ENU": "I never wish to feel such a thing again!"
  },
  "1076502": {
    "ENU": "The Time Lord's voice penetrated me to the core. Didst he know I was there, that I and Blackthorn both witnessed this?"
  },
  "1076503": {
    "ENU": "I know something of the nature of worlds, yet in what kind of place canst one such as the Time Lord dwell?"
  },
  "1076504": {
    "ENU": "Lord British told me of it, how such an artifact of evil could be created I darest not imagine."
  },
  "1076505": {
    "ENU": "Thou knowest then, that our world is but a shadow of another Britannia."
  },
  "1076506": {
    "ENU": "Perhaps it is the wrong word? Yet we are not the true Britannia, and for this my lord is gone..."
  },
  "1076507": {
    "ENU": "I... understand the price that would have been paid. Yet they tell me my lord found another way"
  },
  "1076508": {
    "ENU": "Long after Blackthorn's death, though. Oh how such a horrible fate could be visited on such a noble man!"
  },
  "1076509": {
    "ENU": "All life that was unique to our world, gone! Erased as though it had never existed?"
  },
  "1076510": {
    "ENU": "I pray the protections that shield our own shard remain strong"
  },
  "1076511": {
    "ENU": "No ill fate awaits our world now should the people embrace the virtues. Yet, they do not!"
  },
  "1076512": {
    "ENU": "He seemeth to be an entity from beyond our own dimension, tasked with watching the multiverse"
  },
  "1076513": {
    "ENU": "Our world is not alone, for there are thousands upon thousands reflections of the original Britannia"
  },
  "1076514": {
    "ENU": "After the Gem was shattered, each shard kept a likeness of the world within it. Such was its power!"
  },
  "1076515": {
    "ENU": "Yes, yet, save that night in Lord British's chambers, I hath not seen him. Perhaps he is somehow limited?"
  },
  "1076516": {
    "ENU": "Nystul once spoke of a barrier surrounding our shard, as though it blocked outside interferences"
  },
  "1076517": {
    "ENU": "Perhaps the barrier canst be breached?"
  },
  "1076518": {
    "ENU": "Oh! Excuse me, I must be going"
  },
  "1076519": {
    "ENU": "Sorry! I have to be going"
  },
  "1076520": {
    "ENU": "It's breakfast time!"
  },
  "1076521": {
    "ENU": "I'm off for Lunch!"
  },
  "1076522": {
    "ENU": "Dinnertime!"
  },
  "1076523": {
    "ENU": "I'm getting a little sleepy... good night!"
  },
  "1076524": {
    "ENU": "Our finest soldiers are trained here and at Serpent's Hold"
  },
