  },
  "1076689": {
    "ENU": "You squeeze through the mousehole"
  },
  "1076690": {
    "ENU": "~1_name~ steals ~2_count~ gold piece from you!"
  },
  "1076691": {
    "ENU": "~1_name~ steals ~2_count~ gold pieces from you!"
  },
  "1076692": {
    "ENU": "You may not start another character transfer since it has been less than 24 hours since your last character transfer."
  },
  "1076693": {
    "ENU": "~1_name~ tosses the coin into the air..."
  },
  "1076694": {
    "ENU": "Someone else is already using that coin"
  },
  "1076695": {
    "ENU": "Heads!"
  },
  "1076696": {
    "ENU": "Tails!"
  },
  "1076697": {
    "ENU": "I am a being known to thy people as the Time Lord"
  },
  "1076698": {
    "ENU": "Indeed, I am tasked to watch over worlds, ensuring their safe passage through the ether"
  },
  "1076699": {
    "ENU": "A void that is not a void, it exists outside of existence - as ye know it at least"
  },
  "1076700": {
    "ENU": "It is a difficult concept to comprehend. I am at once outside thy world, yet am here in it"
  },
  "1076701": {
    "ENU": "I do not visit worlds like these often, for I find myself limited to the corporeal form"
  },
  "1076702": {
    "ENU": "It is a limit placed upon me by the nature of this shard's existence"
  },
  "1076703": {
    "ENU": "I will not deceive thee, there are many worlds like thine, all of which are in peril"
  },
  "1076704": {
    "ENU": "Verily, where thou standest was once sacrosanct, yet is now seen by all"
  },
  "1076705": {
    "ENU": "I destroyed the foul creatures who had entered through the rifts, for I can do that at least"
  },
  "1076706": {
    "ENU": "It is for this reason I have come, to learn more of the ethereal tears forming here"
  },
  "1076707": {
    "ENU": "I am knowledgable, but not omniscient. If thou hast information, I shall listen at a later time"
  },
  "1076708": {
    "ENU": "For now, I must go"
  },
  "1076709": {
    "ENU": "Worlds beyond thine own refer to this place as but one shard amongst many"
  },
  "1076710": {
    "ENU": "To ye they must seem as nightmares incarnate, they are beasts of the Void"
  },
  "1076711": {
    "ENU": "Think of it not as the absence of everything, but as the absence of nothing"
  },
  "1076712": {
    "ENU": "A Box of Crystal Items"
  },
  "1076713": {
    "ENU": "A Box of Shadow Items"
  },
