  },
  "1076730": {
    "ENU": "Without warning a voice fills your mind:"
  },
  "1076731": {
    "ENU": "\"Assemble hence at Castle British, thine aid is required!\""
  },
  "1076732": {
    "ENU": "Everyone, we must somehow push back this vermin menace!"
  },
  "1076733": {
    "ENU": "They're everywhere! Stand back! I'm going to try to burn them all out!"
  },
  "1076734": {
    "ENU": "Little mouse, who art thou?"
  },
  "1076735": {
    "ENU": "Sherry? Sherry! I am Clainin, but I thought thou had... How extraordinary!"
  },
  "1076736": {
    "ENU": "Wilt thou come with me? I must introduce you to the Royal Council"
  },
  "1076737": {
    "ENU": "Excuse us everyone, I will leave the remainder to ye"
  },
  "1076738": {
    "ENU": "Excuse me..."
  },
  "1076739": {
    "ENU": "What are you doing to my home!?"
  },
  "1076740": {
    "ENU": "*SQUEEEEAAAKK!!!*"
  },
  "1076741": {
    "ENU": "Well, that seems to have done it at least"
  },
  "1076742": {
    "ENU": "Oh, Hi! I'm Sherry! I live here. Who're you?"
  },
  "1076743": {
    "ENU": "*squeak* Of course!"
  },
