  "1076796": {
    "ENU": "recovered from ~1_val~ (Blackrock Infected)"
  },
  "1076797": {
    "ENU": "\"The former to be no less than five-score peoples, the latter to be no less than the value of the smallest town in the realm.\""
  },
  "1076798": {
    "ENU": "*hic*"
  },
  "1076799": {
    "ENU": "‘Cause the court ordered me."
  },
  "1076800": {
    "ENU": "A fate, I believe, that will be bound by Justice. Thank you."
  },
  "1076801": {
    "ENU": "A friend of the defendant?"
  },
  "1076802": {
    "ENU": "A game played by politicians and liars (as though the two could be separate!)"
  },
  "1076803": {
    "ENU": "A man who fled to safety, never warning those left behind of the horrors following after him."
  },
  "1076804": {
    "ENU": "A man who's arrogance, who's unmitigated gall, who's foolhardy quest for glory and riches so infuriated the Ophidians that they poured war down upon us."
  },
  "1076805": {
    "ENU": "A thousand things contributed to this war - the Scion’s Zenith was just one of them."
  },
  "1076806": {
    "ENU": "A trial by fire burns the beast!"
  },
  "1076807": {
    "ENU": "Ah, *hic*, ah, yes Your Honor, I am present."
  },
  "1076808": {
    "ENU": "Ah, and could you tell me a little about Papua? Before the invasion, I mean."
  },
  "1076809": {
    "ENU": "Ah, hiccups, Your Honor, just a tad nervous."
  },
  "1076810": {
    "ENU": "Ah, well, then. Carry on."
  },
  "1076811": {
    "ENU": "Ah."
  },
  "1076812": {
    "ENU": "Aha! Did you hear that everyone!?"
  },
  "1076813": {
    "ENU": "All may be seated."
  },
  "1076814": {
    "ENU": "All rise!"
  },
  "1076815": {
    "ENU": "All rise! Hear ye, hear ye!"
  },
  "1076816": {
    "ENU": "All this was shattered one horrible morning... In a single instant everything she'd held dear was ripped away from her."
  },
  "1076817": {
    "ENU": "All those having anything to do before the Honorable Verina, Justice of the Court of Truth, draw near and attend."
  },
  "1076818": {
    "ENU": "Always a pleasure."
  },
  "1076819": {
    "ENU": "An army that would soon overwhelm Papua’s pitiful defenses, and march on towards our heartland."
  },
  "1076820": {
    "ENU": "And because that many other like Cases of Treason may happen in Time to come, which a Man cannot think nor declare at this present Time;"
  },
  "1076821": {
    "ENU": "And finally, ask thyself,  “If it were I in Ricardo’s place, how wouldst I wish to be treated?”"
  },
  "1076822": {
    "ENU": "And how have you defined this instance of High Treason?"
  },
  "1076823": {
    "ENU": "And we appreciate it. My lord, has the Royal Council considered the charges of treason against Ricardo?"
  },
  "1076824": {
    "ENU": "And ye were up in some tree looking down, is that right?"
  },
  "1076825": {
    "ENU": "And yes, my friends, this was well beyond the Kingdom’s borders."
  },
  "1076826": {
    "ENU": "And you just sat there?"
  },
  "1076827": {
    "ENU": "Are you familiar with the Scion’s Zenith?"
  },
  "1076828": {
    "ENU": "Art thou prepared to open?"
  },
  "1076829": {
    "ENU": "As is the Court. Didst thou have any further witnesses?"
  },
  "1076830": {
    "ENU": "Ask thineselves,  “Is it possible that an entire war could begin with the actions of just one man?”"
  },
  "1076831": {
    "ENU": "Ask thineselves, “Is it reasonable that a man should be put to death for committing a crime he couldst not know would harm another?\""
  },
  "1076832": {
    "ENU": "At any time."
  },
  "1076833": {
    "ENU": "Aye, ‘tis a beautiful little town, sitting on the shore surrounded by jungle."
  },
  "1076834": {
    "ENU": "Aye, that’s them."
  },
  "1076835": {
    "ENU": "Aye. Aye… Saw the innkeeper’s girl run into the old shipwright’s. She’d been in the weaponsmith’s - had something in her hand."
  },
  "1076836": {
    "ENU": "Bailiff! Escort this man from the building!"
  },
  "1076837": {
    "ENU": "Bailiff, take this man away."
  },
  "1076838": {
    "ENU": "Be patient. Continue Mr. Casca."
  },
  "1076839": {
    "ENU": "Be seated, please."
  },
  "1076840": {
    "ENU": "Be seated."
  },
  "1076841": {
    "ENU": "Beauregard of Trinsic, for the Defense."
  },
  "1076842": {
    "ENU": "Because they’re afraid you’ll discover the truth. And the truth is this:"
  },
  "1076843": {
    "ENU": "Both of my representatives have proven useless to me. Both were provided by the government, which also tries me."
  },
  "1076844": {
    "ENU": "Britannia lays claim to all of the Lost Lands."
  },
  "1076845": {
    "ENU": "Britannia versus Ricardo."
  },
  "1076846": {
    "ENU": "But I cannot."
  },
  "1076847": {
    "ENU": "But one thing I can tell you is the Truth."
  },
  "1076848": {
    "ENU": "But they were too fast. And then the big ‘uns, the ones with the blood-stained bardiches…"
  },
  "1076849": {
    "ENU": "But wait, I’m not… I’m f…"
  },
  "1076850": {
    "ENU": "But we cannot show mercy."
  },
  "1076851": {
    "ENU": "By the authority vested in the Royal Council, ruling pro-tempore, and by the Treason Act."
  },
  "1076852": {
    "ENU": "By what authority do you judge this crime High Treason?"
  },
  "1076853": {
    "ENU": "Can you truly say all that Ricardo has wrought is ill?"
  },
  "1076854": {
    "ENU": "Can you truly say that Ricardo has done nothing good for the Kingdom?"
  },
  "1076855": {
    "ENU": "Casca of Heartwood as the Plaintiff, representing the government of Britannia."
  },
  "1076856": {
    "ENU": "Claim? Do our laws extend to the Ophidians?"
  },
  "1076857": {
    "ENU": "Come! Stop! Go!"
  },
  "1076858": {
    "ENU": "Conspiracy, in the attempted assault upon a Kingdom prisoner transport unit."
  },
  "1076859": {
    "ENU": "Could the clerk please read the summary of findings?"
  },
  "1076860": {
    "ENU": "Could the clerk please read the various conditions for which High Treason is defined?"
  },
  "1076861": {
    "ENU": "Could you define the meaning?"
  },
  "1076862": {
    "ENU": "Could you tell me about what happened when the Ophidian army invaded your town?"
  },
  "1076863": {
    "ENU": "Court dismissed."
  },
  "1076864": {
    "ENU": "Court shall recess for one Britannian hour."
  },
  "1076865": {
    "ENU": "Court will recess for twenty Britannian minutes!"
  },
  "1076866": {
    "ENU": "Court will reconvene in one Britannian hour."
  },
  "1076867": {
    "ENU": "Decide his fate! Don’t be late! Kekeke."
  },
  "1076868": {
    "ENU": "Did I murder a Brood Queen at the behest of some noble in Britain? No."
  },
  "1076869": {
    "ENU": "Did I send wave after wave of invading marauders into the Ophidians lair seeking treasure? No."
  },
  "1076870": {
    "ENU": "Did we not turn over a replicated copy, which they readily accepted, convinced of its realness?"
  },
  "1076871": {
    "ENU": "Did we see the Ophidians withdraw after that peaceful move?"
  },
  "1076872": {
    "ENU": "Did you listen carefully? That’s right. They, the Royal Council, are allowed to define Treason however they wish."
  },
  "1076873": {
    "ENU": "Did you see anything while you were up there?"
  },
  "1076874": {
    "ENU": "Do you know where he got it?"
  },
  "1076875": {
    "ENU": "Does the Defense wish to accede?"
  },
  "1076876": {
    "ENU": "Dost thou wish to explain?"
  },
  "1076877": {
    "ENU": "Er, did Ricardo tell you where he obtained the crown?"
  },
  "1076878": {
    "ENU": "Er, well, yes Your Honor."
  },
  "1076879": {
    "ENU": "Er, yes, Your Honor."
  },
  "1076880": {
    "ENU": "Even after the so-called crime has been committed, as they have done to me."
  },
  "1076881": {
    "ENU": "Excuse me?"
  },
  "1076882": {
    "ENU": "Finally, I would like to call Luiz the Guard to the stand, who will testify concerning the assault on Ricardo’s transport earlier this month."
  },
  "1076883": {
    "ENU": "For the ramifications could be dire."
  },
  "1076884": {
    "ENU": "Forgive me, my friends, for this graphic rendition."
  },
  "1076885": {
    "ENU": "Forgive me, Your Honor."
  },
  "1076886": {
    "ENU": "Four, Kill any member of the Royal Court; or the Sovereign’s Justices; or the Royal Council while in the pursuit of their duties"
  },
  "1076887": {
    "ENU": "Fourth, that the theft of the Scion’s Zenith was an instigating factor in the sudden uprising of the Ophidians."
  },
  "1076888": {
    "ENU": "Friends, Britannians, Countrymen!"
  },
  "1076889": {
    "ENU": "Get this fool woman out of here!"
  },
  "1076890": {
    "ENU": "Good afternoon, Your Honor."
  },
  "1076891": {
    "ENU": "Good afternoon, Your Honor. Might I say Her Ladyship looketh well today?"
  },
  "1076892": {
    "ENU": "Good afternoon. The clerk shall announce counsel."
  },
  "1076893": {
    "ENU": "Guards!"
  },
  "1076894": {
    "ENU": "Guilty."
  },
  "1076895": {
    "ENU": "Has Ricardo’s crime met these conditions?"
  },
  "1076896": {
    "ENU": "Have you ever met this man, Ricardo?"
  },
  "1076897": {
    "ENU": "Have you reached a verdict on the charge?"
  },
  "1076898": {
    "ENU": "He committed a crime, and, through his negligence, compounded the crime in an incalculable way."
  },
  "1076899": {
    "ENU": "Heard it came from the snake people."
  },
  "1076900": {
    "ENU": "Hehehehe."
  },
  "1076901": {
    "ENU": "Her father was an innkeeper, and as such, she often had the opportunity to greet travelers and serve as a hostess for their visitors."
  },
  "1076902": {
    "ENU": "Here… alone, in shock, drenched in tears and sweat and blood, the poor girl hid."
  },
  "1076903": {
    "ENU": "Hey, Nick."
  },
  "1076904": {
    "ENU": "High Treason, for inciting the Ophidian War."
  },
  "1076905": {
    "ENU": "His actions have resulted in the deaths of thousands, and extraordinary loss to the Kingdom."
  },
  "1076906": {
    "ENU": "Hmm… Save for the serious nature of the charges I might have already ordered this case retried."
  },
  "1076907": {
    "ENU": "How are we to know it was not all a lie? A mere excuse?"
  },
  "1076908": {
    "ENU": "How can I have stolen something, when the Ophidians do not recognize our own laws?"
  },
  "1076909": {
    "ENU": "How could I, by myself, have incited a war when the \"crime\" I committed was so minor?"
  },
  "1076910": {
    "ENU": "How do you find the defendant?"
  },
  "1076911": {
    "ENU": "How so?"
  },
  "1076912": {
    "ENU": "How, ye may ask, might a man, a thief, in fact, be innocent?"
  },
  "1076913": {
    "ENU": "Hudson, are you from the town of Papua?"
  },
  "1076914": {
    "ENU": "I agree, Your Honor and…"
  },
  "1076915": {
    "ENU": "I am a necessary sacrifice. I am the scapegoat: the man who suffers their sins."
  },
  "1076916": {
    "ENU": "I am Francesco, Treasurer of the Royal Council. I am here representing their will today."
  },
  "1076917": {
    "ENU": "I am handing a copy of the Treason Act to the clerk at this time."
  },
  "1076918": {
    "ENU": "I cannot tell you. I doubt they will ever tell you."
  },
  "1076919": {
    "ENU": "I did, in fact, take the Scion’s Zenith from the Ophidians. Please notice I did not say “stole.”"
  },
  "1076920": {
    "ENU": "I did."
  },
  "1076921": {
    "ENU": "I do not understand the cunning ways of law, nor the subtleties of court."
  },
  "1076922": {
    "ENU": "I do, Your Honor."
  },
  "1076923": {
    "ENU": "I feel this would be an appropriate time to take a short break."
  },
  "1076924": {
    "ENU": "I got caught fencing some jewels. My testimony is part of the plea bargain."
  },
  "1076925": {
    "ENU": "I have always respected the great Britannian legal system. I have placed my trust in it."
  },
  "1076926": {
    "ENU": "I have received it."
  },
  "1076927": {
    "ENU": "I mean, please ask thyself that question, and consider this case most carefully."
  },
  "1076928": {
    "ENU": "I only wish to convey the horror this child must have endured in the darkness, while the screams of the dying echoed all around her."
  },
  "1076929": {
    "ENU": "I plead for my life, but, oh my friends, I plead more for Justice."
  },
  "1076930": {
    "ENU": "I remind the court that testimony given as part of a plea bargain is perfectly admissible."
  },
  "1076931": {
    "ENU": "I see. Still, we must arrange the representation of the defendant, or reconvene when Mr. Beauregard is in a position to fulfill his capacities."
  },
  "1076932": {
    "ENU": "I see. Who gave you that crown?"
  },
  "1076933": {
    "ENU": "I take stolen stuff and pass it on, or sell it to others."
  },
  "1076934": {
    "ENU": "I thought she’d hid good, was sure of it, hoped so at least. But then I saw one of them snakes sniffing around the door."
  },
  "1076935": {
    "ENU": "I want to tell you that she remained hidden and safe in that cellar."
  },
  "1076936": {
    "ENU": "I want to tell you that the Ophidians withdrew and returned to their lairs, content with their mayhem."
  },
  "1076937": {
    "ENU": "I would like to put forward a motion of no confidence in my Defense, Your Honor."
  },
  "1076938": {
    "ENU": "I yield the witness to my friend, Mr. Beauregard."
  },
  "1076939": {
    "ENU": "I’m done with this man."
  },
  "1076940": {
    "ENU": "I’m sorry?"
  },
  "1076941": {
    "ENU": "If a man slay a beast, even outside the Kingdom’s borders, can he not take whatever he finds?"
  },
  "1076942": {
    "ENU": "If it pleases the court, my defender seems to be drunk, as well."
  },
  "1076943": {
    "ENU": "Indeed, Your Honor, quite prepared!"
  },
  "1076944": {
    "ENU": "Indeed, Your Honor."
  },
  "1076945": {
    "ENU": "Indeed."
  },
  "1076946": {
    "ENU": "Indeed. So the Ophidians had no opposition?"
  },
  "1076947": {
    "ENU": "Innocent."
  },
  "1076948": {
    "ENU": "Instead they left their nation defenseless, and now, in their haste to cover their cowardice, they lay the blame on me."
  },
  "1076949": {
    "ENU": "Instead, the terrified child sought shelter in the depths of a dark cellar, hidden, as best she could, in the impossibly tight space between a few water barrels."
  },
  "1076950": {
    "ENU": "Inu the Crone, kidnapped off the streets of Britain, held against her will, this man saved her!"
  },
  "1076951": {
    "ENU": "Inu… the what? Who?"
  },
  "1076952": {
    "ENU": "Irregular, but I can allow it."
  },
  "1076953": {
    "ENU": "Is that all, Mr. Beauregard?"
  },
  "1076954": {
    "ENU": "Is that at issue? I did not…"
  },
  "1076955": {
    "ENU": "Is the Defense prepared?"
  },
  "1076956": {
    "ENU": "It cannot be argued that Ricardo stole the Scion’s Zenith, as we have written testimony that he has admitted it."
  },
  "1076957": {
    "ENU": "it is accorded, That if any other Case, supposed Treason, which is not above specified, doth happen before any Justices,"
  },
  "1076958": {
    "ENU": "It is my hope you will answer Justice this day with a resounding voice."
  },
  "1076959": {
    "ENU": "It was fast, that’s what it was."
  },
  "1076960": {
    "ENU": "It went in. It was in there for a long time, and then I heard a scream. It’d gotten pretty quiet by then."
  },
  "1076961": {
    "ENU": "Lacking any further witnesses, I call Mr. Casca to the stand."
  },
  "1076962": {
    "ENU": "Ladies and Gentlemen of the jury, I’d like to begin by telling you a story about a young girl named Liane."
  },
  "1076963": {
    "ENU": "Ladies and gentlemen, I am not a smart man, and definitely not a noble one."
  },
  "1076964": {
    "ENU": "Let the record show that Justice Edgar was the Investigating Magistrate for this trial."
  },
  "1076965": {
    "ENU": "Liane suffered that instant of agony alone, as she watched her father fall before her eyes, yet in all the carnage managed to escape meeting her family’s fate."
  },
  "1076966": {
    "ENU": "Liane was no exception."
  },
  "1076967": {
    "ENU": "Like I said, he told me he got it from the snakes."
  },
  "1076968": {
    "ENU": "Lord Francesco was kind to point out that strange and curious addition to the Treason Act."
  },
  "1076969": {
    "ENU": "Lord Francesco, could you introduce yourself briefly?"
  },
  "1076970": {
    "ENU": "Lord Francesco, please."
  },
  "1076971": {
    "ENU": "May the mercy of our True Sovereign be upon us."
  },
  "1076972": {
    "ENU": "Members of the jury shall remain seated, all else are free to go."
  },
  "1076973": {
    "ENU": "Met ‘em? We’re good buddies! Hey Ricardo!"
  },
  "1076974": {
    "ENU": "Mmhm… and you saw that snake heading towards her?"
  },
  "1076975": {
    "ENU": "Moving on. Mr. Casca?"
  },
  "1076976": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Beauregard had not even arranged any witnesses to testify on my behalf."
  },
  "1076977": {
    "ENU": "MR. BEAUREGARD!"
  },
  "1076978": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Beauregard, does this line of inquiry have a point?"
  },
  "1076979": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Beauregard?"
  },
  "1076980": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Casca, are the Ophidian lands under the control of the Britannian government?"
  },
  "1076981": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Casca, of the charges levied against me, which have you failed to demonstrate?"
  },
  "1076982": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Casca, thou mayest begin."
  },
  "1076983": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Casca, your next witness?"
  },
  "1076984": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Casca?"
  },
  "1076985": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Ricardo, dost thou feel that you canst more truly represent thyself than those who have been, or may be appointed in thine behalf?"
  },
  "1076986": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Ricardo, I doubt you comprehend the ramifications of representing thyself."
  },
  "1076987": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Ricardo, you are hereby remanded to the State for execution."
  },
  "1076988": {
    "ENU": "Mr. Ricardo? Thou understandeth that ye are in no position to dictate the course of this affair?"
  },
  "1076989": {
    "ENU": "My client is innocent!"
  },
  "1076990": {
    "ENU": "My defender seems to be asleep."
  },
  "1076991": {
    "ENU": "My friends, I walk amongst you as a stranger to your culture, and to your ways."
  },
  "1076992": {
    "ENU": "My friends, there is no body and there is, no, crime."
  },
  "1076993": {
    "ENU": "My people, the Elves of Heartwood, were long separated from our brethren the Britannians."
  },
  "1076994": {
    "ENU": "Never met her in my life, Your Honor. Although…"
  },
  "1076995": {
    "ENU": "No!"
  },
  "1076996": {
    "ENU": "No! Instead, we found them building machines of horrible power deep within the earth."
  },
  "1076997": {
    "ENU": "No, today, Justice cannot yield to mercy, even as Compassion was never shown to all those who paid the price for Ricardo’s crimes."
  },
  "1076998": {
    "ENU": "No, Your Honor."
  },
  "1076999": {
    "ENU": "No, Your Honor. Motion to delay?"
  },
  "1077000": {
    "ENU": "No, Your Honor. The Prosecution rests."
  },
  "1077001": {
    "ENU": "Nor the ones that destroyed the thousands of lives lost during the war."
  },
  "1077002": {
    "ENU": "Nothing further, Mr. Ricardo?"
  },
  "1077003": {
    "ENU": "Now this young lady was kind, generous, altogether virtuous, and quite beloved of the townspeople."
  },
  "1077004": {
    "ENU": "Objection noted. Please proceed."
  },
  "1077005": {
    "ENU": "Objection! Hearsay!"
  },
  "1077006": {
    "ENU": "Objection! Leading the witness!"
  },
  "1077007": {
    "ENU": "Objection, Your Honor!"
  },
  "1077008": {
    "ENU": "Oh no! We fought ‘em, we did. I had me trusty crossbow at me side."
  },
  "1077009": {
    "ENU": "Oh, well then, thank you."
  },
  "1077010": {
    "ENU": "Oh."
  },
  "1077011": {
    "ENU": "Oh? And why was that?"
  },
  "1077012": {
    "ENU": "On the charge of High Treason, how does the jury find the defendant?"
  },
  "1077013": {
    "ENU": "One moment it was quiet, the next the jungle was a full of ‘em. They were everywhere."
  },
  "1077014": {
    "ENU": "One moment Mr. Ricardo."
  },
  "1077015": {
    "ENU": "One, Compass or imagine the death of our lord the Sovereign; or the Sovereign’s companion; or their heir, or"
  },
  "1077016": {
    "ENU": "One, that Ricardo is the same Ricardo accused in the matter of this trial."
  },
  "1077017": {
    "ENU": "Order!"
  },
  "1077018": {
    "ENU": "Our only wish is that the jury carefully hear all the evidence presented from this point forward."
  },
  "1077019": {
    "ENU": "Overruled. That was for clarification. The witness may answer."
  },
  "1077020": {
    "ENU": "Please answer."
  },
  "1077021": {
    "ENU": "Please read it."
  },
  "1077022": {
    "ENU": "Proceed, but tread carefully Mr. Ricardo."
  },
  "1077023": {
    "ENU": "Proceed."
  },
  "1077024": {
    "ENU": "Proceed."
  },
  "1077025": {
    "ENU": "Ricardo did not wield the bardiche that cut short Liane’s life."
  },
  "1077026": {
    "ENU": "Ricardo."
  },
  "1077027": {
    "ENU": "Right, then."
  },
  "1077028": {
    "ENU": "Second, that Ricardo committed, and did in fact admit to, the theft of the Scion’s Zenith."
  },
  "1077029": {
    "ENU": "She lived with her family in a sleepy little village, and lived a humble yet blissful life."
  },
  "1077030": {
    "ENU": "Sir, may I inquire as to your profession?"
  },
  "1077031": {
    "ENU": "So noted."
  },
  "1077032": {
    "ENU": "So, it seemeth my friend Mr. Casca wisheth to establish a most sad tale of woe! Is that it, Hudson?"
  },
  "1077033": {
    "ENU": "Some may be confused by the elegant words you heard Lord Francesco speak. Please don’t be."
  },
  "1077034": {
    "ENU": "Someone help me catch her!"
  },
  "1077035": {
    "ENU": "Soon enough the guards were down, and the barriers around the town, they just weren’t working."
  },
  "1077036": {
    "ENU": "Soon we were all running for the shore – figured we could swim if we couldn’t get through the trees."
  },
  "1077037": {
    "ENU": "Stop! Stop I say!"
  },
  "1077038": {
    "ENU": "Sure. I’m a fence."
  },
  "1077039": {
    "ENU": "Sustained!"
  },
  "1077040": {
    "ENU": "Sustained."
  },
  "1077041": {
    "ENU": "Sustained. Mr. Beauregard, this man is not on trial. Change your line of questioning."
  },
  "1077042": {
    "ENU": "Tell me, then, did Ricardo not aid an old woman locked in a dungeon? Surely the Council is aware of this incident?"
  },
  "1077043": {
    "ENU": "Thank you Hudson."
  },
  "1077044": {
    "ENU": "Thank you, I’m finished."
  },
  "1077045": {
    "ENU": "Thank you, Lord Francesco."
  },
  "1077046": {
    "ENU": "Thank you, sir."
  },
  "1077047": {
    "ENU": "Thank you, Your Honor."
  },
  "1077048": {
    "ENU": "Thank you."
  },
  "1077049": {
    "ENU": "Thank you."
  },
  "1077050": {
    "ENU": "Thank you. Is there any additional text concerning the definition of High Treason?"
  },
  "1077051": {
    "ENU": "Thank you. Not bad for a thief, eh?"
  },
  "1077052": {
    "ENU": "Thank you. Your Honor, I call my next witness to the stand."
  },
  "1077053": {
    "ENU": "That man is Ricardo, the so-called legendary thief."
  },
  "1077054": {
    "ENU": "That man, ladies and gentlemen, is seated before us."
  },
  "1077055": {
    "ENU": "That their sole, and greatest duty, be that the Truth come forward, and upon that foundation a fate be determined."
  },
  "1077056": {
    "ENU": "That they decide only upon the facts of this case."
  },
  "1077057": {
    "ENU": "That trust tells me that you must act in accordance with those laws. I have laid them plainly before you."
  },
  "1077058": {
    "ENU": "That was acceptable."
  },
  "1077059": {
    "ENU": "That’s right."
  },
  "1077060": {
    "ENU": "That’s… it?"
  },
  "1077061": {
    "ENU": "That's immaterial - they're monsters."
  },
  "1077062": {
    "ENU": "The Act allows the Council to define new and specific instances of Treason."
  },
  "1077063": {
    "ENU": "The charge of Theft, at this point, may unduly influence the decision on the charge of Treason. Also, the charge of Conspiracy cannot be substantiated."
  },
  "1077064": {
    "ENU": "The clerk shall read the charges against the Defendant and report his pleas."
  },
  "1077065": {
    "ENU": "The conditions are not only met, but are exceeded."
  },
  "1077066": {
    "ENU": "The court finds the defendant guilty of High Treason."
  },
  "1077067": {
    "ENU": "The court finds the defendant innocent. Mr. Ricardo, you are free to go."
  },
  "1077068": {
    "ENU": "The court shall disregard, and the Defense will keep observations of the Court to themselves."
  },
  "1077069": {
    "ENU": "The crown thing? Sure. Broke it up for for the rares: gold, jewels, you know."
  },
  "1077070": {
    "ENU": "The Defendant will remain silent."
  },
  "1077071": {
    "ENU": "The Defendant, Ricardo, has pleaded Not Guilty to the following charges:"
  },
  "1077072": {
    "ENU": "The Defense shall refute the claims of the Prosecution, and prove, or at least provide some reasonable shred of doubt, that Ricardo is innocent of the crimes attributed him.",
    "PTB": "A Defesa irá refutar as alegações da Acusação, e provar, ou pelo menos fornecer alguma dúvida razoável, de que Ricardo é inocente dos crimes a ele atribuídos."
  },
  "1077073": {
    "ENU": "The findings are:",
    "PTB": "Os resultados são:"
  },
  "1077074": {
    "ENU": "The findings of the Investigating Magistrate are not a matter for debate. Continue.",
    "PTB": "Os resultados do Juiz Investigador não são matéria para debate. Continue."
  },
  "1077075": {
    "ENU": "The jury will disregard testimony concerning Inu the Crone - irrelevance.",
    "PTB": "O júri desconsiderará o testemunho sobre Inu, a Bruxa - irrelevância."
  },
  "1077076": {
    "ENU": "The jury will now decide the facts of this case, and render a verdict of Guilty or Innocent for the charge of High Treason.",
    "PTB": "O júri agora decidirá os fatos deste caso, e proferirá um veredicto de Culpado ou Inocente pela acusação de Alta Traição."
  },
  "1077077": {
    "ENU": "the Justices shall tarry without any going to Judgement of the Treason till the Cause be shewed and declared before the Sovereign and his Council,",
    "PTB": "os Juízes não devem tardar sem ir a Julgamento da Traição até que a Causa seja mostrada e declarada perante o Soberano e seu Conselho,"
  },
  "1077078": {
    "ENU": "The least I can be allowed is a chance to speak. Is this not fair?",
    "PTB": "O mínimo que posso ter é uma chance de falar. Não é justo?"
  },
  "1077079": {
    "ENU": "The magic ones, you know, that protect cities. All of ‘em have ‘em.",
    "PTB": "Os mágicos, sabe, aqueles que protegem as cidades. Todos eles têm."
  },
  "1077080": {
    "ENU": "The man you see sitting before thee is but a pitiful pawn in a game of chess.",
    "PTB": "O homem que você vê sentado diante de ti não passa de um peão lastimável em um jogo de xadrez."
  },
  "1077081": {
    "ENU": "The Ophidians and Terathans, you mean?",
    "PTB": "Os Ofidianos e Terathans, quer dizer?"
  },
  "1077082": {
    "ENU": "The Ophidians hunted down every man, woman, and child they could find in that city, and slaughtered them without mercy.",
    "PTB": "Os Ofidianos caçaram e massacraram sem piedade todos os homens, mulheres e crianças que puderam encontrar naquela cidade."
  },
  "1077083": {
    "ENU": "The People calls Hudson of Papua to the stand.",
    "PTB": "O Povo chama Hudson de Papua para depor."
  },
  "1077084": {
    "ENU": "The People calls Nicholas to the stand",
    "PTB": "O Povo chama Nicholas para depor."
  },
  "1077085": {
    "ENU": "The Prosecution has failed to establish a link between the assault on the prison transport and any conspiracy on the part of the defendant.",
    "PTB": "A Acusação não conseguiu estabelecer um vínculo entre o ataque ao transporte prisional e qualquer conspiração por parte do réu."
  },
  "1077086": {
    "ENU": "The Prosecution has failed, you see, to actually prove a crime was committed.",
    "PTB": "A Acusação falhou, veja, em realmente provar que um crime foi cometido."
  },
  "1077087": {
    "ENU": "The Prosecution has submitted its case to the court quite plainly.",
    "PTB": "A Acusação submeteu seu caso ao tribunal de forma bastante clara."
  },
  "1077088": {
    "ENU": "The Prosecution hath concluded its opening statement.",
    "PTB": "A Acusação concluiu sua declaração inicial."
  },
  "1077089": {
    "ENU": "The prosecution will show beyond any reasonable doubt that Ricardo’s theft of the Scion’s Zenith, an artifact of great importance to the Ophidians, was the direct cause of the war.",
    "PTB": "A acusação provará além de qualquer dúvida razoável que o roubo do Zenith do Scion por Ricardo, um artefato de grande importância para os Ofidianos, foi a causa direta da guerra."
  },
  "1077090": {
    "ENU": "The Prosecution wishes to dismiss the charges of Theft and Conspiracy against the defendant.",
    "PTB": "A Acusação deseja retirar as acusações de Roubo e Conspiração contra o réu."
  },
  "1077091": {
    "ENU": "The Prosecution wishes to submit the findings of Justice Edgar, juge d’instruction for this case, as People’s Exhibit the First.",
    "PTB": "A Acusação deseja submeter os resultados do Juiz Edgar, juiz de instrução deste caso, como Exibição do Povo Número Um."
  },
  "1077092": {
    "ENU": "The record does so show.",
    "PTB": "O registro assim mostra."
  },
  "1077093": {
    "ENU": "The record shows the findings as People’s Exhibit the First, and that Justice Edgar was the Investigating Magistrate for this trial.",
    "PTB": "O registro mostra os resultados como Exibição do Povo Número Um, e que o Juiz Edgar foi o Juiz Investigador deste julgamento."
  },
  "1077094": {
    "ENU": "The Royal Council has determined that the acts Ricardo committed amount to High Treason.",
    "PTB": "O Conselho Real determinou que os atos cometidos por Ricardo equivalem a Alta Traição."
  },
  "1077095": {
    "ENU": "Theft, namely of a foreign national treasure.",
    "PTB": "Roubo, nomeadamente de um tesouro nacional estrangeiro."
  },
  "1077096": {
    "ENU": "Then thou mayest proceed.",
    "PTB": "Então tu podes prosseguir."
  },
  "1077097": {
    "ENU": "Then we will proceed to closing statements. Mr. Casca?",
    "PTB": "Então passaremos às declarações finais. Sr. Casca?"
  },
  "1077098": {
    "ENU": "They do not, for they cannot.",
    "PTB": "Eles não podem, pois não podem."
  },
  "1077099": {
    "ENU": "They submit to you, as do I, as does Britannia herself, that Ricardo’s actions resulted in the needless deaths of thousands.",
    "PTB": "Eles submetem a você, como eu, como a própria Britannia, que as ações de Ricardo resultaram em mortes desnecessárias de milhares."
  },
  "1077100": {
    "ENU": "They were all over the docks, so I climbed a tree. Turned out they never found me up there.",
    "PTB": "Eles estavam por toda parte no cais, então eu subi em uma árvore. Resultou que eles nunca me encontraram lá em cima."
  },
  "1077101": {
    "ENU": "Third, that a band of brigands did assault the transport carriage of Ricardo during his relocation to Yew.",
    "PTB": "Terceiro, que um bando de bandidos atacou o carruagem de transporte de Ricardo durante sua realocação para Yew."
  },
  "1077102": {
    "ENU": "This court is now in session. Please be seated.",
    "PTB": "Este tribunal está agora em sessão. Por favor, sentem-se."
  },
  "1077103": {
    "ENU": "This court is now open for the trial of criminal cases with and without jury.",
    "PTB": "Este tribunal está agora aberto para julgamentos de casos criminais com e sem júri."
  },
  "1077104": {
    "ENU": "This government has given itself the power to destroy any one of us by simply rewriting laws.",
    "PTB": "Este governo se deu o poder de destruir qualquer um de nós simplesmente reescrevendo leis."
  },
  "1077105": {
    "ENU": "This has also been corroborated by a witness who had personal dealings with Ricardo.",
    "PTB": "Isso também foi corroborado por uma testemunha que teve negócios pessoais com Ricardo."
  },
  "1077106": {
    "ENU": "This is the Court of Truth, Mr. Ricardo, dost thou so swear?",
    "PTB": "Este é o Tribunal da Verdade, Sr. Ricardo, juras isso?"
  },
  "1077107": {
    "ENU": "This is unfortunate, dost thou have any further witnesses?",
    "PTB": "Isso é infeliz, tens alguma outra testemunha?"
  },
  "1077108": {
    "ENU": "Those snakes and spiders, ya ‘know, the monsters.",
    "PTB": "Aquelas cobras e aranhas, sabe, os monstros."
  },
  "1077109": {
    "ENU": "Thou mayest do so.",
    "PTB": "Tu podes fazê-lo."
  },
  "1077110": {
    "ENU": "Three, Counterfeit the Royal Seal; or any of the Sovereign’s money, or",
    "PTB": "Três, Falsificar o Selo Real; ou qualquer dinheiro do Soberano,"
  },
  "1077111": {
    "ENU": "Two, Levy war against the Sovereign in their Realm; or adhere to the Sovereign’s enemies in their Realm; giving them aid or comfort in their Realm or elsewhere, or",
    "PTB": "Dois, Levantar guerra contra o Soberano em seu Reino; ou aderir aos inimigos do Soberano em seu Reino; dando-lhes ajuda ou conforto em seu Reino ou em outro lugar,"
  },
  "1077112": {
    "ENU": "Ah, Your Honor, I believe he is referring to Ricardo picking a lock for some mercenaries.",
    "PTB": "Ah, Vossa Excelência, acredito que ele está se referindo a Ricardo abrindo uma fechadura para alguns mercenários."
  },
  "1077113": {
    "ENU": "Very well, and again, good afternoon to you all.",
    "PTB": "Muito bem, e novamente, boa tarde a todos."
  },
  "1077114": {
    "ENU": "Very well, let the record show that we hath concluded opening statements.",
    "PTB": "Muito bem, que o registro mostre que concluímos as declarações iniciais."
  },
  "1077115": {
    "ENU": "Very well, the charges of Theft and Conspiracy are hereby dropped.",
    "PTB": "Muito bem, as acusações de Roubo e Conspiração são hereby retiradas."
  },
  "1077116": {
    "ENU": "Wait, is this the same woman who just willfully obstructed the court?",
    "PTB": "Espera, esta é a mesma mulher que acabou de obstruir deliberadamente o tribunal?"
  },
  "1077117": {
    "ENU": "We define this instance as: \"A willful act that results in great loss of life and property.\"",
    "PTB": "Definimos esta instância como: \"Um ato deliberado que resulta em grande perda de vidas e propriedades.\""
  },
  "1077118": {
    "ENU": "We have.",
    "PTB": "Nós temos."
  },
  "1077119": {
    "ENU": "We judge his crime Treason most High.",
    "PTB": "Nós julgamos seu crime como Alta Traição."
  },
  "1077120": {
    "ENU": "We will further show that Ricardo, in doing so, invoked a war upon our shores like none seen in recent memory.",
    "PTB": "Mostraremos ainda que Ricardo, ao fazê-lo, invocou uma guerra em nossas costas como nenhuma vista em memória recente."
  },
  "1077121": {
    "ENU": "We will justify our call for the maximum penalty. This was a crime committed against all Britannia.",
    "PTB": "Justificaremos nossa chamada pela pena máxima. Este foi um crime cometido contra toda Britannia."
  },
  "1077122": {
    "ENU": "We will prove that Ricardo has committed High Treason, and we will demonstrate the law to which he will be held.",
    "PTB": "Provaremos que Ricardo cometeu Alta Traição, e demonstraremos a lei à qual ele será submetido."
  },
  "1077123": {
    "ENU": "We’d had our fair share of trouble with the neighbors, but it’d been right calm since we’d become a part of the Kingdom proper.",
    "PTB": "Tínhamos tido nossa justa parte de problemas com os vizinhos, mas estava bem calmo desde que nos tornamos parte do Reino propriamente dito."
  },
  "1077124": {
    "ENU": "Well I shall tell thee!",
    "PTB": "Bem, eu te direi!"
  },
  "1077125": {
    "ENU": "Well, well… well. So… you saw this scared, little, child of a girl run into this building all by herself?",
    "PTB": "Bem, bem... bem. Então... você viu essa menina assustada, pequena, correndo para dentro deste prédio completamente sozinha?"
  },
  "1077126": {
    "ENU": "What happened then?",
    "PTB": "O que aconteceu então?"
  },
  "1077127": {
    "ENU": "What happened then?",
    "PTB": "O que aconteceu então?"
  },
  "1077128": {
    "ENU": "What of this “blackrock” then? These strange magics and a rogue Ophidian queen?",
    "PTB": "O que há sobre esse \"pedra negra\" então? Essas magias estranhas e uma rainha Ofidiana rebelde?"
  },
  "1077129": {
    "ENU": "What the government of Britannia wishes is for me to die, not to receive Justice.",
    "PTB": "O que o governo de Britannia deseja é que eu morra, não receber Justiça."
  },
  "1077130": {
    "ENU": "What the jury must decide, though, is the validity of the Kingdom’s complaint.",
    "PTB": "O que o júri deve decidir, no entanto, é a validade da queixa do Reino."
  },
  "1077131": {
    "ENU": "What?",
    "PTB": "O quê?"
  },
  "1077132": {
    "ENU": "When you say barriers…",
    "PTB": "Quando você diz barreiras..."
  },
  "1077133": {
    "ENU": "When you say neighbors, whom do you mean?",
    "PTB": "Quando você diz vizinhos, a quem se refere?"
  },
  "1077134": {
    "ENU": "Where, I ask, was this vaunted Royal Council, that so easily passes judgment, in our time of need?",
    "PTB": "Onde, pergunto, estava esse vaunted Conselho Real, que tão facilmente passa julgamento, em nosso momento de necessidade?"
  },
  "1077135": {
    "ENU": "Where, I ask, were the mages to protect the barriers around our cities?",
    "PTB": "Onde, pergunto, estavam os magos para proteger as barreiras ao redor de nossas cidades?"
  },
  "1077136": {
    "ENU": "Where, I ask, were the soldiers when Papua was attacked?",
    "PTB": "Onde, pergunto, estavam os soldados quando Papua foi atacada?"
  },
  "1077137": {
    "ENU": "whether it ought to be judged Treason or other Felony.",
    "PTB": "se deve ser julgado como Traição ou outro Crime."
  },
  "1077138": {
    "ENU": "Which incident is that?",
    "PTB": "Qual incidente é esse?"
  },
  "1077139": {
    "ENU": "Wholeheartedly.",
    "PTB": "Inteiramente."
  },
  "1077140": {
    "ENU": "Why aren’t questions being asked?",
    "PTB": "Por que não estão sendo feitas perguntas?"
  },
  "1077141": {
    "ENU": "Why art thou here, Nick?",
    "PTB": "Por que estás aqui, Nick?"
  },
  "1077142": {
    "ENU": "Why, the door behind which Inu the Crone lay prisoner!",
    "PTB": "Por que, a porta atrás da qual Inu, a Bruxa, estava prisioneira!"
  },
  "1077143": {
    "ENU": "Would the jury foreman please stand.",
    "PTB": "O foreman do júri, por favor, levante-se."
  },
  "1077144": {
    "ENU": "Yes sir, I am. What’s left of it at least.",
    "PTB": "Sim, senhor, estou. O que resta dele, pelo menos."
  },
  "1077145": {
    "ENU": "Yes, there is a specific clause extending the definition.",
    "PTB": "Sim, há uma cláusula específica estendendo a definição."
  },
  "1077146": {
    "ENU": "Yes, Your Honor!",
    "PTB": "Sim, Vossa Excelência!"
  },
  "1077147": {
    "ENU": "Yes, Your Honor, just a moment more.",
    "PTB": "Sim, Vossa Excelência, só mais um momento."
  },
  "1077148": {
    "ENU": "Yes, Your Honor, unless I were to represent myself before the court.",
    "PTB": "Sim, Vossa Excelência, a menos que eu me representasse perante o tribunal."
  },
  "1077149": {
    "ENU": "Yes, Your Honor.",
    "PTB": "Sim, Vossa Excelência."
  },
  "1077150": {
    "ENU": "Yes.",
    "PTB": "Sim."
  },
  "1077151": {
    "ENU": "Yes?",
    "PTB": "Sim?"
  },
  "1077152": {
    "ENU": "Yet here I stand now, a citizen, yearning to do Justice by the laws and codes that have built our great society.",
    "PTB": "Ainda assim, aqui estou, um cidadão, ansiando por fazer Justiça pelas leis e códigos que construíram nossa grande sociedade."
  },
  "1077153": {
    "ENU": "Yet, you see my friends, Liane died under an Ophidian's blade, true! But it was a Man who sealed her fate.",
    "PTB": "Ainda, vocês veem, meus amigos, Liane morreu sob a lâmina de um Ofidiano, verdade! Mas foi um Homem que selou seu destino."
  },
  "1077154": {
    "ENU": "You can’t stop fate! They come! Oh they come!"
  },
  "1077155": {
    "ENU": "You sat there, armed with a crossbow, and watched a girl get killed, doing nothing?!"
  },
  "1077156": {
    "ENU": "You see, ladies and gentlemen, Liane lived in Papua, a territory of Britannia in the Lost Lands, and the first city to suffer under the sudden onslaught of the Ophidian army."
  },
  "1077157": {
    "ENU": "You there! Halt!"
  },
  "1077158": {
    "ENU": "Your Hon…"
  },
  "1077159": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor!"
  },
  "1077160": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor! Calls for speculation on the part of the witness! On my part!"
  },
  "1077161": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor! My client hath done none of these things!"
  },
  "1077162": {
    "ENU": "YOUR HONOR! Please!"
  },
  "1077163": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor! Speculation!"
  },
  "1077164": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, from the moment I entered the custody of the courts I've had no chance of defending myself."
  },
  "1077165": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, I object to this, and…"
  },
  "1077166": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, I…"
  },
  "1077167": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, my witness seems to be absent."
  },
  "1077168": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, surely Mr. Casca is an expert in his field and capable of evaluating his own case?"
  },
  "1077169": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, surely you will not…?"
  },
  "1077170": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, the Prosecution is most distressed by the behavior of the Defense."
  },
  "1077171": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor, the Prosecution would like to submit People’s Exhibit the Second at this time."
  },
  "1077172": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor?"
  },
  "1077173": {
    "ENU": "Your Honor? Objection?"
  },
  "1077174": {
    "ENU": "Your witness, sir."
  },
  "1077175": {
    "ENU": "Your…!"
  },
  "1077176": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1077177": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1077178": {
    "ENU": "[WARNING: Spoilers ahead. Er, whoops.]"
  },
  "1077179": {
    "ENU": "You are infused with the intense energy of this area."
  },
  "1077180": {
    "ENU": "You uncover a small piece of blackrock!"
  },
  "1077181": {
    "ENU": "You unearth a large piece of blackrock!"
  },
  "1077182": {
    "ENU": "Your backpack is too full, and it falls to the ground."
  },
  "1077183": {
    "ENU": "You carefully place it in your backpack."
  },
  "1077184": {
    "ENU": "You can't seem to find any blackrock..."
  },
  "1077185": {
    "ENU": "a gavel"
  },
  "1077186": {
    "ENU": "a timepiece"
  },
  "1077187": {
    "ENU": "Please remember to leave thy weapons behind when entering the court building."
  },
  "1077188": {
    "ENU": "We shall gladly accomodate all those who needst store their weapons."
  },
  "1077189": {
    "ENU": "Remember: No weapons are allowed inside the building. Please speak with me if ye wisheth to store them."
  },
  "1077190": {
    "ENU": "Enter Courtroom"
  },
  "1077191": {
    "ENU": "Leave Courtroom"
  },
  "1077192": {
    "ENU": "Speak with me before entering the courtroom."
  },
  "1077193": {
    "ENU": "The courtroom is full. You might want to try again later."
  },
  "1077194": {
    "ENU": "There's no room left. You'll have to wait for an opening."
  },
  "1077195": {
    "ENU": "This area is offlimits."
  },
  "1077196": {
    "ENU": "You may not enter this area."
  },
  "1077197": {
    "ENU": "Weapons are not allowed in this building. A banker is available outside to assist you."
  },
  "1077198": {
    "ENU": "Weapons are prohibited. Please see the banker outside."
  },
  "1077199": {
    "ENU": "Hold tight!"
  },
  "1077200": {
    "ENU": "I shall defend thee to the bitter end!"
  },
  "1077201": {
    "ENU": "I'm sure you will."
  },
  "1077202": {
    "ENU": "Well spoken, Mr. Casca."
  },
  "1077203": {
    "ENU": "That was most impressive, sir."
  },
  "1077204": {
    "ENU": "Oh, please don't be impressed."
  },
  "1077205": {
    "ENU": "Just take it in your heart to remember those who've gone on ahead of us."
  },
  "1077206": {
    "ENU": "Oh, ah, yes, yes of course."
  },
  "1077207": {
    "ENU": "Sit down."
  },
  "1077208": {
    "ENU": "We'll 'ave our eyes on ye the whole time."
  },
  "1077209": {
    "ENU": "Gentlemen."
  },
  "1077210": {
    "ENU": "Sir."
  },
  "1077211": {
    "ENU": "Good morning, Mr. Ricardo"
  },
  "1077212": {
    "ENU": "Mornin', Kyle."
  },
  "1077213": {
    "ENU": "*smirks*"
  },
  "1077214": {
    "ENU": "Have no worries, sirrah. I hath rarely lost a case!"
  },
  "1077215": {
    "ENU": "Meh, what's the worst they could do?"
  },
  "1077216": {
    "ENU": "Ah, aha. Most brave! Well said."
  },
  "1077217": {
    "ENU": "No!"
  },
  "1077218": {
    "ENU": "Ahem."
  },
  "1077219": {
    "ENU": "Justice Verina: ~1_TEXT~"
  },
  "1077220": {
    "ENU": "Beauregard: ~1_TEXT~"
  },
  "1077221": {
    "ENU": "Casca: ~1_TEXT~"
