  "1077232": {
    "ENU": "Get down from there!"
  },
  "1077233": {
    "ENU": "Gotcha!"
  },
  "1077234": {
    "ENU": "What the devil was that all about?"
  },
  "1077235": {
    "ENU": "I've no idea."
  },
  "1077236": {
    "ENU": "What an interesting woman."
  },
  "1077237": {
    "ENU": "*vomits*"
  },
  "1077238": {
    "ENU": "Blacksmithing"
  },
  "1077239": {
    "ENU": "Detect Hidden"
  },
  "1077240": {
    "ENU": "Two Tails"
  },
  "1077241": {
    "ENU": "Moustache"
  },
  "1077242": {
    "ENU": "Warrior"
  },
  "1077243": {
    "ENU": "Arcanist"
  },
  "1077244": {
    "ENU": "Animal Tamer"
  },
  "1077245": {
    "ENU": "Craftsman"
  },
  "1077246": {
    "ENU": "Custom"
  },
  "1077247": {
    "ENU": "Please stable thy pets before entering the court."
  },
  "1077248": {
    "ENU": "If thou needest stable thy pet, I can assist thee."
  },
  "1077249": {
    "ENU": "Pets are not allowed within the Court of Truth. Please stable them here."
  },
  "1077250": {
    "ENU": "No pets permitted beyond this point."
  },
  "1077251": {
    "ENU": "Thou canst not bring thy pet into the courtroom. Please stable it."
  },
  "1077252": {
    "ENU": "You must dismount before proceeding."
  },
  "1077253": {
    "ENU": "Would you like to volunteer to be a juror for this trial?"
  },
  "1077254": {
    "ENU": "Excellent. We'd like to ask you some questions first."
  },
  "1077255": {
    "ENU": "Are you an acquaintance of the defendant, Ricardo?"
  },
  "1077256": {
    "ENU": "Are you a current or former resident of Papua, Vesper, Serpent's Hold, or Skara Brae?"
  },
  "1077257": {
    "ENU": "Will you decide that Ricardo is:"
  },
  "1077258": {
    "ENU": "Undecided"
  },
  "1077259": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for volunteering!"
  },
  "1077260": {
    "ENU": "However, we won't be needing you for this trial."
  },
  "1077261": {
    "ENU": "You've been selected as a juror for this trial! Please stay in your seat until the trial begins."
  },
  "1077262": {
    "ENU": "If you leave, you will be dismissed from the jury."
  },
  "1077263": {
    "ENU": "You have two minutes to cast your vote."
  },
  "1077264": {
    "ENU": "Please use the ballot box on the table."
  },
  "1077265": {
    "ENU": "Abstain"
  },
  "1077266": {
    "ENU": "The results are:"
  },
  "1077267": {
    "ENU": "Innocent: ~1_RESULT~"
  },
  "1077268": {
    "ENU": "Guilty: ~1_RESULT~"
  },
  "1077269": {
    "ENU": "Abstaining: ~1_RESULT~"
  },
  "1077270": {
    "ENU": "<center><b>Courtroom Rules</b><br>You must stay in your seat<br>No talking<br>No pets<br>No weapons<br>No magic<br>No sleeping (If you log out, you'll be removed)<br><br>To leave the courtroom, single click yourself and choose \"Leave Courtroom\" from the context menu.</center>"
  },
  "1077271": {
    "ENU": "I'm... I'm so sorry..."
  },
  "1077272": {
    "ENU": "For what it's worth, thank you."
  },
  "1077273": {
    "ENU": "That was magnificent, Mr. Ricardo!"
  },
  "1077274": {
    "ENU": "Why thank you... Lilian was it?"
  },
  "1077275": {
    "ENU": "Doing anything tonight?"
  },
  "1077276": {
    "ENU": "Well then, gentlemen, shall we go?"
  },
  "1077277": {
    "ENU": "Shall we be going then?"
  },
  "1077278": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1077279": {
    "ENU": "*adjusts something*"
  },
  "1077280": {
    "ENU": "*flips switch*"
  },
  "1077281": {
    "ENU": "*jiggles a piece of machinery*"
  },
  "1077282": {
    "ENU": "*kicks the machine*"
  },
  "1077283": {
    "ENU": "*tightens a loose part*"
  },
  "1077284": {
    "ENU": "*whack*"
  },
  "1077285": {
    "ENU": "A timely demise."
  },
  "1077286": {
    "ENU": "After him! Someone!"
  },
  "1077287": {
    "ENU": "Ah, er, no worries now folks! Let's try that again."
  },
  "1077288": {
    "ENU": "Ah, I didst not think of that, master"
  },
  "1077289": {
    "ENU": "Ah, well, actions speak louder than words, no?"
  },
  "1077290": {
    "ENU": "Argh!"
  },
  "1077291": {
    "ENU": "Arghhhh!"
  },
  "1077292": {
    "ENU": "Behind you..."
  },
  "1077293": {
    "ENU": "Bet Wis Ex!"
  },
  "1077294": {
    "ENU": "Boy! It's time!"
  },
  "1077295": {
    "ENU": "But. There's nothing past here."
  },
  "1077296": {
    "ENU": "Call me Hawkwind."
  },
  "1077297": {
    "ENU": "Curious. The humans are at play again."
  },
  "1077298": {
    "ENU": "Did anyone feel that?"
  },
  "1077299": {
    "ENU": "Did you double check the figures?"
  },
  "1077300": {
    "ENU": "Did you seal the resonance chamber?"
  },
  "1077301": {
    "ENU": "Did you set down all the runes?"
  },
  "1077302": {
    "ENU": "Didst ye hear that, all? Go on about and explore - we needst some time to prepare a way back"
  },
  "1077303": {
    "ENU": "Die."
  },
  "1077304": {
    "ENU": "Don't go! Oh! It's... *sighs*"
  },
  "1077305": {
    "ENU": "Er, no, master"
  },
  "1077306": {
    "ENU": "Everyone, back away!"
  },
  "1077307": {
    "ENU": "Excuse me? Who art thou?"
  },
  "1077308": {
    "ENU": "Excuse us, 'tis difficult to concentrate"
  },
  "1077309": {
    "ENU": "Forgive me, dear, I must be off"
  },
  "1077310": {
    "ENU": "Friends, I give you..."
  },
  "1077311": {
    "ENU": "From yesterday."
  },
  "1077312": {
    "ENU": "Ghosts!"
  },
  "1077313": {
    "ENU": "Good, now, let's tune this thing and get out of..."
  },
  "1077314": {
    "ENU": "Good."
  },
  "1077315": {
    "ENU": "He dies in his own element."
  },
  "1077316": {
    "ENU": "Hmm, yes. Send everyone off for a bit, I need to think."
  },
  "1077317": {
    "ENU": "Hop to it then, boy!"
  },
  "1077318": {
    "ENU": "How amusing."
  },
  "1077319": {
    "ENU": "Hrm, ah, erm..."
  },
  "1077320": {
    "ENU": "Hurry up then!"
  },
  "1077321": {
    "ENU": "I cannot die any more than you can!"
  },
  "1077322": {
    "ENU": "I postulate that every single piece of blackrock in the world will be made known unto us!"
  },
  "1077323": {
    "ENU": "I will then cast a simple spell of locating, thinking of blackrock..."
  },
  "1077324": {
    "ENU": "Imagine it! Soon, we'll be able to gather all of the blackrock we want and..."
  },
  "1077325": {
    "ENU": "Interference?"
  },
  "1077326": {
    "ENU": "Ironic."
  },
  "1077327": {
    "ENU": "Is it really Moonglow?"
  },
  "1077328": {
    "ENU": "Is this it, then?"
  },
  "1077329": {
    "ENU": "It is with great pride that I stand before you today"
  },
  "1077330": {
    "ENU": "It's... there's nothing there!"
  },
  "1077331": {
    "ENU": "Kronos!"
  },
  "1077332": {
    "ENU": "Kronos?"
  },
  "1077333": {
    "ENU": "Ladies and gentlemen!"
  },
  "1077334": {
    "ENU": "Let us go amongst them."
  },
  "1077335": {
    "ENU": "Mage! Get me out of here!"
  },
  "1077336": {
    "ENU": "Master!"
  },
  "1077337": {
    "ENU": "Master! Hold on!"
  },
  "1077338": {
    "ENU": "Master, by the virtues, what is this?"
  },
  "1077339": {
    "ENU": "Master?"
  },
  "1077340": {
    "ENU": "Master...?"
  },
  "1077341": {
    "ENU": "His body..."
  },
  "1077342": {
    "ENU": "Melissa! Didst anyone see her?"
  },
  "1077343": {
    "ENU": "Melissa?"
  },
  "1077344": {
    "ENU": "No. No, I think they're... us."
  },
  "1077345": {
    "ENU": "Not to act upon the blackrock, but to use the blackrock to act upon something else!"
  },
  "1077346": {
    "ENU": "Now hurry on! We'll talk later!"
  },
  "1077347": {
    "ENU": "Now, now hold on a moment!"
  },
  "1077348": {
    "ENU": "Of course, master"
  },
  "1077349": {
    "ENU": "Oh! So this is how I look from the behind"
  },
  "1077350": {
    "ENU": "Perish."
  },
  "1077351": {
    "ENU": "Remember! Come back tomorrow!"
  },
  "1077352": {
    "ENU": "Right! Well... folks, we seem to be having some... minor difficulties"
  },
  "1077353": {
    "ENU": "Runnnn!"
  },
  "1077354": {
    "ENU": "Shall we wait?"
  },
  "1077355": {
    "ENU": "So, darling, canst thou get us out of here?"
  },
  "1077356": {
    "ENU": "Something's wrong"
  },
  "1077357": {
    "ENU": "Soon, we'll be able to focus intense magical energy in a small confined space"
  },
  "1077358": {
    "ENU": "Sorry, we're rather busy"
  },
  "1077359": {
    "ENU": "Stay away! Back away I said!"
  },
  "1077360": {
    "ENU": "Suffer."
  },
  "1077361": {
    "ENU": "Thank you all for being so patient"
  },
  "1077362": {
    "ENU": "Thank you, my dear"
  },
  "1077363": {
    "ENU": "The ethereal resonance generator!"
  },
  "1077364": {
    "ENU": "These... apparitions. They be not ghosts at all, be they master?"
  },
  "1077365": {
    "ENU": "They're, they're gone."
  },
  "1077366": {
    "ENU": "This is so exciting, you're absolutely amazing"
  },
  "1077367": {
    "ENU": "This special device allows me to use blackrock as a focii"
  },
  "1077368": {
    "ENU": "This, this is the culmination of weeks of research!"
  },
  "1077369": {
    "ENU": "Thou hast done it master! A rift!"
  },
  "1077370": {
    "ENU": "Uh..."
  },
  "1077371": {
    "ENU": "Very sorry master, what dost thou suppose happened?"
  },
  "1077372": {
    "ENU": "Welcome, once more! To our great experiment!"
  },
  "1077373": {
    "ENU": "We'll be just a minute folks"
  },
  "1077374": {
    "ENU": "Well then get to it!"
  },
  "1077375": {
    "ENU": "Well wait now! Come back tomorrow! It'll work tomorrow!"
  },
  "1077376": {
    "ENU": "Well, without further ado..."
  },
  "1077377": {
    "ENU": "What do you want?"
  },
  "1077378": {
    "ENU": "What happened here?"
  },
  "1077379": {
    "ENU": "What on..."
  },
  "1077380": {
    "ENU": "What?"
  },
  "1077381": {
    "ENU": "Who are you!?"
  },
  "1077382": {
    "ENU": "Yes master, of course"
  },
  "1077383": {
    "ENU": "Yes, master"
  },
  "1077384": {
    "ENU": "Yes, that's right, I can use the strange properties of blackrock itself"
  },
  "1077385": {
    "ENU": "Yes."
  },
  "1077386": {
    "ENU": "You again."
  },
  "1077387": {
    "ENU": "You feel as if you could eat as much as you wanted!"
  },
  "1077388": {
    "ENU": "ARRGH! My tooth hurts sooo much!"
  },
  "1077389": {
    "ENU": "You just can't find a good Britannian dentist these days..."
  },
  "1077390": {
    "ENU": "My teeth!"
  },
  "1077391": {
    "ENU": "MAKE IT STOP!"
  },
  "1077392": {
    "ENU": "AAAH! It feels like someone kicked me in the teeth!"
  },
  "1077393": {
    "ENU": "The extreme pain in your teeth subsides."
  },
  "1077394": {
    "ENU": "a Gingerbread House Deed"
  },
  "1077395": {
    "ENU": "Gingerbread House"
  },
  "1077396": {
    "ENU": "Noooo!"
  },
  "1077397": {
    "ENU": "Please don't eat me... *whimper*"
  },
  "1077398": {
    "ENU": "Please don't eat me... *whimper*"
  },
