  "1077441": {
    "ENU": "Book of Truth?"
  },
  "1077442": {
    "ENU": "The Redeemer"
  },
  "1077443": {
    "ENU": "The Book of Truth has been stolen! 'Tis said that the dark entities from beyond our world are behind this evil deed, and to keep us from finding it, they've made lots of copies. My twin sister and I have made a pledge to help return the book to safety, but I'm afraid that we wouldn't be very useful in the dungeons. We're going to help Mistress Menzzobaanea examine any of the copies that you can bring us, and I promise to give you a small reward for each one that you bring to me. "
  },
  "1077444": {
    "ENU": "Veracity's Treasure Box"
  },
  "1077445": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for responding to our call for help. As you know, dark entities from beyond our world have stolen the Book of Truth. To keep us from finding the book, they have created thousands of false books, which are carried by the denizens of dungeons Covetous, Deceit, Despise, Destard, Hythloth, Shame and Wrong. Return 25 of these copies to me, and I shall reward you with a sword unlike any other in the lands. "
  },
  "1077446": {
    "ENU": "Please help us find the real Book of Truth! Awful dark entities from beyond our world have stolen it, made fake copies and spread them all over the dungeons. Bring me 10 of these books, and I'll give you a rare music box gear that has been in my family for generations. Won't you please help us find the real Book of Truth?"
  },
  "1077447": {
    "ENU": "Veritae's Music Box Gear"
  },
  "1077448": {
    "ENU": "Due to prior manufacturing defects introduced by our good for nothing elves, we have put a replacement gingerbread house deed in your backpack. The elves sincerely apologize for their mistake, and promise to be good from now on."
  },
  "1077449": {
    "ENU": "Due to prior manufacturing defects introduced by our good for nothing elves, we have put a replacement gingerbread house deed in your bank box. The elves sincerely apologize for their mistake, and promise to be good from now on."
  },
  "1077450": {
    "ENU": "Veracity's Plea"
  },
  "1077451": {
    "ENU": "Truth and Redemption"
  },
  "1077452": {
    "ENU": "Veritae's Plea"
  },
  "1077453": {
    "ENU": "The Wanderer"
  },
  "1077454": {
    "ENU": "Thank You, Brave Adventurer! We really appreciate your help! As promised, I have a reward for you."
  },
  "1077455": {
    "ENU": "Thou hast already begun collecting books for someone else."
  },
  "1077456": {
    "ENU": "Pearl Necklace"
  },
  "1077457": {
    "ENU": "Unused"
  },
  "1077458": {
    "ENU": "I'm not interested in giving you an another offer so soon after you turned in an order. Try again later."
