  },
  "1079026": {
    "ENU": "Invalid entry.  Try again and enter only a single number (in seconds):"
  },
  "1079027": {
    "ENU": "*draws a card*"
  },
  "1079028": {
    "ENU": "*idly shuffles the deck*"
  },
  "1079029": {
    "ENU": "*looks up from his cards*"
  },
  "1079030": {
    "ENU": "*places the card on the table*"
  },
  "1079031": {
    "ENU": "*taps the card*"
  },
  "1079032": {
    "ENU": "*waves*"
  },
  "1079033": {
    "ENU": "..."
  },
  "1079034": {
    "ENU": "... Melissa?"
  },
  "1079035": {
    "ENU": "A simple 'Yes' or 'No' will do."
  },
  "1079036": {
    "ENU": "Ah. Another one."
  },
  "1079037": {
    "ENU": "And so soon."
  },
  "1079038": {
    "ENU": "Are you strong enough to resist my power?"
  },
  "1079039": {
    "ENU": "Back away! Back I said!"
  },
  "1079040": {
    "ENU": "Begone then."
  },
  "1079041": {
    "ENU": "Bet Ex Wis!!!"
  },
  "1079042": {
    "ENU": "But I ..."
  },
  "1079043": {
    "ENU": "Can you tell me your name?"
  },
  "1079044": {
    "ENU": "Corp Por!"
  },
  "1079045": {
    "ENU": "Darling, there you are!"
  },
  "1079046": {
    "ENU": "Dexter?"
  },
  "1079047": {
    "ENU": "Did I keep you? I had some last minute business..."
  },
  "1079048": {
    "ENU": "Die."
  },
  "1079049": {
    "ENU": "Do you believe in fate? You may answer."
  },
  "1079050": {
    "ENU": "Do you know him, Master Sutek?"
  },
  "1079051": {
    "ENU": "Doesn't matter, he's bleeding pretty bad."
  },
  "1079052": {
    "ENU": "Don't bother trying to speak, let alone move."
  },
  "1079053": {
    "ENU": "Don't let them through!"
  },
  "1079054": {
    "ENU": "Don't listen to them!"
  },
  "1079055": {
    "ENU": "Don't...!"
  },
  "1079056": {
    "ENU": "Excellent."
  },
  "1079057": {
    "ENU": "For instance, this is a Tarot card. It represents your fortune."
  },
  "1079058": {
    "ENU": "Free yourselves of your burdens"
  },
  "1079059": {
    "ENU": "Friends!"
  },
  "1079060": {
    "ENU": "Get out of here"
  },
  "1079061": {
    "ENU": "Go back and find Kronos' notes, you need to hide them"
  },
  "1079062": {
    "ENU": "Go, then."
  },
  "1079063": {
    "ENU": "Good."
  },
  "1079064": {
    "ENU": "Great!"
  },
  "1079065": {
    "ENU": "Guards'll be here soon. They'll handle the rest."
  },
  "1079066": {
    "ENU": "Hang on! The worst is almost over!"
  },
  "1079067": {
    "ENU": "Here I control everything but a single choice."
  },
  "1079068": {
    "ENU": "Hey! Are you alright?"
  },
  "1079069": {
    "ENU": "I can't hold it!"
  },
  "1079070": {
    "ENU": "I control your body, I resurrected it. I control your life, I found it."
  },
  "1079071": {
    "ENU": "I have placed my gift into your hand. Take it, hide it, and find a time to use it."
  },
  "1079072": {
    "ENU": "I said GO!"
  },
  "1079073": {
    "ENU": "I shan't keep you waiting a minute more."
  },
  "1079074": {
    "ENU": "I think so..."
  },
  "1079075": {
    "ENU": "I will also give you a gift of exceeding beauty."
  },
  "1079076": {
    "ENU": "If I turn it over, and it reads 'Death'..."
  },
  "1079077": {
    "ENU": "I'll take him myself."
  },
  "1079078": {
    "ENU": "I'm sorry!"
  },
  "1079079": {
    "ENU": "I'm... I'm..."
  },
  "1079080": {
    "ENU": "In exchange, you will agree to swear loyalty to the Shadowlords, and serve them."
  },
  "1079081": {
    "ENU": "In this manner we will both know that your Fate was correct."
  },
  "1079082": {
    "ENU": "Is everything ready this time?"
  },
  "1079083": {
    "ENU": "Just keep going! Help will be here soon!"
  },
  "1079084": {
    "ENU": "Kronos!"
  },
  "1079085": {
    "ENU": "Kronos! They're too strong!"
  },
  "1079086": {
    "ENU": "Let it go"
  },
  "1079087": {
    "ENU": "Let me go!"
  },
  "1079088": {
    "ENU": "Listen and obey"
  },
  "1079089": {
    "ENU": "Listen to us"
  },
  "1079090": {
    "ENU": "Mage."
  },
  "1079091": {
    "ENU": "Master!"
  },
  "1079092": {
    "ENU": "Master!!!"
  },
  "1079093": {
    "ENU": "Master?"
  },
  "1079094": {
    "ENU": "Melissa NO!"
  },
  "1079095": {
    "ENU": "Melissa!"
  },
  "1079096": {
    "ENU": "Name."
  },
  "1079097": {
    "ENU": "No"
  },
  "1079098": {
    "ENU": "No time."
  },
  "1079099": {
    "ENU": "No way!"
  },
  "1079100": {
    "ENU": "NO! NO!!!"
  },
  "1079101": {
    "ENU": "Not at all, just starting!"
  },
  "1079102": {
    "ENU": "Not even a syllable?"
  },
  "1079103": {
    "ENU": "Oh for the love of..."
  },
  "1079104": {
    "ENU": "Or die"
  },
  "1079105": {
    "ENU": "Or, you may choose to serve my masters, and live."
  },
  "1079106": {
    "ENU": "Peace is with us"
  },
  "1079107": {
    "ENU": "Pitiful humans"
  },
  "1079108": {
    "ENU": "Pity."
  },
  "1079109": {
    "ENU": "Rest now"
  },
  "1079110": {
    "ENU": "Sir?"
  },
  "1079111": {
    "ENU": "Stay back, fiends!"
  },
  "1079112": {
    "ENU": "Stop it boy!"
  },
  "1079113": {
    "ENU": "Surely I will kill you."
  },
  "1079114": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for coming, once again!"
  },
  "1079115": {
    "ENU": "This is my domain, and I've brought you here at my masters' bidding."
  },
  "1079116": {
    "ENU": "Today, Fate will offer you a choice."
  },
  "1079117": {
    "ENU": "Urhh..."
  },
  "1079118": {
    "ENU": "VAS AN MANI HUR TYM!"
  },
  "1079119": {
    "ENU": "Very good."
  },
  "1079120": {
    "ENU": "Very well."
  },
  "1079121": {
    "ENU": "Was that?"
  },
  "1079122": {
    "ENU": "We are eternal"
  },
  "1079123": {
    "ENU": "We are patient"
  },
  "1079124": {
    "ENU": "We are stronger"
  },
  "1079125": {
    "ENU": "We mean you no harm"
  },
  "1079126": {
    "ENU": "We need a healer!"
  },
  "1079127": {
    "ENU": "What the devil!"
  },
  "1079128": {
    "ENU": "What?",
    "PTB": "O quê?"
  },
  "1079129": {
    "ENU": "Why do you fight?",
    "PTB": "Por que você luta?"
  },
  "1079130": {
    "ENU": "Why do you resist so?",
    "PTB": "Por que você resiste tanto?"
  },
  "1079131": {
    "ENU": "Yes master!",
    "PTB": "Sim, mestre!"
  },
  "1079132": {
    "ENU": "Yet resistance will be punished",
    "PTB": "Ainda assim, a resistência será punida"
  },
  "1079133": {
    "ENU": "You are silenced again",
    "PTB": "Você está silenciado novamente"
  },
  "1079134": {
    "ENU": "You are silenced again.",
    "PTB": "Você está silenciado novamente."
  },
  "1079135": {
    "ENU": "You can't go back in there, they'll eat you alive!",
    "PTB": "Você não pode voltar lá, eles vão te devorar vivo!"
  },
  "1079136": {
    "ENU": "You feel yourself able to speak.",
    "PTB": "Você se sente capaz de falar."
  },
  "1079137": {
    "ENU": "You find yourself alive, yet unable to move or speak.",
    "PTB": "Você se encontra vivo, mas incapaz de se mover ou falar."
  },
  "1079138": {
    "ENU": "You have chosen a wise path. Let me show you your fortune.",
    "PTB": "Você escolheu um caminho sábio. Deixe-me mostrar sua sorte."
  },
  "1079139": {
    "ENU": "You may choose to die, and be cast back into that dark place from whence you came.",
    "PTB": "Você pode escolher morrer e ser lançado de volta àquele lugar escuro de onde veio."
  },
  "1079140": {
    "ENU": "You may decide for yourself. Speak. You have until the flames are extinguished.",
    "PTB": "Você pode decidir por si mesmo. Fale. Você tem até as chamas se apagarem."
  },
  "1079141": {
    "ENU": "You speak your name against your will!",
    "PTB": "Você pronuncia seu nome contra sua vontade!"
  },
  "1079142": {
    "ENU": "You will have your health and possessions restored to you, and be sent safely home.",
    "PTB": "Você terá sua saúde e posses restauradas e será enviado em segurança para casa."
  },
  "1079143": {
    "ENU": "You will know our strength",
    "PTB": "Você conhecerá nossa força"
  },
  "1079144": {
    "ENU": "You.",
    "PTB": "Você."
  },
  "1079145": {
    "ENU": "Your vocal chords, the wind in your lungs - I control them.",
    "PTB": "Suas cordas vocais, o vento em seus pulmões - Eu controlo."
  },
  "1079146": {
    "ENU": "Correctly choose the sequence of colors needed to open the latch. Each color may potentially be used more than once. Beware! A false attempt could be deadly!",
    "PTB": "Escolha corretamente a sequência de cores necessária para abrir o trinco. Cada cor pode potencialmente ser usada mais de uma vez. Cuidado! Uma tentativa falha pode ser mortal!"
  },
