  },
  "1094839": {
    "ENU": "Do you want to replace the current binding with the new action?"
  },
  "1094840": {
    "ENU": "Do not address me unless you have a valid reason to do so, Mortal!"
  },
  "1094841": {
    "ENU": "Macro:"
  },
  "1094842": {
    "ENU": "Candy Corn"
  },
  "1094843": {
    "ENU": "A Giant Pumpkin Muffin"
  },
  "1094844": {
    "ENU": "Pixie Stick"
  },
  "1094874": {
    "ENU": "We were so full of pride..."
  },
  "1094875": {
    "ENU": "Look at what we've done..."
  },
  "1094876": {
    "ENU": "Cursor Targeting"
  },
  "1094877": {
    "ENU": "Oh Magincia, how strong you were.  Once the jewel of Sosaria...  Now I need the help of others to rebuild and the souls here need respite.  If you can speak to the Restless Souls, you may be able to help them move onward.  Bring me three of the Threads of Life that they should leave behind, and I will give you something to remember what we had forgotten."
  },
  "1094878": {
    "ENU": "If you can find a restless spirit and use Spirit Speak, that may give you the ability to talk to them."
  },
  "1094879": {
    "ENU": "Ah, thank you!  With this we can begin to bring life back to this land.  Take this - may it be a reminder to you that life is precious."
  },
  "1094880": {
    "ENU": "The Forsaken Souls have become listless, desperate to find a way home.  You will need to use magic to convince them that they need to go on.  Please bring me five Threads of Thought that they leave behind.  While I do not have much, I can give what I have in return for your help."
  },
  "1094881": {
    "ENU": "A Necromancer with Exorcism should be able to send the forsaken souls to the beyond."
  },
  "1094882": {
    "ENU": "Ah!  With this we can hopefully undo the actions that have destroyed our precious city.  Please take this as a reminder of the consequences of action without thought."
  },
  "1094883": {
    "ENU": "I wish to undo the horrors that have beset Magincia but I need help.   There are some souls whose burden is so great that they have become corrupted and bound by the Threads of Fate.  Go to Magincia and cut the Corrupted Souls free by any means necessary, and gather the threads that they leave behind."
  },
  "1094884": {
    "ENU": "Fight the corrupted souls with sword and spell, and gather the Threads of Fate they leave behind!"
  },
  "1094885": {
    "ENU": "Thank you so very much.  All we can offer is the rubble that was left behind in the wake of Magicinia’s destruction.  Cherish life and be thoughtful in your actions, lest you become humbled by the threads of fate that you weave upon yourself."
  },
