  },
  "1112445": {
    "ENU": "Hatching a non-mature or burnt egg will likely destroy it. Do you wish to proceed?"
  },
  "1112446": {
    "ENU": "Do you wish to hatch your chicken lizard egg now?"
  },
  "1112447": {
    "ENU": "You hatch the egg but it crumbles in your hands!"
  },
  "1112448": {
    "ENU": "UPDATE"
  },
  "1112449": {
    "ENU": "Macros from the Classic Client have been detected for this character. Would you like to import these macros now?<br><br> - Any macro action that is not supported will not be imported and skipped over.<br> - Key bindings will not be imported due to the possibility of key binding conflicts.<br> - This process will not alter the macro settings for the Classic Client."
  },
  "1112450": {
    "ENU": "You're a bit too frightened to touch that yet."
  },
  "1112451": {
    "ENU": "After what happened last time, you're too afraid to try again."
  },
  "1112452": {
    "ENU": "This axe is really sharp!"
  },
  "1112453": {
    "ENU": "You can't fly in your current form!"
  },
  "1112454": {
    "ENU": "You must heal before flying."
  },
  "1112455": {
    "ENU": "You cannot fly while recovering from a bola throw."
  },
  "1112456": {
    "ENU": "You cannot fly while recovering from a dismount maneuver."
  },
  "1112457": {
    "ENU": "You are still too dazed to fly."
  },
  "1112458": {
    "ENU": "MRRGLGRRGL! ARRGH!"
  },
  "1112459": {
    "ENU": "Thank you! Give me a moment to recover, and I'll see what I can do to help."
  },
  "1112460": {
    "ENU": "I thought they were going to sacrifice me! Here, take this, I'm getting out of here!"
  },
  "1112461": {
    "ENU": "You pour some water on the egg, moistening its shell."
  },
  "1112462": {
    "ENU": "a moist chicken lizard egg"
  },
  "1112463": {
