  },
  "1112465": {
    "ENU": "a dehydrated chicken lizard egg"
  },
  "1112466": {
    "ENU": "a burnt chicken lizard egg"
  },
  "1112467": {
    "ENU": "a mature chicken lizard egg"
  },
  "1112468": {
    "ENU": "a mature battle chicken lizard egg"
  },
  "1112469": {
    "ENU": "a chicken lizard egg"
  },
  "1112470": {
    "ENU": "You may not use Valor on this Champion Idol. The Champion has already spawned."
  },
  "1112471": {
    "ENU": "Bald (You will lose your horn color.)"
  },
  "1112472": {
    "ENU": "You've suffered a vicious bite!"
  },
  "1112473": {
    "ENU": "Your vicious wound is festering!"
  },
  "1112474": {
    "ENU": "A hairstylist cannot style your horns!"
  },
  "1112475": {
    "ENU": "You cannot use this. You have no beard to dye."
  },
  "1112476": {
    "ENU": "Gargoyles cannot use the services of a body sculptor."
  },
  "1112477": {
    "ENU": "You hatch a chicken lizard."
  },
  "1112478": {
    "ENU": "You hatch a battle chicken lizard!!"
  },
  "1112479": {
    "ENU": "an incubator"
  },
  "1112480": {
    "ENU": "a scale collar"
  },
  "1112481": {
    "ENU": "Which battle chicken do you wish to ensnare?"
  },
  "1112482": {
    "ENU": "The chicken frees itself of the collar!!"
  },
  "1112483": {
    "ENU": "The collar falls to the ground as the chicken deftly avoids it."
  },
  "1112484": {
    "ENU": "You successfully ensnare the chicken! You best hurry before it frees itself from it!"
  },
  "1112485": {
    "ENU": "Your chicken has laid an egg!!"
  },
  "1112486": {
    "ENU": "A shard of the brittle weapon has become lodged in you!"
  },
  "1112487": {
    "ENU": "The shard is successfully removed."
  },
  "1112488": {
    "ENU": "Please free me!"
  },
  "1112489": {
    "ENU": "I see you, yes I do!"
  },
  "1112490": {
    "ENU": "A cat in a box. Does it yet live?"
  },
  "1112491": {
    "ENU": "How long must I suffer?"
  },
  "1112492": {
    "ENU": "Stop saying that!"
  },
  "1112493": {
    "ENU": "No."
  },
  "1112494": {
    "ENU": "Yes."
  },
  "1112495": {
    "ENU": "Quick, release me!"
  },
  "1112496": {
    "ENU": "I have the answers."
  },
  "1112497": {
    "ENU": "Trammel waxes, Felucca wanes."
  },
  "1112498": {
    "ENU": "Felucca waxes, Trammel wanes."
  },
  "1112499": {
    "ENU": "Stop that jibber jabber, fool."
  },
  "1112500": {
    "ENU": "The king of old is the king of new."
  },
  "1112501": {
    "ENU": "Antonio knows."
  },
  "1112502": {
    "ENU": "*moan*"
  },
  "1112503": {
    "ENU": "*cries*"
  },
  "1112504": {
    "ENU": "How did I get here?"
  },
  "1112505": {
    "ENU": "I don't know how long I've been here."
  },
  "1112506": {
    "ENU": "Would you like some tea?"
  },
  "1112507": {
    "ENU": "No, I cannot do that."
  },
  "1112508": {
    "ENU": "I have something valuable!"
  },
  "1112509": {
    "ENU": "Where is Elayne? Is she the Queen?"
  },
  "1112510": {
    "ENU": "Do you know who I am?"
  },
  "1112511": {
    "ENU": "Facial Horn Style"
  },
  "1112512": {
    "ENU": "Facial Horn Color"
  },
  "1112513": {
    "ENU": "You need ~1_reeds~ softened reeds of the same color to make this basket. "
  },
  "1112514": {
    "ENU": "Rumors Abound"
  },
  "1112515": {
    "ENU": "I know not the details, but from what little truth that can be separated from rumor, it seems that the Holy City is being savaged repeatedly by the Arisen. Diligence demands that you make your way with haste to the Holy City, which lies some distance to the south-east. Please take this writ and deliver it to Naxatilor so he will know that I sent you."
  },
  "1112516": {
    "ENU": "The safety of the Holy City and the Elders is at stake. Surely you cannot be refusing to help?"
  },
  "1112517": {
    "ENU": "How could you lose the writ? Head back to Egwexem in the Royal City to get another one."
  },
  "1112518": {
    "ENU": "Make haste to the Holy City!"
  },
  "1112519": {
    "ENU": "I am sorry, I am too busy to... <br><br>*You hand Naxatilor the writ*<br><br>I see that Egwexem has sent you. It is good that you have come, we could use your help."
  },
  "1112520": {
    "ENU": "Egwexem's Writ"
  },
  "1112521": {
    "ENU": "Know the secrets. Learn of the soulforge."
  },
  "1112522": {
    "ENU": "Stand near a soulforge and use the Imbuing skill to unravel magical items. Retrieve Magical Residue and give it to Beninort. There are three magical elements that the soulforge can unravel from a magic item: Magical Residue, Enchanted Essence, and Relic Fragments. Each Imbuing recipe includes a quantity of one of these ingredients.<br><center>------</center><br>I am pleased to meet you. I have been assigned to teach the use of the soulforge to those approved by the Queen. I am pleased that you are approved. To begin your training, you must learn to unravel magic items. You must have a magic item. Stand near a soulforge and unravel the magic item into magical ingredients until you obtain Magical Residue.<BR><BR>Return to me with the Magical Residue, and I will reward you with a scroll of power."
  },
  "1112523": {
    "ENU": "A pleasure to have met you. I hope for your safe return in these dark times."
  },
  "1112524": {
    "ENU": "Well met! Remember to stand near a soulforge and unravel magic items into ingredients. I encourage you. I have confidence in your ability. Do what I instruct, and bring me the result."
  },
  "1112525": {
    "ENU": "Come to me, Artificer. I have a task for you."
  },
  "1112526": {
    "ENU": "Stand near a soulforge and use the Imbuing skill to unravel magical items. Retrieve Enchanted Essence and give it to Aurvidlem. There are three magical elements that the soulforge can unravel from a magic item: Magical Residue, Enchanted Essence, and Relic Fragments. Each Imbuing recipe includes a quantity of one of these ingredients.<br><center>------</center><br>Well met! To continue your training, you must learn to unravel more powerful magic items. You must have a magic item. Stand near a soulforge and unravel the magic item into magical ingredients until you obtain Enchanted Essence.<BR><BR>Return to me with the Enchanted Essence, and I will reward you with a scroll of power."
  },
  "1112527": {
    "ENU": "You have learned well. You display discipline. Remember this lesson and continue to master your craft."
  },
  "1112528": {
    "ENU": "Master the art of unraveling magic."
  },
  "1112529": {
    "ENU": "Stand near a soulforge and use the Imbuing skill to unravel magical items. Retrieve Relic Fragments and give them to Ansikart. There are three magical elements that the soulforge can unravel from a magic item: Magical Residue, Enchanted Essence, and Relic Fragments. Each Imbuing recipe includes a quantity of one of these ingredients.<br><center>------</center><br>Greetings! To complete your training, you must learn to unravel the most powerful magic items. You must have a magic item. Stand near a soulforge and unravel the magic item into magical ingredients until you obtain Relic Fragments.<BR><BR>Return to me with the Relic Fragments, and I will reward you with a scroll of power."
  },
  "1112530": {
    "ENU": "Knowledge"
  },
  "1112531": {
    "ENU": "NOT QUEST ITEM"
  },
  "1112532": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
  "1112533": {
    "ENU": "NON QUEST ITEM"
  },
  "1112534": {
    "ENU": "QUEST ITEM"
  },
  "1112535": {
    "ENU": "Secrets of the Soulforge "
  },
  "1112536": {
    "ENU": "Knowledge of the Soulforge"
  },
  "1112537": {
    "ENU": "Mastering the Soulforge"
  },
  "1112538": {
    "ENU": "The Arisen"
  },
  "1112539": {
    "ENU": "We need your assistance with a matter that is most grave. To the north, from within the Tomb of Kings, the Arisen are emerging each night to attack the Holy City.<br><br>Shortly after we unsealed the entrance to the Abyss, found in the depths of the Tomb, strange happenings began to occur. At first, there were only a few reports of strange noises coming from the Tomb of Kings late at night. Investigating the Tomb during the daytime uncovered nothing unusual, so we sent someone to seek out the source of these noises one night. When morning came and he had not returned, we knew something was amiss.<br><br>We sent word to the Royal City asking for help, but the following night, unspeakable evil erupted from the entrance to the Tomb! A defense of the city was quickly marshaled, but the Arisen proved to be quite powerful. Unfortunately, they are also persistent, as every night since then, this city, the original birthplace of our people, has faced wave after wave of Arisen. We know not the cause of the attacks, nor the source, as investigations by daylight yield little. We have been hard pressed just to defend the Elders here, much less push the Arisen back into the Tomb.<br><br>We could use your help in this! Either help defend the Holy City at night, or enter the Tomb of Kings itself and seek out the Arisen at their source. It is your choice to make, as you know your own abilities best. If you decide to enter the Tomb of Kings, you'll need to speak the words \"ord\" and \"an-ord\" to pass the Serpent's Breath.<br><br>Succeed in this task, and I shall reward you well."
  },
  "1112540": {
    "ENU": "To decide not to help would bring you great shame."
  },
  "1112541": {
    "ENU": "Help defend the Holy City or head down into the tombs!"
  },
  "1112542": {
    "ENU": "Good work! Now return to Naxatilor."
  },
  "1112543": {
    "ENU": "You have proven yourself both brave and worthy! Know that you have both our gratitude and our blessing to enter the Abyss, if you so wish.<br><br>All who wish to enter must seek out the Shrine of Singularity to the North for further meditation. Only those found to be on the Sacred Quest will be allowed to enter the Abyss. I would advise that you seek out some of the ancient texts in the Holy City Museum, which you can find to the south, so that you might focus better while meditating at the Shrine. As promised, here is your reward."
  },
  "1112544": {
    "ENU": "mysticism"
  },
  "1112545": {
    "ENU": "imbuing"
  },
  "1112546": {
    "ENU": "Take care and be safe. Many great dangers surround us."
  },
  "1112547": {
    "ENU": "We meet again. Remember to stand near a soulforge and unravel magic items into ingredients. You have the aptitude to be a great Artificer. Do what I instruct, and bring me the result."
  },
  "1112548": {
    "ENU": "Well done! You are becoming a skilled Artificer. Come back if you wish to continue to learn."
  },
  "1112549": {
    "ENU": "May your life be filled with knowledge and wisdom. Until we meet again."
  },
  "1112550": {
    "ENU": "Welcome back! You have not done as I've instructed. Remember to stand near a soulforge and unravel magic items into ingredients. I believe in your ability. Do what I instruct, and bring me the result."
  },
  "1112551": {
    "ENU": "You have mastered the art of magic item unraveling. Your reward will be great. Good journey to you. "
  },
  "1112552": {
    "ENU": "boura"
  },
  "1112553": {
    "ENU": "throwing"
  },
  "1112554": {
    "ENU": "You're stunned as the creature's tail knocks the wind out of you."
  },
  "1112555": {
    "ENU": "You're left confused as the creature's tail catches you right in the face!"
  },
  "1112556": {
    "ENU": "Stable a chicken"
  },
  "1112557": {
    "ENU": "Claim a chicken"
  },
  "1112558": {
    "ENU": "You may only stable chickens in the chicken coop."
  },
  "1112559": {
    "ENU": "Which chicken do you wish to stable?"
  },
  "1112560": {
    "ENU": "fur"
  },
  "1112561": {
    "ENU": "A Mystic's Journey"
  },
  "1112562": {
    "ENU": "Become adept in Mysticism. Help save Ter-Mur!"
  },
  "1112563": {
    "ENU": "Obtain the following Mysticism reagents: Dragon's Blood and Daemon Bone - and give them to Ortlem for your reward.<br><center>------</center><br>I am called Ortlem. I am a Mystic. Mysticism is our way of magic. I need you to obtain the following Mysticism reagents: Dragon's Blood and Daemon Bone.<BR><BR>These reagents will allow our Mystics to cast powerful spells to protect Ter-Mur. You can gather Dragon's Blood and Daemon Bones in Ter-Mur. Dragon's Blood is gathered by skinning reptilian creatures. Daemon Bones will appear on the corpse of any void demons that you slay.<BR><BR>Return to me with these reagents, and I will reward you."
  },
  "1112564": {
    "ENU": "I understand your fear. I wish you no harm. If I must, I am willing to find another to help us."
  },
  "1112565": {
    "ENU": "Good to see you, again. I am glad no harm has come to you in collecting the four rare reagents of Mysticism. Please obtain them soon. They are important to the protection of Ter-Mur."
  },
  "1112566": {
    "ENU": "I appreciate your work in collecting these reagents. I am glad to be able to count on you. Be assured that these reagents will help continue the protection of Ter-Mur. As promised, here is your reward."
  },
  "1112567": {
    "ENU": "You are flying."
  },
  "1112568": {
    "ENU": "Crystal Ball of Knowledge"
  },
  "1112569": {
    "ENU": "You cannot use the Crystal Ball of Knowledge right now."
  },
  "1112570": {
    "ENU": "a chicken coop"
  },
