  "1112668": {
    "ENU": "Eight"
  },
  "1112669": {
    "ENU": "No"
  },
  "1112670": {
    "ENU": "Yes"
  },
  "1112671": {
    "ENU": "Forever"
  },
  "1112672": {
    "ENU": "As all things have a beginning, all things must have an end"
  },
  "1112673": {
    "ENU": "After the Great Breaking has come"
  },
  "1112674": {
    "ENU": "There's nothing left to harvest from this creature."
  },
  "1112675": {
    "ENU": "Your attempt fails and angers the creature!!"
  },
  "1112676": {
    "ENU": "You harvest magical resources from the creature and place it in your bag."
  },
  "1112677": {
    "ENU": "The creature is still recovering from the previous harvest. Try again in a few seconds."
  },
  "1112678": {
    "ENU": "You don't have enough crystal dust to make that."
  },
  "1112679": {
    "ENU": "You do not have enough scales to make that."
  },
  "1112680": {
    "ENU": "You realize that is not the correct answer.<br><br>You vow to study the Book of Circles again so that you might understand all that is required of you. Perhaps meditating again soon will bring the wisdom that you seek.<br>"
  },
  "1112681": {
    "ENU": "La Insep Om"
  },
  "1112682": {
    "ENU": "Repeating the mantra, you gradually enter a state of enlightened meditation.<br><br>As you contemplate your worthiness, an image of the Book of Circles comes into focus.<br><br>Perhaps you are ready for La Insep Om?<br>"
  },
  "1112683": {
    "ENU": "You feel as if you should return when you are worthy."
  },
  "1112684": {
    "ENU": "Focusing more upon the Book of Circles, you realize that you must now show your mastery of its contents.<br>"
  },
  "1112685": {
    "ENU": "You need more time to contemplate the Book of Circles before trying again."
  },
  "1112686": {
    "ENU": "Void Daemons"
  },
  "1112687": {
    "ENU": "Into the Void"
  },
  "1112688": {
    "ENU": "Daemons from the void! They must be vanquished!"
  },
  "1112689": {
    "ENU": "Enable V-Sync"
  },
  "1112690": {
    "ENU": "Kill Void Daemons and return to Agralem the Bladeweaver for your reward.<br><center>-----</center><br>Welcome to the Royal City. My name is Agralem. I am a Bladeweaver.<br><br>Ter-Mur needs your help. Daemons are invading our lands from the Void. The Void Daemons must be slain. Our existance is in great danger. Please help us protect Ter-Mur, and I will reward you."
  },
  "1112691": {
    "ENU": "I understand what I ask is a perilous task. I hope someone brave will help us."
  },
  "1112692": {
    "ENU": "Welcome back. I must remind you that we are still in great danger. Please help protect Ter-Mur from the Void Daemons."
  },
  "1112693": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for helping keep us safe! We are very grateful. As promised, here is your reward."
  },
  "1112694": {
    "ENU": "Abyss Reaver"
  },
  "1112695": {
    "ENU": "You may not use Valor on this Champion Idol right now."
  },
  "1112696": {
    "ENU": "You already have a chicken coop in your house!"
  },
  "1112697": {
    "ENU": "You enter a state of peaceful contemplation, focusing on the meaning of Singularity."
  },
  "1112698": {
    "ENU": "CANCEL MAKE"
  },
  "1112699": {
    "ENU": "You feed your chicken, but nothing happens. Maybe later!"
  },
  "1112700": {
    "ENU": "Answering the last question correctly, you feel a strange energy wash over you.<br><br>You don't understand how you know, but you are absolutely certain that the guardians will no longer bar you from entering the Stygian Abyss.<br><br>It seems you have proven yourself worthy of La Insep Om."
  },
  "1112701": {
    "ENU": "I've already accepted your offering."
  },
  "1112702": {
    "ENU": "Book of Circles"
  },
  "1112703": {
    "ENU": "Your meager offering has been received, but proved insufficient."
  },
  "1112704": {
    "ENU": "Let me show you something of how this is done."
  },
  "1112705": {
    "ENU": "Are you trying to bribe me?"
  },
  "1112706": {
    "ENU": "This tastes good."
  },
  "1112707": {
    "ENU": "I thank you."
  },
  "1112708": {
    "ENU": "Your pack seems full, so I will put it at your feet."
  },
  "1112709": {
    "ENU": "Ha! You are inept!"
  },
  "1112710": {
    "ENU": "You missed, fool!"
  },
  "1112711": {
    "ENU": "Your aim is bad..."
  },
  "1112712": {
    "ENU": "Surely you can do better than that blow!"
  },
  "1112713": {
    "ENU": "You are no match for me!"
  },
  "1112714": {
    "ENU": "Ouch! That scratched me!"
  },
  "1112715": {
    "ENU": "Barely a flesh wound. Can't you do better?"
  },
  "1112716": {
    "ENU": "You fight without discipline."
  },
  "1112717": {
    "ENU": "You lack focus. Surely you can do better!"
  },
  "1112718": {
    "ENU": "Your anger blinds you. You will lose this battle."
  },
  "1112719": {
    "ENU": "A good blow on your part, but not enough!"
  },
  "1112720": {
    "ENU": "Away with you! "
  },
  "1112721": {
    "ENU": "I am too busy fighting to deal with you!"
  },
  "1112722": {
    "ENU": "Alas, I cannot teach you anything."
  },
  "1112723": {
    "ENU": "I am too busy to teach you."
  },
  "1112724": {
    "ENU": "I cannot train you. I have more important things to do."
  },
  "1112725": {
    "ENU": "I do not train while I am working."
  },
  "1112726": {
    "ENU": "That is something I cannot teach you."
  },
  "1112727": {
    "ENU": "I cannot teach you, for you know more than I."
  },
  "1112728": {
    "ENU": "You have not learned enough of other ways to be taught this skill."
  },
  "1112729": {
    "ENU": "For less, I will teach you less."
  },
  "1112730": {
    "ENU": "I will not treat with scum like you!"
  },
  "1112731": {
    "ENU": "Knowing that you did the right thing."
  },
  "1112732": {
    "ENU": "Blessing to enter the Abyss"
  },
  "1112733": {
    "ENU": "Queen Zhah has decreed that no vendors may be set up for employment until further notice."
  },
  "1112734": {
    "ENU": "Queen Zhah has decreed that no vendors may be set up for employment until further notice."
  },
