  },
  "1113733": {
    "ENU": "You found the Worn Katana. You need to toggle it as a quest item.<br><br>Left click on yourself, and select 'Toggle Quest Item' from the context menu. A 'Targeting Cursor' will appear.<br><br>Left click on the Worn Katana, press the Esc key, and then talk to Hogarth."
  },
  "1113734": {
    "ENU": "Do you wish to join your companions?"
  },
  "1113735": {
    "ENU": "Your party has gained entrance to Medusa's Lair. If you choose to join the fight, you will be teleported to the battle."
  },
  "1113736": {
    "ENU": "You must rise to the rank of noble in the eyes of the Gargoyle Queen before her majesty will allow you to use this soulforge."
  },
  "1113737": {
    "ENU": "Monster's Lair"
  },
  "1113738": {
    "ENU": "Your party has gained entrance to a monster's lair. You may choose to join the fight or stay away."
  },
  "1113739": {
    "ENU": "Stygian Dragon's Lair"
  },
  "1113740": {
    "ENU": "Your party has gained entrance to the stygian dragon's lair. If you choose to join the fight, you will be teleported to the battle."
  },
  "1113741": {
    "ENU": "This item cannot be dyed this color."
  },
  "1113742": {
    "ENU": "Instance Exit"
  },
  "1113743": {
    "ENU": "You may not return to this instance while it is still in progress. If you leave, you will not be able to return to claim your corpse. Resurrect first if you wish to take your belongings."
  },
  "1113744": {
    "ENU": "This moongate is not yet bonded to the magics of Sosaria."
  },
  "1113745": {
    "ENU": "Yes! I must go!"
  },
  "1113746": {
    "ENU": "No, I am not done yet..."
  },
  "1113747": {
    "ENU": "Do you really wish to leave the instance?"
  },
  "1113748": {
    "ENU": "The damage you received fuels your battle fury."
  },
  "1113749": {
    "ENU": "You may not use that while flying over such precarious terrain."
  },
  "1113750": {
    "ENU": "You may not cast spells while flying over such precarious terrain."
  },
  "1113751": {
    "ENU": "*The Ortanord is unaffected by this attack*"
  },
  "1113752": {
    "ENU": "Your target is not allowed to own a pet of that type."
  },
  "1113753": {
    "ENU": "You must upgrade to the Stygian Abyss expansion in order to control this creature."
  },
  "1113754": {
    "ENU": "You need a parasitic potion to make that."
  },
  "1113755": {
    "ENU": "You need a darkglow potion to make that."
  },
  "1113756": {
    "ENU": "You've found some strange crystal shards imbeded in the wood."
  },
  "1113757": {
    "ENU": "Resonant Staff of Enlightenment"
  },
  "1113758": {
    "ENU": "Claws of the Berserker"
  },
  "1113759": {
    "ENU": "Ironwood Composite Bow"
  },
  "1113760": {
    "ENU": "Animated Legs of the Insane Tinker"
  },
  "1113761": {
    "ENU": "Protector of the Battle Mage"
  },
  "1113762": {
    "ENU": "Crown of Arcane Temperament"
  },
  "1113763": {
    "ENU": "You must upgrade to Stygian Abyss in order to use that item."
  },
  "1113764": {
    "ENU": "As you reel in, you notice that there is something odd tangled in the line."
  },
  "1113765": {
    "ENU": "Moon Blade"
  },
  "1113766": {
    "ENU": "Wand of Blood Harmony"
  },
  "1113767": {
    "ENU": "Meager Imbuing Bag"
  },
  "1113768": {
    "ENU": "Average Imbuing Bag"
  },
  "1113769": {
    "ENU": "Valuable Imbuing Bag"
  },
  "1113770": {
    "ENU": "Essence Box"
  },
  "1113771": {
    "ENU": "Elven Fletching"
  },
  "1113772": {
    "ENU": "A Little Something"
  },
  "1113773": {
    "ENU": "You want some basic imbuing ingredients, the kind that can be obtained from the beasts of Ter Mur? Well, I can help you. I usually don’t trade in such low end items, and I’m not sure why you cannot hunt them down yourself, but today you are in luck. If you will bring me something of which I do have a need, perhaps a piece of brilliant amber, I shall reward you with what I can find laying around. What exactly, I can’t tell you, as I do not have time to inventory such things."
  },
  "1113774": {
    "ENU": "Well, okay, if that is what you wish."
  },
  "1113775": {
    "ENU": "We have agreed to trade one piece of brilliant amber for some of the lesser imbuing ingredients. Bring that to me, and I shall uphold my part of our bargain."
  },
  "1113776": {
    "ENU": "Well, it is not the most brilliant piece of amber, but I suppose it shall do. Here is a bag with the ingredients I have found. In fact, I found more of these lesser imbuing ingredients than I believed I possessed, so return to me if you wish to make another trade."
  },
  "1113777": {
    "ENU": "The Exchange"
  },
  "1113778": {
    "ENU": "Hello there! Hail and well met, and all of that. I must apologize in advance for being so impatient, but you must help me! You see, my mother and my eldest sister are visiting soon, and I haven’t seen them in quite awhile, so I want to present them both with a surprise when they arrive.<br><br>My sister absolutely adores white chocolate, but gargoyles don’t seem to care for it much, so I haven’t been able to find any here. It was recently my mother’s birthday, and I know that she would love some finely crafted gargish jewelry, but the jeweler hasn’t had her favorite jewel in stock for quite some time. If you could help me obtain five pieces of white chocolate and one dark sapphire, I will reward you with a bag of hard to obtain imbuing ingredients."
  },
  "1113779": {
    "ENU": "Oh, no, you must help me! Please say that you will!"
  },
  "1113780": {
    "ENU": "Remember, I need five pieces of white chocolate, and one dark sapphire. Please do hurry!"
  },
  "1113781": {
    "ENU": "Oh, thank you so very much! I cannot begin to thank you enough for helping me find these presents. Here is your reward. You’ll have to excuse me while I set this dark sapphire in a setting that will best highlight the cut. Farewell!"
  },
  "1113782": {
    "ENU": "A Worthy Proposition"
  },
  "1113783": {
    "ENU": "Hello, welcome to the shop. I don't own it, but the gargoyles here are as keen to learn from me as I am from them. They've been helping me with the work on my latest invention, but I am short some parts. Perhaps you could help me?<br><br>I have heard that the bamboo flutes of the Tokuno Islands are exceptionally strong for their weight, and nothing can beat elven fletching for strength in holding them together. If you would bring me, say, ten bamboo flutes and some elven fletching, I have some valuable imbuing ingredients I’ll give you in exchange. What do you say?"
  },
  "1113784": {
    "ENU": "Well, if you change your mind, I’ll be here."
  },
  "1113785": {
    "ENU": "Hmm, what is that? Oh yes, I would like you to bring me ten bamboo flutes and some elven fletching for my fly… er, my invention."
  },
  "1113786": {
    "ENU": "These are of fine quality! I think they will work just fine to reinforce the floor of the basket. What’s that? Did I say basket? I meant, bakery! Yes, I am inventing a, um, floor for a bakery. There is a great need for that, you know! Ok, now please leave so I can get back to work. Thank you, bye, bye!"
  },
  "1113787": {
    "ENU": "Unusual Goods"
  },
  "1113788": {
    "ENU": "Psst. Do you want to buy something rare and valuable? Yes? Good. I have in my possession an imbuing ingredient that is highly sought after. If you wish to make a trade, it will not come cheaply. Provide me with two perfect emeralds and one piece of crystalline blackrock, and what is in this box shall be yours. "
  },
  "1113789": {
    "ENU": "It is your choice, but do not speak of this to anyone else."
  },
  "1113790": {
    "ENU": "In exchange for this bag, I want two perfect emeralds and one piece of crystalline blackrock. Nothing more, nothing less.",
    "PTB": "Em troca desta bolsa, quero duas esmeraldas perfeitas e uma peça de blackrock cristalino. Nada mais, nada menos."
  },
  "1113791": {
    "ENU": "Let me see what you have brought me. Yes, this is of fine quality, and I accept it in trade. Here is your box. Please do not spread word of our deal, as I do not want attention brought upon me. I am sure you understand.",
    "PTB": "Deixe-me ver o que você trouxe. Sim, isto é de boa qualidade, e aceito em troca. Aqui está sua caixa. Por favor, não espalhe palavra do nosso acordo, pois não quero chamar atenção para mim. Tenho certeza que você entende."
  },
  "1113792": {
    "ENU": "You are about to enter a PvP area, where you can be attacked and stolen from by other players. Do you wish to proceed?",
    "PTB": "Você está prestes a entrar em uma área de PvP, onde pode ser atacado e roubado por outros jogadores. Deseja prosseguir?"
  },
  "1113793": {
    "ENU": "No, I do not wish to proceed",
    "PTB": "Não, não desejo prosseguir"
  },
  "1113794": {
    "ENU": "Yes, I wish to proceed",
    "PTB": "Sim, desejo prosseguir"
  },
  "1113795": {
    "ENU": "Yes, and do not ask me again",
    "PTB": "Sim, e não me pergunte novamente"
  },
  "1113796": {
    "ENU": "You may use your avatar's context menu to re-enable the warning later.",
    "PTB": "Você pode usar o menu de contexto do seu avatar para reativar o aviso depois."
  },
  "1113797": {
    "ENU": "Enable PvP Warning",
    "PTB": "Ativar Aviso de PvP"
  },
  "1113798": {
    "ENU": "Your PvP warning query has been re-enabled.",
    "PTB": "Sua consulta de aviso de PvP foi reativada."
  },
