  "1114151": {
    "ENU": "a fellow who"
  },
  "1114152": {
    "ENU": "a wench who"
  },
  "1114153": {
    "ENU": "turned into a sea serpent?"
  },
  "1114154": {
    "ENU": "befriended a cuddly ferret?"
  },
  "1114155": {
    "ENU": "was set upon by silent ninjas?"
  },
  "1114156": {
    "ENU": "claimed to be an Avatar of the virtues?"
  },
  "1114157": {
    "ENU": "claimed to be Lord British? I beat him up."
  },
  "1114158": {
    "ENU": "got in a duel and beat three rogues with only a pocketknife?"
  },
  "1114159": {
    "ENU": "tried to make friendly with a tavern wench and got ale dumped on his head?"
  },
  "1114160": {
    "ENU": "got so drunk he claimed he'd tamed a dragon?"
  },
  "1114161": {
    "ENU": "claimed he'd tamed a dragon? They laughed, until he brought it inside the tavern!"
  },
  "1114162": {
    "ENU": "thought this world was just a reflected image of the real one?"
  },
  "1114163": {
    "ENU": "claimed a city named Wind exists somewhere up in the mountains?"
  },
  "1114164": {
    "ENU": "dared me to sail around the world? He tried, and was never seen again."
  },
  "1114165": {
    "ENU": "claimed to be a pirate who sank whole merchant fleets?"
  },
  "1114166": {
    "ENU": "claimed to have four wives in different cities?"
  },
  "1114167": {
    "ENU": "said he had heard of thee? I figured he must have been lying."
  },
  "1114168": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a master mage?"
  },
  "1114169": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a follower of Blackthorn?"
  },
  "1114170": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a ghost?"
  },
  "1114171": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a thief?"
  },
  "1114172": {
    "ENU": "kept muttering about Shadowlords, whatever they are."
  },
  "1114173": {
    "ENU": "claimed to be some sort of Time Lord?"
  },
  "1114174": {
    "ENU": "said he'd found a piece of Exodus, but accidentally dropped it in a well?"
  },
  "1114175": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a liche who wanted to steal my soul?"
  },
  "1114176": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be one of Lord British's guards on a secret mission?"
  },
  "1114177": {
    "ENU": "had some get rich quick scheme involving selling tickets to watch people kick a ball around?"
  },
  "1114178": {
    "ENU": "was the best healer I've ever seen... until he caught ill and died."
  },
  "1114179": {
    "ENU": "liked the wilderness so much he got hives when he was in the city?"
  },
  "1114180": {
    "ENU": "insisted that sailing west would eventually take you to the land where all the dead live?"
  },
  "1114181": {
    "ENU": "said his dog was so smart it could talk?"
  },
  "1114182": {
    "ENU": "danced on the tavern table, but fell off and spitted himself on his sword?"
  },
  "1114183": {
    "ENU": "could tell you all about every sort of animal there ever was?"
  },
  "1114184": {
    "ENU": "built himself a castle out in the woods?"
  },
  "1114185": {
    "ENU": "was having a ship built in the harbor? It was huge, but it sank at the christening."
  },
  "1114186": {
    "ENU": "used to mutter a spell over his food, just in case it was poisoned."
  },
  "1114187": {
    "ENU": "said he'd been swallowed by a whirlpool, and it had turned his hair white?"
  },
  "1114188": {
    "ENU": "turned into an octopus?"
  },
  "1114189": {
    "ENU": "was entranced by a cuddly ferret?"
  },
  "1114190": {
    "ENU": "wooed by a handsome samurai?"
  },
  "1114191": {
    "ENU": "told me she was from another world?"
  },
  "1114192": {
    "ENU": "claimed to be an Avatar of the virtues?"
  },
  "1114193": {
    "ENU": "said she knew Lord British personally?"
  },
  "1114194": {
    "ENU": "had golden hair as lovely as the sun?"
  },
  "1114195": {
    "ENU": "kicked me really hard when I got friendly?"
  },
  "1114196": {
    "ENU": "served the sweetest apple wine I ever tasted?"
  },
  "1114197": {
    "ENU": "made the best apple pies I ever saw?"
  },
  "1114198": {
    "ENU": "made the worst clam chowder I ever tasted?"
  },
  "1114199": {
    "ENU": "thought the world was round? Ha!"
  },
  "1114200": {
    "ENU": "claimed to have visited a magical city in the mountains?"
  },
  "1114201": {
    "ENU": "dared me to race across Brittany Bay?"
  },
  "1114202": {
    "ENU": "claimed to own a fleet of merchant ships?"
  },
  "1114203": {
    "ENU": "threatened to marry me?"
  },
  "1114204": {
    "ENU": "claimed to know thee? I think she was lying, though."
  },
  "1114205": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a powerful mage?"
  },
  "1114206": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a follower of Blackthorn?"
  },
  "1114207": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be married?"
  },
  "1114208": {
    "ENU": "turned out to be a pirate?"
  },
  "1114209": {
    "ENU": "was dead but didn't know it?"
  },
  "1114210": {
    "ENU": "had found sunken treasure but spent it all?"
  },
  "1114211": {
    "ENU": "loved moonlight so much she slept during the day?"
  },
  "1114212": {
    "ENU": "was so scared of the dark she always had a lit lantern?"
  },
  "1114213": {
    "ENU": "thought I was terribly handsome?"
  },
  "1114214": {
    "ENU": "told me I was the ugliest old salt she'd ever seen?"
  },
  "1114215": {
    "ENU": "offered me a kiss and a wish, and like an idiot I took the kiss? She vanished in a puff of smoke right afterwards."
  },
  "1114216": {
    "ENU": "turned me into a toad? It stuck for two weeks, until another toad kissed me."
  },
  "1114217": {
    "ENU": "accidentally dropped a tray of ale mugs on my lap?"
  },
  "1114218": {
    "ENU": "used to braid fox tails into her hair?"
  },
  "1114219": {
    "ENU": "played the lute like nothing you ever heard?"
  },
  "1114220": {
    "ENU": "sang with an awful screech?"
  },
  "1114221": {
    "ENU": "wore so much plate mail she rusted solid and starved to death when it rained?"
  },
