  "1114847": {
    "ENU": "This volume, and others in the series, are sponsored by donations from Lord Blackthorn, ever a supporter of understanding the other sentient races of Britannia. <br>-----",
    "PTB": "Este volume, e outros da série, são patrocinados por doações de Lord Blackthorn, sempre um apoiador da compreensão das outras raças sentientes de Britannia. <br>-----"
  },
  "1114848": {
    "ENU": " The Orcish tongue may fall unpleasingly 'pon the ear, yet it has within it a complex grammar oft misunderstood by those who merely hear the few broken words of English our orcish brothers",
    "PTB": "A língua Orca pode soar desagradavelmente aos ouvidos, mas possui uma gramática complexa frequentemente mal compreendida por aqueles que apenas ouvem algumas palavras quebradas de inglês de nossos irmãos orcs"
  },
  "1114849": {
    "ENU": "manage without education.<br><br> These are the basic rules of orcish:<br><br> Orcish has five tenses: present, past, future imperfect, present",
    "PTB": "gerenciar sem educação.<br><br> Estas são as regras básicas do orcish:<br><br> Orcish tem cinco tempos: presente, passado, futuro imperfeito, presente"
  },
  "1114850": {
    "ENU": "interjectional, and prehensile.<br><br> Examples: gugroflu, gugrofloog, gugrobo, gugroglu!, gugrogug.<br><br> All transitive verbs in",
    "PTB": "interjectivo e prehensil.<br><br> Exemplos: gugroflu, gugrofloog, gugrobo, gugroglu!, gugrogug.<br><br> Todos os verbos transitivos em"
  },
  "1114851": {
    "ENU": "the prehensile tense end it \"ug\".<br><br> Examples: urgleighug, biggugdaghgug, curdakalmug.<br><br> All present interjectional conjugations start with",
    "PTB": "o tempo prehensil terminam em \"ug\".<br><br> Exemplos: urgleighug, biggugdaghgug, curdakalmug.<br><br> Todas as conjugações interjectivas presentes começam com"
  },
  "1114852": {
    "ENU": "the letter G unless the contain the third declensive accent of the letter U. <br><br> Examples: ghothudunglug, but not azhbuugub.",
    "PTB": "a letra G a menos que contenham o terceiro acento declensivo da letra U. <br><br> Exemplos: ghothudunglug, mas não azhbuugub."
  },
  "1114853": {
    "ENU": " The past tense can only refer to events since the last meal, but the prehensile tense can refer to any event within reach.<br><br> The present tense is conjugated like the future",
    "PTB": "O tempo passado só pode se referir a eventos desde a última refeição, mas o tempo prehensil pode se referir a qualquer evento ao alcance."
  },
  "1114854": {
    "ENU": "imperfect tense, when the interrogative mode is used by pitching the sound a quarter-tone higher. Orcish hath no concept of person, as in first person, third person, I, we, etc.",
    "PTB": "tempo imperfeito, quando o modo interrogativo é usado elevando o som um quarto de tom. Orcish não tem conceito de pessoa, como primeira pessoa, terceira pessoa, eu, nós, etc."
  },
  "1114855": {
    "ENU": " Orcish grammar relies upon the three cardinal rules of accretion, prefixing, and agglutination, in addition to pitch. In the former, phonemes combine into larger words which may contain full",
    "PTB": "A gramática orca depende das três regras cardeais de acreção, prefixação e aglutinação, além do tom. Na primeira, fonemas se combinam em palavras maiores que podem conter"
  },
  "1114856": {
    "ENU": "phrasal significance. In the second, prefixing specific phonetic sounds changes the subject of the sentence into object, interrogative, addressed individual, or dinner.",
    "PTB": "significância frasal completa. Na segunda, prefixação de sons fonéticos específicos muda o sujeito da sentença em objeto, interrogativo, indivíduo endereçado ou jantar."
  },
  "1114857": {
    "ENU": " Agglutination occurs whenever four of the same letter are present in a word, in which case, any two of them may be removed or slurred.<br><br> Pitch changes the",
    "PTB": "Aglutinação ocorre sempre que quatro das mesmas letras estão presentes em uma palavra, caso em que qualquer duas delas podem ser removidas ou arrastadas.<br><br> Mudanças de tom"
  },
  "1114858": {
    "ENU": "phoneme value of individual syllables, thus completely altering what a word may mean. The classic example is \"Aktgluthugrot bigglogubuu dargilgaglug lublublub\" which can mean \"You are such a pretty",
    "PTB": "alteram o valor fonético de sílabas individuais, mudando completamente o significado de uma palavra. O exemplo clássico é \"Aktgluthugrot bigglogubuu dargilgaglug lublublub\" que pode significar \"Você é tão bonita"
  },
  "1114859": {
    "ENU": "girl,\" \"My mother ate your primroses,\" or \"Jellyfish nose paints alms potato,\" depending on pitch.<br><br> Orcish poetry often relies upon repeating the",
    "PTB": "garota\", \"Minha mãe comeu suas prímulas\" ou \"Nariz de água-viva pinta esmolas batata\", dependendo do tom.<br><br> A poesia orca frequentemente depende de repetir"
  },
  "1114860": {
    "ENU": "same phrase in multiple pitches, even changing pitch midword. None of this great art is translatable.<br><br> The orcish language uses the following vowels:",
    "PTB": "a mesma frase em múltiplos tons, até mudando o tom no meio da palavra. Nenhuma dessa grande arte é traduzível.<br><br> A língua orca usa as seguintes vogais:"
  },
  "1114861": {
    "ENU": "ab, ad, ag, akt, at, augh, auh, azh, e, i, o, oo, u, uu. The vowel sound a is not recognized as a vowel and does not exist in their alphabet. The orcish alphabet is best learned using the classic rhyme",
    "PTB": "ab, ad, ag, akt, at, augh, auh, azh, e, i, o, oo, u, uu. O som da vogal a não é reconhecido como vogal e não existe em seu alfabeto. O alfabeto orca é melhor aprendido usando a clássica rima"
  },
  "1114862": {
    "ENU": "repeated at 23 different pitches:<br><br> Lugnog ghu blat suggaroglug, <br> Gaghbuu dakdar ab highugbo,<br> Gothnogbuim ad",
    "PTB": "repetida em 23 tons diferentes:<br><br> Lugnog ghu blat suggaroglug, <br> Gaghbuu dakdar ab highugbo,<br> Gothnogbuim ad"
  },
  "1114863": {
    "ENU": "gilgubbugbuilug<br> Bilgeaugh thurggulg stuiggro!<br><br>A translation of the first pitch:<br> Eat food, the first letter is ab,",
    "PTB": "gilgubbugbuilug<br> Bilgeaugh thurggulg stuiggro!<br><br>Uma tradução do primeiro tom:<br> Coma comida, a primeira letra é ab,"
  },
  "1114864": {
    "ENU": " Kill people, the next letter is ad,<br> I forget the rest<br> But augh is in there somewhere!<br><br> What follows is a complete phonetic library",
    "PTB": "Mate pessoas, a próxima letra é ad,<br> Eu esqueço o resto<br> Mas augh está em algum lugar!<br><br> O que se segue é uma biblioteca fonética completa"
  },
  "1114865": {
    "ENU": "of the orcish language: ab, ad, ag, akt, alm, at, augh, auh, azh, ba, ba, bag, bar, baz, bid, bilge, bo, bog, bog, brui, bu, buad, bug, bug, buil, buim, bum, buo, buor, buu, ca, car, clog, cro, cuk, cur,",
    "PTB": "da língua orca: ab, ad, ag, akt, alm, at, augh, auh, azh, ba, ba, bag, bar, baz, bid, bilge, bo, bog, bog, brui, bu, buad, bug, bug, buil, buim, bum, buo, buor, buu, ca, car, clog, cro, cuk, cur,"
  },
  "1114866": {
    "ENU": "da, dagh, dagh, dak, dar, deak, der, dil, dit, dor, dre, dri, dru, du, dud, duf, dug, dug, duh, dun, eag, eg, egg, eichel, ek, ep, ewk, faugh, fid, flu, fog, foo, foz, fruk, fu, fub, fud, fun, fup, fur, gaa,"
  },
  "1114867": {
    "ENU": "gag, gagh, gan, gar, gh, gha, ghat, ghed, ghid, gho, ghu, gig, gil, gka, glu, glu, glug, gna, gno, gnu, gol, gom, goth, grunt, grut, gu, gub, gub, gug, gug, gugh, guk, guk,"
  },
  "1114868": {
    "ENU": " <br>"
  },
  "1114869": {
    "ENU": " While 'tis true that the musician who seeketh only to make sweet music for herself and for others needs little more than some talent, and stern practice at the chosen instrument, those of us"
  },
  "1114870": {
    "ENU": "who seek the open road shall find indeed that a greater skill is required. Herein discover those secrets which I have learned over the years as an itinerant performer..."
  },
  "1114871": {
    "ENU": " Once I was in Jhelom, and accidentally angered a bravo of some local repute, whose blade flickered all too eagerly near my slender neck (for I was young then). After various threats to \"ruin"
  },
  "1114872": {
    "ENU": "my pretty face\" this bravo grabbed my arm in a most unseemly fashion and tossed me into a barbaric enclosure locally entitled a dueling pit. My plaintive cries for help went unheeded by the"
  },
  "1114873": {
    "ENU": "guards, for the inhabitants of Jhelom are eager indeed to measure fighting prowess at any time!<br><br> What saved me was the ability to improvise a"
  },
  "1114874": {
    "ENU": "melody and tune that satirized the proceedings, and sufficiently angered an onlooker to prod him to coming to my defense. Once that fight was underway I was able to make good my escape."
  },
  "1114875": {
    "ENU": "Hence, I regard the ability to incite fights as indispensable to the prudent bard.<br><br> Upon another occasion, 'twas the obverse side of that coin which saved me"
  },
  "1114876": {
    "ENU": "for I was being held prisoner by a particularly nasty band of ruffians who had seized me unawares from the road to Vesper.<br><br> They had worked"
  },
  "1114877": {
    "ENU": "themselves into a frenzy and were ready to attack and I fear, tear me limb from limb, when I began to sing frantically, tapping my fallen drum wit my tied up feet. The melody developed into a soothing"
  },
  "1114878": {
    "ENU": "one, and the brigands slowly calmed down to the extent of apologizing, and they let me go!<br><br> A final example I would pray you grant your attention: once I was lost"
  },
  "1114879": {
    "ENU": "upon a large isle far to the east of the mainland, well beyond Serpent's Hold, where lava made its sluggish way across the surface landscape. And this accursed land was filled with vile beats and"
  },
  "1114880": {
    "ENU": "cunning dragons.<br><br> I was being pursued by one of said fell dragons when I found myself trapped. I quickly skirted a bubbling pool of molten rock and attempted to"
  },
  "1114881": {
    "ENU": "hide.<br><br> The dragon scented me and was preparing to skirt the pool, when I began to play a lusty tune upon my lute that attracted its attention."
  },
  "1114882": {
    "ENU": "Mesmerized and enticed by the melody, it stepped directly towards me, and into the lava-where its foot was so burned that it quickly hopped away, undignified and annoyed. "
  },
  "1114883": {
    "ENU": " 'Tis my fond hope that other travailing minstrels shall learn from my experience and apply themselves to practicing these skills in order to preserve life and limb. "
  },
  "1114884": {
    "ENU": ""
  },
