  "1115215": {
    "ENU": "The amount of damage you can withstand. If your Hit Points ever go below zero, you will die."
  },
  "1115216": {
    "ENU": "Determines how fast you can swing a weapon. Several physical actions reduce your Stamina including taking damage and running. Full Stamina is required to push through others in a non-consensual PvP areas."
  },
  "1115217": {
    "ENU": "The energy that allows you to cast spells."
  },
  "1115218": {
    "ENU": "Represents your physical essence. Your Hit Points are determined by your Strength."
  },
  "1115219": {
    "ENU": "Represents your hand-to-eye coordination and reflexes. Your Stamina is determined by your Dexterity."
  },
  "1115220": {
    "ENU": "Represents your mental capacity. Your Mana is determined by your Intelligence."
  },
  "1115221": {
    "ENU": "Your maximum allowable sum for Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence."
  },
  "1115222": {
    "ENU": "Determines your chance to find greater amounts of loot and greater quality loot."
  },
  "1115223": {
    "ENU": "Your carrying capacity."
  },
  "1115224": {
    "ENU": "The amount of gold you are carrying."
  },
  "1115225": {
    "ENU": "The number of pets, hirelings, and constructs under your control."
  },
  "1115226": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the damage taken from attacks that cause Physical Damage."
  },
  "1115227": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the damage taken from attacks that cause Fire Damage."
  },
  "1115228": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the damage taken from attacks that cause Cold Damage."
  },
  "1115229": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the damage taken from attacks that cause Poison Damage."
  },
  "1115230": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the damage taken from attacks that cause Energy Damage."
  },
  "1115231": {
    "ENU": "The amount of damage you can inflict on successful melee or ranged attacks."
  },
  "1115232": {
    "ENU": "Increases your chance of successfully hitting a target.  This can be negated by your target's Defense Chance Increase value."
  },
  "1115233": {
    "ENU": "Increases the rate of your melee attacks."
  },
  "1115234": {
    "ENU": "Increases the damage you inflict on successful melee or ranged attacks."
  },
  "1115235": {
    "ENU": "Increases the chance of not using reagents when casting spells."
  },
  "1115236": {
    "ENU": "Increase the potency of potions used."
  },
  "1115237": {
    "ENU": "Increases the damage you inflict on successful spell attacks."
  },
  "1115238": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the recovery time between casting spells."
  },
  "1115239": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the time it takes to cast a spell."
  },
  "1115240": {
    "ENU": "Reduces the mana needed to cast a spell."
  },
  "1115241": {
    "ENU": "Increases the rate of Hit Point recovery."
  },
  "1115242": {
    "ENU": "Increases the rate of Stamina recovery."
  },
  "1115243": {
    "ENU": "Increases the rate of Mana recovery."
  },
  "1115244": {
    "ENU": "The percentage of damage inflicted on attackers when you take Physical Damage."
  },
  "1115245": {
    "ENU": "Increases the chance of defending yourself from melee or ranged attacks.  This can negate your opponents’ Hit Chance Increase values."
  },
  "1115246": {
    "ENU": "More Info"
  },
  "1115247": {
    "ENU": "Item Identification, if used successfully, will allow you to gather information about the chosen item. You will be given a description that varies in detail and accuracy depending on your skill level."
  },
  "1115248": {
    "ENU": "Anatomy allows you to evaluate the ability of other creatures and improves healing."
  },
  "1115249": {
    "ENU": "Camping will allow you to leave the world of Britannia immediately upon successful completion of building your campground."
  },
  "1115250": {
    "ENU": "The Focus skill could be defined as the \"Warrior's Meditation Skill.\" It increases both a player's Mana and Stamina regeneration."
  },
  "1115251": {
    "ENU": "Use of the healing skill will allow you to heal yourself or other players. If you are successful in your efforts, the recipient will regain health, and the bandage will be used up."
  },
  "1115252": {
    "ENU": "Fencing is a melee combat skill, which allows for an quick attack style of fighting."
  },
  "1115253": {
    "ENU": "Mace fighting is a melee combat skill, which allows for an quick attack style of fighting."
  },
  "1115254": {
    "ENU": "Swordsmanship is a melee combat skill, which allows for a strong-arm attack style of fighting."
  },
  "1115255": {
    "ENU": "Throwing is a ranged combat skill. Thrown weapons return to you and do not require ammunition."
  },
  "1115256": {
    "ENU": "This skill will allow you to cast a variety of spells in the game. To cast a spell, your hands must be free of any items (except a spellbook), you must have a spellbook with the appropriate spell contained therein, and you must have the appropriate reagents in your pack."
  },
  "1115257": {
    "ENU": "Spirit Speak is used to be able to understand the speech of ghosts. If you do not have this skill you will only be able to see a series of \"OoOOoo\"s emanating from the deceased. The Spirit Speak skill is also used to heal players by channeling spiritual energy."
  },
  "1115258": {
    "ENU": "Mysticism consists of 16 spells and eight circles that signify their power and the magic ability required to cast them. These eight concentric circles correspond to vortices within the ether, all spinning one within another as they expand through the universe. The more powerful a spell you wish to cast, the deeper into the inner circles of ether you must penetrate."
  },
  "1115259": {
    "ENU": "The Imbuing skill allows player characters to imbue items with magical properties. It also allows player characters to magically unravel items into special ingredients. Artificers use these ingredients when imbuing items with magical power."
  },
  "1115260": {
    "ENU": "The hiding skill allows you to become invisible to other players. While you are hidden, you are not totally impervious to detection or attack. You can be revealed by spellcasters, the Detect Hidden skill, and can be tracked using the tracking skill. You can also take damage from area effect spells, and purple potions."
  },
  "1115261": {
    "ENU": "The lockpicking skill is exactly that, it is used to open locked items. In order to attempt to pick a lock, you must have a set of lockpicks in your pack. Lockpicks can be purchased from thief shopkeepers. Double-click on your lockpicks, and then target the item to be picked. If you are successful the lock will be picked, and you can open the item."
  },
  "1115262": {
    "ENU": "The poisoning skill can be used to poison a weapon or even food and drink. To create the vial of poison you will need to have the reagent nightshade, and then mix it in pestle and mortar. Once it is mixed, it will pour into the empty bottle in your pack."
  },
  "1115263": {
    "ENU": "Evaluating intelligence allows you to learn certain things about the mental makeup of the beings you select. A high evaluate intelligence skill also allows mages to successfully overcome the natural resistance of creatures to magic."
  },
  "1115264": {
    "ENU": "Your healing stone does not have enough energy to remove the poison."
  },
  "1115265": {
    "ENU": "Your Mysticism, Focus, or Imbuing Skills are not enough to use the heal stone to cure yourself."
  },
  "1115266": {
    "ENU": "The healing stone has used up all its energy and has been destroyed."
  },
  "1115267": {
    "ENU": "Displays the game in full-screen mode."
  },
  "1115268": {
    "ENU": "You must wait a few seconds before you can summon a new healing stone."
  },
  "1115269": {
    "ENU": "Monitor resolution to use when in full-screen mode."
  },
  "1115270": {
    "ENU": "The maximum allowable frames to display per second. Decrease this to improve performance."
  },
  "1115271": {
    "ENU": "Displays the window frame around the game client. Only applicable when full-screen mode is turned off."
  },
  "1115272": {
