  "1116343": {
    "ENU": "We seek to take back the land of Sosaria from the monsterous races, such as the Ophidians and the Meer."
  },
  "1116344": {
    "ENU": "The Meer are a devious race, they creep about like cats and have dangerous magics.  They once cursed Yew with their foul evil and it took many lives to restore it."
  },
  "1116345": {
    "ENU": "The bounty collector is now collecting powercrystals to keep them away from our enemies the Meer.  We believe they are planning to use them against the human race."
  },
  "1116346": {
    "ENU": "If you want to prove yourself, go kill those wretched Meer.  Telling me you are loyal proves nothing."
