  "1116571": {
    "ENU": "The dockmaster has no need for this item."
  },
  "1116572": {
    "ENU": "Sorry as I am to say it, the maximum I can have on yer account be three million."
  },
  "1116573": {
    "ENU": "I hate to tell ye this, but we don't rent boat slips fer less time than five minutes.  I'll be needin the full 10000 gold or no deal.  Perhaps renting a crate is more in your price range, captain?"
  },
  "1116574": {
    "ENU": "Thanks for the tip, friend!"
  },
  "1116575": {
    "ENU": "Jes' wait right there and me team o' magic sea horses will get ye towed into a slip before ye can say kraken, captain!"
  },
  "1116576": {
    "ENU": "Check back later, friend, all me slips be full right now.  If yer in a hurry, I can see if I have a crate in me warehouse?"
  },
  "1116577": {
    "ENU": "'Tis a pleasure doin' business with ye, friend, I have updated yer account!"
