    "ENU": "You must have the High Seas booster pack to use this map."
  },
  "1149693": {
    "ENU": "You must own the ship to do that."
  },
  "1149694": {
    "ENU": "You cannot dock the ship here."
  },
  "1149695": {
    "ENU": "Small Soul Forge"
  },
  "1149696": {
    "ENU": "As a young player, you may not enter this area."
  },
  "1149697": {
    "ENU": "mooring line"
  },
  "1149698": {
    "ENU": "wheel"
  },
  "1149699": {
    "ENU": "cargo hold"
  },
  "1149700": {
    "ENU": "weapon pad"
  },
  "1149701": {
    "ENU": "Release me, ye scallywags! Ye don't know who ye are messin' with!"
  },
  "1149702": {
    "ENU": "Very well, I see yer point, release me and I will stop being a dread pirate."
  },
  "1149703": {
    "ENU": "I'm not really that bad, you know.  I'm hardly \"dread\", I'm more like concerned."
  },
  "1149704": {
    "ENU": "You bilge rats don't have the courage to fight me to the death!  Release me at once and we'll settle this like sailors!"
  },
  "1149705": {
    "ENU": "I've been inspectin' yer deck while I been standin' here, and whoever swabbed it last missed a spot."
  },
  "1149706": {
    "ENU": "That sail's trimmed not quite right, if ye will just cut me lose for a minute, I'll be glad to fix it right up."
  },
  "1149707": {
    "ENU": "Nice ship ye got here, o' course it's gonna be nicer once it's under my command."
  },
  "1149708": {
    "ENU": "I've seen the error o' me ways, ye can release me now.  No need for a tribunal, jus' drop me off at Buc's Den."
  },
  "1149709": {
    "ENU": "Look, a flying golem!"
  },
  "1149710": {
    "ENU": "Ye must believe me, I be personal friends with the Captain of the Guard and he said I was not to be chained up."
  },
  "1149711": {
    "ENU": "These chains are pinchin' a little.  If ye would loosen them up a wee bit I would be appreciatin' it."
  },
  "1149712": {
    "ENU": "Ye just got lucky I tell ya, release me and we shall fight again and this time I will win!"
  },
  "1149713": {
    "ENU": "That guy is not steering the boat right. You better watch him.  See, I'm helping.  You don't want to turn in a helper."
  },
  "1149714": {
    "ENU": "What this boat really needs is a captain with compassion... like... maybe me!  What do ye say, fellas?"
  },
  "1149715": {
    "ENU": "Ye are going to regret turnin' me in, I could have lead ye to me secret treasure!"
  },
  "1149716": {
    "ENU": "Dread pirate haters..."
  },
  "1149717": {
    "ENU": "Sorry, that was me."
  },
  "1149718": {
    "ENU": "Listen up ye layabouts!  Tis time to get some work done!  Hoist the sails, Man the cannons, and unchain me.  The world of adventure is upon us!"
  },
  "1149719": {
    "ENU": "Let's make a deal.  Ye unchain me and I will give ye the location of me treasure."
  },
  "1149720": {
    "ENU": "Release me, and I swear I won't kill you or your friends or your pets."
  },
  "1149721": {
    "ENU": "The pirate escapes and swims away.  Curse you, dread pirate!"
  },
  "1149722": {
    "ENU": "Your spellsong has ended."
  },
  "1149723": {
    "ENU": "You cannot place a ship this far out to sea. You must be near land or shallow water."
  },
  "1149724": {
    "ENU": "<CENTER>Passenger and Crew Manifest</CENTER>"
  },
  "1149725": {
    "ENU": "N/A"
  },
  "1149726": {
    "ENU": "DENY ACCESS"
  },
  "1149727": {
    "ENU": "PASSENGER"
  },
  "1149728": {
    "ENU": "CREW"
  },
  "1149729": {
    "ENU": "OFFICER"
  },
  "1149730": {
    "ENU": "CAPTAIN"
  },
  "1149731": {
    "ENU": "Public Access:"
  },
  "1149732": {
    "ENU": "Party Access:"
  },
  "1149733": {
    "ENU": "Guild Access:"
  },
  "1149734": {
    "ENU": "ACCESS LIST"
  },
  "1149735": {
    "ENU": "HELP"
  },
  "1149736": {
    "ENU": "You may grant or deny access to your ship to the public, to members of your party, to members of your guild, and to specific characters. Multiple security settings may apply to specific characters. In these cases, if any matching setting is \"Deny Access\" then that character is not allowed any access to the ship. Otherwise, that character receives the highest applicable level of access. For example, if you allow members of your guild Passenger access and members of your party Crew access, then a member of your guild who is also in your party will be considered Crew."
  },
  "1149737": {
    "ENU": "N/A: This setting does not grant or deny privileges aboard the ship"
  },
  "1149738": {
    "ENU": "DENY ACCESS: revokes all privileges aboard the ship, overriding all other permissions"
  },
  "1149739": {
    "ENU": "Passenger: allows boarding the ship using the mooring lines or by recall/gate travel"
  },
  "1149740": {
    "ENU": "Crew: allows operation of the ship's weapons and piloting the ship"
  },
  "1149741": {
    "ENU": "Officer: allows access to the cargo hold, and installation or dismantling of weaponry."
  },
  "1149742": {
    "ENU": "Captain: grants all privileges, including dry docking and changing security settings"
  },
  "1149743": {
    "ENU": "Party membership modifies access to this ship:"
  },
