  "1149851": {
    "ENU": "good"
  },
  "1149852": {
    "ENU": "fair"
  },
  "1149853": {
    "ENU": "worn"
  },
  "1149854": {
    "ENU": "As the magic of the hook fades, it transforms to a normal fishhook.  The fishing pole returns to normal."
  },
  "1149855": {
    "ENU": "You must have the High Seas booster pack to use this."
  },
  "1149856": {
    "ENU": "Yar, me aunt's cousin's husband told me ~1_val~ was spotted at ~2_val~."
  },
  "1149857": {
    "ENU": "Beware matey, I hears ~1_val~ was spotted at ~2_val~."
  },
  "1149858": {
    "ENU": "Shiver me timbers! That dread pirate ~1_val~ has been spotted at ~2_val~!"
  },
  "1149859": {
    "ENU": "Yar not going t' believe this, but ~1_val~ has been spotted at ~2_val~..."
  },
  "1149860": {
    "ENU": "I jes' heard from me best friends mother's ex-tailor that ~1_val~ has been spotted at ~2_val~."
  },
  "1149861": {
    "ENU": "If ye be goin' to ~2_val~, watch out fer the Dread Pirate ~1_val~."
  },
  "1149862": {
    "ENU": "I'm just in from ~2_val~ and I seen ~1_val~ sinkin' a merchant ship!"
  },
  "1149863": {
    "ENU": "We're jes in from ~2_val~, we saw ~1_val~ there so we high tailed it to the seamarket!"
  },
  "1149864": {
    "ENU": "I have on good authority, if'n ye were at ~2_val~ right now, ye would be dead because ~1_val~ is there."
  },
  "1149865": {
    "ENU": "I hear there be a ship going down at ~2_val~ right now because ~1_val~ sank it."
  },
  "1149866": {
    "ENU": "You are too young to receive a ~1_TYPE~ gift."
  },
  "1149867": {
    "ENU": "13th anniversary gift bag"
  },
  "1149868": {
    "ENU": "Forged Metal of Artifacts"
  },
  "1149869": {
    "ENU": "Target an item to enhance with the properties of your selected material (Success Rate: ~1_VAL~%)."
  },
  "1149870": {
    "ENU": "You must have the High Seas booster pack to receive credit for capturing a pirate."
  },
  "1149871": {
    "ENU": "You must have the High Seas booster pack to receive credit for killing a pirate."
  },
  "1149872": {
    "ENU": "You have received credit for killing a pirate."
  },
  "1149873": {
    "ENU": "You have received credit for capturing a pirate. To receive your reward you must be present when the pirate is brought to justice."
  },
  "1149874": {
    "ENU": "You wouldn't want to cut up something this rare without a good reason."
  },
  "1149875": {
    "ENU": "We don't really nerf, we alter for completely evil and selfish reasons...<br><br>-Uriah"
  },
  "1149876": {
    "ENU": "I kill because I care!!<br><br>-Mesanna"
  },
  "1149877": {
    "ENU": "There can be no order without chaos.<br><br>-Supreem"
  },
  "1149878": {
    "ENU": "Thirteen years of Ultima Online: now it's a lifestyle!<br><br>-Phoenix"
  },
  "1149879": {
    "ENU": "UO is finally a teenager. Everyone commence with the adolescent humor! Thanks for playing.<br><br>-Shade"
  },
  "1149880": {
    "ENU": "If you kill one man you are a murderer. If you can kill them all with a double click, then you're a developer.<br><br>-Logrus"
  },
  "1149881": {
    "ENU": "Sometimes it takes more than skill,“all kill”.<br><br>-Bleak"
  },
  "1149882": {
    "ENU": "Forest fires prevent bears.<br><br>-Axel"
  },
  "1149883": {
    "ENU": "This card will self-destruct in 13 seconds.<br><br>-Argyle"
  },
  "1149884": {
    "ENU": "Evil will always triumph because Good... is... dumb!<br><br>-TheGrimmOmen"
  },
  "1149885": {
    "ENU": "Ogers!<br><br>-Misk"
  },
  "1149886": {
    "ENU": "In honor of your service to...Oh look, Saltpeter! Mine.<br><br>-Kerlean"
  },
  "1149887": {
    "ENU": "After thirteen years of rough seas, what storm does this calm portend?<br><br>-MrsTroubleMaker"
  },
  "1149888": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for being with us on the thirteenth anniversary of Ultima Online's launch.<br><br>-The UO Team"
  },
  "1149889": {
    "ENU": "We love order, but Britannia is always chaotic. But, no problem. Everything is fine. This is UO and thirteen-year history proves it.<br><br>-Wasia"
  },
  "1149890": {
    "ENU": "See you on the Battlefield!<br><br>-Drake"
  },
  "1149891": {
    "ENU": "Remember to make it feel UO-ey!<br><br>-Krunchi"
  },
  "1149892": {
    "ENU": "Placeholder 13th Anniv - Other Card Text"
  },
