  "1150426": {
    "ENU": "You won a lease on Stall ~1_STALLNAME~ at the ~2_FACET~ New Magincia Bazaar. Your bid amount of ~3_BIDAMT~gp won the auction and has been remitted. Your lease begins immediately and will continue for 7 days."
