  "1150428": {
    "ENU": "You won a lease and moved to Stall ~1_STALLNAME~ at the ~2_FACET~ New Magincia Bazaar. The lease on your previous stall has been terminated. Your hired merchant, if any, has relocated your stall and goods to the new lot. Your bid amount of ~3_BIDAMT~gp has been remitted."
