    "ENU": "sec"
  },
  "1151112": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151113": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151114": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~ and ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151115": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~ ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151116": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~, ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~, and ~5_COUNT~ ~6_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151117": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~ ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~ ~5_COUNT~ ~6_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151118": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~, ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~, ~5_COUNT~ ~6_UNITS~, and ~7_COUNT~ ~8_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151119": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~ ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~ ~5_COUNT~ ~6_UNITS~ ~7_COUNT~ ~8_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151120": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~, ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~, ~5_COUNT~ ~6_UNITS~, ~7_COUNT~ ~8_UNITS~, and ~9_COUNT~ ~10_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151121": {
    "ENU": "~1_COUNT~ ~2_UNITS~ ~3_COUNT~ ~4_UNITS~ ~5_COUNT~ ~6_UNITS~ ~7_COUNT~ ~8_UNITS~ ~9_COUNT~ ~10_UNITS~"
  },
  "1151122": {
    "ENU": "Ritual: Scales of a Dream Serpent"
  },
  "1151123": {
    "ENU": "Thank you for heeding my summons,  adventurer.  I hope that you will be willing to come to the aid of us once again. <br><br>\tWhen I faced the Defiler, I mentioned to you that he was practically invulnerable to both magical and physical attacks. This was due to a very potent magical barrier which covers his entire body. Weaved from the darkest part of the Void, the barrier absorbs any spell or attack wielded against it. <br><br>\tOriginally, Naxatilor believed that the magical power of creation would be enough to destroy the barrier and defeat the beast, but he was mistaken. Though our magic was able to slightly wound Scelestus, it was still not powerful enough to fully penetrate the daemon’s shield.  I have long sought a way to magnify the magic that we used against the Defiler and, in my research, discovered a ritual that will do exactly that.<br><br>\tThe ritual is ancient, dangerous, and requires many obscure components that are not easy to obtain. I have often been away from my throne due to the pursuit of these components, and have been successful in acquiring all but five of them. It is in the acquisition of the remaining items that I must seek your aid, adventurer.<br><br>\tThe first component that I require is a handful of scales from a Dream Serpent.<br><br>\tDream Serpents are fickle, mischievous creatures that are invisible to the naked eye. In order to see the creatures, you must be able to see outside of the mortal realm and into the realm of dreams. I have had a potion crafted that will grant the drinker temporary, limited insight into the dream realm, and this should provide you with the ability to see the elusive beasts. <br><br>\tTake this potion and journey once again to the Southwestern Flight Tower.  On your way to the Athenaeum, you may have noticed a clearing surrounded by four hillocks. This location is an intersection of the ley lines which run throughout my kingdom. Ley lines are energized, concentrated lines of magical energy and are irresistible to dream serpents. In an effort to draw the attention of one of these creatures, I have crafted a ring of energized stones to harness the ley line energies of the crossroads.<br><br>\tOnce you arrive at the location, drink the potion, and you will be granted dream vision. If my calculations are correct, you should find a serpent and be able to interact with the creature. Heed my warning, adventurer: you should not seek to harm the beast. Offensive tactics must be avoided at all costs, as these magical beings help keep the very energy of Ter Mur harnessed and in balance. Speak with the creature and ask for its aid, but do not harm it.<br><br>\tWhen you have acquired the scales, return to me and I shall reward you and guide you towards the second component. <br><br>"
  },
  "1151124": {
    "ENU": "You do not wish to assist me? Then I shall wait for someone who does not wish to sit idly by while my people suffer. Be gone from my sight, coward."
  },
  "1151125": {
    "ENU": "Were you able to acquire the scales? Please do not dally, adventurer!"
  },
  "1151126": {
    "ENU": "You have the scales? Excellent! <br><br>\tWe are now one step closer to completing the list of components for the ritual, my friend. With your assistance, I believe we will be able to acquire all of them just in time.<br><br>\tNow, on to the next component."
  },
  "1151127": {
    "ENU": "Ritual: Hair of the Dryad Queen"
  },
  "1151128": {
    "ENU": "The next component that I require belongs to a creature you will only discover on Fire Island: a Dryad Queen. <br><br>\tForces of nature unto themselves, dryad queens oversee the rule of the lush and verdant forests throughout our world. Ages ago, before the Void came, dryads were plentiful within Ter Mur. But the Void swallows everything living and, because they are the embodiment of nature and life, the dryads fled my kingdom for safer ground.  With my assistance, the Dryad Queen, Oakwhisper, was able to lead her children to the safety of Fire Island’s dense forests.<br><br>\tYou must journey to Fire Island and venture deep into the labyrinthine woods.  I cannot provide you with a specific location, as Queen Oakwhisper’s clearing is magically protected and the forest tends to change at her will. What you seek is a majestic, ancient tree that towers above all the others, in clearing full of life. When you discover this tree, you must approach it and place your hand upon it, so that Oakwhisper may judge you worthy for entrance into her bower. I hope, given your honorable intentions, the Dryad Queen will grant you an audience. <br><br>\tWhen you speak with her, inform her of the doom that my people face and ask her for a strand of her hair. I hope that she will comply.<br><br>\tOnce you have acquired the hair, return to me and I shall inform you of the next component and its location. <br><br>"
  },
  "1151129": {
    "ENU": "Have you met with Queen Oakwhisper?"
  },
  "1151130": {
    "ENU": "You have acquired a strand of Oakwhisper's hair? You have my gratitude for your continued support. Now, for the next component."
  },
  "1151131": {
    "ENU": "Ritual: Tears of a Soulbinder"
  },
  "1151132": {
    "ENU": "I fear I must now send you to convene with a creature that may not prove as willing to help as the ones you have encountered previously, my friend. I require the crystallized tear of a Soulbinder, a malevolent creature that prefers to roam the desolate edges of my kingdom where the Void has consumed much of the area.<br><br>\tSpawned from the depths of the Abyss, the Soulbinder is a vile and disgusting creature that prefers to consume its victims alive, devouring their souls during its digestion. It is the spirit of its prey that nourishes the beast, and this hunger is the only thing the beast knows. I know not how you will cause one of these monsters to shed a tear, but I believe you are resourceful enough to find a way.<br><br>\tJourney to the northeast, and follow the twisting strips of land surrounded by the Void; you should be able to locate a path to the lair of this foul thing. I wish I could provide you with guidance regarding approaching the beast, but I have been unable to discern anything beyond its location. Be on your guard, adventurer, and be prepared to do battle should the beast prove hostile.<br><br>"
  },
  "1151133": {
    "ENU": "Were you able to obtain the Soulbinder's Tear?"
  },
  "1151134": {
    "ENU": "You continue to amaze me, my friend. I will admit I was concerned that the Soulbinder would prove to be too much of a challenge and, yet, here you are. <br><br>Are you ready to go after the next component?"
  },
  "1151135": {
    "ENU": "For the next component, you must traverse the northern desert. On the far edge, you will find a teleporter similar to that which you took to the Athenaeum Isle.  This will take you to a barren, small, and twisted piece of land that was long ago drained by the Void. <br><br>\tThe next component will be found there: a pristine crystal lotus. Long ago, what is now desert was a beautiful field of these flowers. Sadly, the Defiler's magic drained the land of life and energy, causing the land to become the wasteland it is today. However, one bloom remains, and it is that bloom you must acquire for me.<br><br>\tIn my research, I discovered that my predecessor, King Trajalem, had the only surviving bloom placed within a protective barrier on the island I am directing you to. No one knows exactly why he did so, but I have journeyed there myself and seen it with my own eyes. Unfortunately, I was not able to discern how to break the barrier protecting the lotus.<br><br>\tThe lotus stands on a pedestal surrounded by a configuration of magical tiles. I feel that these tiles are the key to breaking the barrier and obtaining the bloom but their secret eludes me.<br><br>\tJourney to the area, my friend, and please obtain the lotus. If anyone can do it, I have faith that it is you.<br><br>\tBe well, and I look forward to your return.<br><br>"
  },
  "1151136": {
    "ENU": "Ritual: Pristine Crystal Lotus"
  },
  "1151137": {
    "ENU": "Have you solved the secret of the lotus, my friend?"
  },
  "1151138": {
    "ENU": "Once again, you astound me with your perserverance and triumph! I cannot thank you enough. You are truly proving yourself a loyal friend.<br><br>Now, only one component remains."
  },
  "1151139": {
    "ENU": "Ritual: Heart of the Night Terror"
  },
  "1151140": {
    "ENU": "The bearer of the last component will be easy to find but extremely challenging to overcome, I fear. <br><br>\tIn eastern Ter Mur there lies a ghost town. Formerly a fishing village, this town was long since abandoned due to the instability of the land it sits upon. Now, it is the haunting ground of a vile and insidious creature: the Night Terror.<br><br>\tAnother former denizen of the Void, the Night Terror walks the empty streets of the village from dusk til dawn. The ghost town has become its playground, and it kills any who dare step foot there. <br><br>\tIt is the heart of this creature that I require, my friend. You must journey to its den, wait until nightfall, and slay the beast. Once you have done so, cut it open and tear out its heart. That is the final ingredient that I need.  Be careful, as the beast is extremely fierce and will not die quickly. <br><br>\tAs you have made it this far, I have faith you will no doubt defeat the Night Terror. I shall await your return.<br><br>"
  },
  "1151141": {
    "ENU": "You have come this far and turn away now? I am disappointed in you, adventurer, as are my people. Should you regain your sense of honor, do let me know."
  },
  "1151142": {
    "ENU": "Have you slain the beast and obtained its heart? Time is of the essence, friend; do not dally!"
  },
  "1151143": {
    "ENU": "The Night Terror is no more? I see by the heart in your hand that you have felled the beast.  You have truly proven yourself a friend and loyal subject. On behalf of Ter Mur, I thank you for your heroism and assure you it will never be forgotten. <br><br>With this final component, I can now begin the preparations for the ritual.  Time is waning, and I plan to bring down the stasis spell personally so that we determine when the Defiler walks again and not the other way around.<br><br>I will let you know when it is time; until then, please prepare yourself for the battle to come.<br><br>"
  },
  "1151144": {
    "ENU": "Catch Me If You Can!"
  },
  "1151145": {
    "ENU": "Hey, you! You can see me? <br><br>\tThis is wonderful! I haven’t spoken to a mortal in so long.  It can get pretty droll here in the realm of dreams, and I have no one to play with! There aren’t many of us left. <br><br>\tWhat’s that? You want something? <br><br>\tMy scales! Ha ha! You mortals are so silly, always after something or other. <br><br>\tWell, I’ll happily give you some scales if you agree to play a game with me! I love games, don’t you? <br><br>\tLet’s see how fast you are, mortal. If you can hit me 6 times within one minute, then you win!  And don’t worry about hurting me; here in the realm of dreams nothing can hurt me unless I want it to! Which I don’t, because what fun would that be? <br><br>\tSo, do you want to play with me?"
  },
  "1151146": {
    "ENU": "You don’t want to play? Boo! Go away!"
  },
  "1151147": {
    "ENU": "Ah ha! Looks like you are not very fast. Want to play again?"
  },
  "1151148": {
    "ENU": "        Boo, I don’t like to lose! But wasn’t that fun? <br><br>\tHere are some of my scales; give them to the Gargoyle Queen with my blessing and tell her she needs to come play a game with me sometime!"
  },
  "1151149": {
    "ENU": "Knowledge of Nature",
    "PTB": "Conhecimento da Natureza"
  },
  "1151150": {
    "ENU": "Greetings, mortal. <br><br>\tI sensed the aura of the Gargoyle Queen surrounding you, which is why you have been allowed entry into my bower.  Zhah proved herself a friend to my people long ago when she aided us in escaping her crumbling lands .   <br><br>Do not think that will be enough for me to provide you with what you seek.  <br><br>\tI know that you require a strand of my hair, mortal; I am one with nature and can sense the thoughts of those who tread my forest.  While I understand you bear the intention of aiding the Gargoyle Queen, you must first prove yourself a friend of the forest before I will part with it. <br><br>\tI ask that you answer a few questions to show that you are knowledgeable about nature.  A series of questions; no more, no less.  If you answer them correctly and truthfully, I will bequeath a strand of my hair unto you. <br><br>\tDo you accept?",
    "PTB": "Saudações, mortal. <br><br> Senti a aura da Rainha Gargoyle ao seu redor, por isso foi permitida a sua entrada em meu refúgio. Zhah provou ser uma amiga do meu povo há muito tempo, quando nos ajudou a escapar de suas terras em ruínas. <br><br>Não pense que isso será suficiente para que eu lhe forneça o que procura. <br><br> Sei que você precisa de uma mecha do meu cabelo, mortal; sou uma com a natureza e posso sentir os pensamentos daqueles que pisam em minha floresta. Embora eu entenda que você pretende ajudar a Rainha Gargoyle, primeiro deve provar ser um amigo da floresta antes que eu a entregue. <br><br> Peço que responda a algumas perguntas para mostrar que conhece a natureza. Uma série de perguntas; nem mais, nem menos. Se responder correta e honestamente, deixarei uma mecha do meu cabelo com você. <br><br> Aceita?"
  },
  "1151151": {
    "ENU": "No? You will not gain my help without proving yourself.  If you will not do so, then apparently the Gargoyle Queen was a fool to choose you.",
    "PTB": "Não? Não obterá minha ajuda sem se provar. Se não fizer isso, então aparentemente a Rainha Gargoyle foi uma tola ao escolhê-lo."
  },
  "1151152": {
    "ENU": "It would appear that you need to improve your knowledge of nature, mortal. ",
    "PTB": "Parece que você precisa melhorar seu conhecimento da natureza, mortal."
  },
  "1151153": {
    "ENU": "Indeed, you are knowledge of the ways of the forest and nature, mortal. You have surprised me. <br><br>\tHere, accept this strand of my hair with my blessing.  Tell the Gargoyle Queen that I wish her luck, and hope that she will see her land whole again. <br><br>\tMay the sun shine on you, mortal. Farewell.",
    "PTB": "De fato, você conhece os caminhos da floresta e da natureza, mortal. Você me surpreendeu. <br><br> Aqui, aceite esta mecha do meu cabelo com minha bênção. Diga à Rainha Gargoyle que desejo-lhe sorte, e espero que ela possa ver sua terra inteira novamente. <br><br> Que o sol brilhe sobre você, mortal. Adeus."
  },
  "1151154": {
    "ENU": "Ah, what do we have here? <br><br>\tBah! I was so hoping you would be something other than a human, gargoyle, or elf. Do you know how many of them I have eaten? Your souls have filled me but, now, they are no longer appealing. When I originally came here, I was so pleased to find such a large supply of souls to feed upon. But I grow weary of such mortal fare! <br><br>\tYou want something, yes? I can smell the desire for something on your soul.  Desire used to be such a lovely dessert for me but now it is bland and droll. <br><br>\tMy tears, eh? Ha! Such an odd request. But you have my interest piqued. <br><br>\tI’ll tell you what; I won’t eat you if you agree do something for me.  <br><br>\tIn the northwest, walking the lava shores, is a creature that has vexed me for centuries. An old foe, the Lifestealer eats the hearts of its victims, consuming their essence in a similar fashion to how I consume their souls.   Many times have I lost a victim to these inane creatures, and many times have I attempted to exact my vengeance. Unfortunately, due to my corpulent nature, I am not as fast as they are and have failed in my desire to consume one of them.  Wouldn’t it be poetic? A Soulbinder consuming a Lifestealer! <br><br>\tGo to the lava shores, mortal, and fill this jar with the souls of ten Lifestealers.  The jar is filled with my saliva, which draws out the souls of my meals.  Open the jar when you are near a Lifestealer’s corpse and the soul will be drained from its body and enter the jar.  <br><br>\tFill the jar and return to me. If you bring me this meal, I will give you that which you seek.",
    "PTB": "Ah, o que temos aqui? <br><br> Bah! Eu esperava que você fosse algo além de um humano, gargoyle ou elfo. Sabe quantos deles já comi? Suas almas me saciaram, mas agora não são mais atraentes. Quando cheguei aqui, fiquei tão satisfeito por encontrar uma grande quantidade de almas para me alimentar. Mas estou cansado de tal alimento mortal! <br><br> Você quer algo, não é? Posso sentir o desejo de algo em sua alma. Desejo costumava ser uma sobremesa deliciosa para mim, mas agora está insípido e sem graça. <br><br> Minhas lágrimas, hein? Ha! Que pedido estranho. Mas você despertou meu interesse. <br><br> Vou lhe dizer uma coisa: não vou comê-lo se concordar em fazer algo por mim. <br><br> No noroeste, caminhando pelas margens de lava, há uma criatura que me atormenta há séculos. Um velho inimigo, o Roubavida come os corações de suas vítimas, consumindo sua essência de maneira semelhante a como consumo suas almas. Muitas vezes perdi uma vítima para essas criaturas insanas, e muitas vezes tentei vingar-me. Infelizmente, devido à minha natureza corpulenta, não sou tão rápido quanto elas e falhei no meu desejo de consumir uma. Não seria poético? Um Ligador de Almas consumindo um Roubavida! <br><br> Vá até as margens de lava, mortal, e encha este frasco com as almas de dez Roubavidas. O frasco está cheio da minha saliva, que extrai as almas das minhas refeições. Abra o frasco quando estiver perto do cadáver de um Roubavida e a alma será drenada de seu corpo e entrará no frasco. <br><br> Encha o frasco e retorne a mim. Se me trouxer essa refeição, darei o que procura."
  },
  "1151155": {
    "ENU": "Feed Me!",
    "PTB": "Me Alimente!"
  },
  "1151156": {
    "ENU": "You dare refuse me? You are truly an imbecile. Ah well, I guess I shall eat you, after all! Just as soon as I finish digesting my last meal, that is.",
    "PTB": "Você ousa me recusar? Você é verdadeiramente um imbecil. Ah, bem, acho que vou comê-lo, afinal! Assim que terminar de digerir minha última refeição."
  },
  "1151157": {
    "ENU": "The jar is still empty, fool.  Go get my souls!",
    "PTB": "O frasco ainda está vazio, tolo. Vá buscar minhas almas!"
  },
  "1151158": {
    "ENU": "I can smell the souls, mortal. Give the jar to me! <br><br>\tYou are lucky you were successful; I was just getting hungry again. If you had returned empty-handed I would have made you my meal, instead. But you have done me a favor so I shall not eat you…this time. <br><br>\tThe smell of these souls, so exotic and sweet, makes my stomach grumble.  I must eat them now! <br><br>\tOh, my, delicious! I can taste the suffering they endured during their death throes! I can taste the echoing cries of the victims whose hearts they cut out and devoured. This is overwhelmingly delicious! <br><br>\tIt brings tears to my eyes. Tears of joy, for this is the best meal I have had in centuries!  My tears is what you sought, aye? Then take some, for I offer them happily. Here, I will put them in the jar you used to collect the souls. <br><br>\tNow, be gone, for I grow tired and wish to bask in the afterglow of this wonderful meal. ",
    "PTB": "Posso sentir as almas, mortal. Me entregue o frasco! <br><br> Você teve sorte de ser bem-sucedido; eu estava ficando com fome novamente. Se tivesse voltado de mãos vazias, eu o teria feito minha refeição. Mas você me fez um favor, então não vou comê-lo... desta vez. <br><br> O cheiro dessas almas, tão exótico e doce, faz meu estômago roncar. Preciso comê-las agora! <br><br> Oh, meu Deus, delicioso! Posso sentir o sofrimento que suportaram em seus momentos finais! Posso sentir os gritos ecoantes das vítimas cujos corações cortaram e devoraram. Isso é imensamente delicioso! <br><br> Traz lágrimas aos meus olhos. Lágrimas de alegria, pois esta é a melhor refeição que tive em séculos! Minhas lágrimas são o que você procurava, não é? Então pegue, pois as ofereço de bom grado. Aqui, vou colocá-las no frasco que usou para coletar as almas. <br><br> Agora, vá embora, pois estou cansado e quero me deliciar no rescaldo desta maravilhosa refeição."
  },
  "1151159": {
    "ENU": "Color Guard",
    "PTB": "Guarda de Cor"
  },
  "1151160": {
    "ENU": "As you approach the pedestal, you notice the shimmering barrier protecting the beautiful lotus within.  As the Gargoyle Queen warned, this barrier covers the area surrounding the pedestal, preventing access to its treasure.  <br><br>Reaching out, you test the barrier with your weapon. The weapon does not penetrate but rather acts as if it is being pushed against a brick wall. You notice, however, that making contact with the barrier causes the colored tiles around you to come to life, their brilliant colors flashing in what seems to be a sequence. <br><br>You observe the tiles as they beautifully light up, one after the other. There seems to be a pattern to their flashing; perhaps repeating the pattern is the key to lowering the barrier? <br><br>Putting your weapon away, you watch the tiles with further detail but, after one series of flashes, they go dark.  Stepping upon the nearest tile, you see that it lights up once more upon contact. It seems that the tiles respond to touch; the pattern and the key to the barrier begins to be clear. <br><br>Shall you commence another sequence and attempt to drop the barrier?",
    "PTB": "Ao se aproximar do pedestal, você nota a barreira cintilante protegendo o belo lótus em seu interior. Como a Rainha Gargoyle alertou, essa barreira cobre a área ao redor do pedestal, impedindo o acesso ao seu tesouro. <br><br>Estendendo a mão, você testa a barreira com sua arma. A arma não penetra, mas age como se estivesse sendo pressionada contra uma parede de tijolos. Você nota, no entanto, que fazer contato com a barreira faz com que os azulejos coloridos ao seu redor ganhem vida, suas cores brilhantes piscando em uma sequência. <br><br>Você observa os azulejos enquanto eles se iluminam, um após o outro. Parece haver um padrão em seus flashes; talvez repetir o padrão seja a chave para baixar a barreira? <br><br>Guardando sua arma, você observa os azulejos com mais detalhes, mas após uma série de flashes, eles escurecem. Pisando no azulejo mais próximo, você vê que ele se ilumina novamente ao ser tocado. Parece que os azulejos respondem ao toque; o padrão e a chave para a barreira começam a ficar claros. <br><br>Iniciará outra sequência e tentará baixar a barreira?"
  },
  "1151161": {
    "ENU": "You step away from the pedestal, and the barrier shines brightly, as if mocking and daring you to accept its challenge.",
    "PTB": "Você se afasta do pedestal, e a barreira brilha intensamente, como se zombasse e desafiasse você a aceitar seu desafio."
  },
  "1151162": {
    "ENU": "As you step on the tile, the barrier around the pedestal pulses brightly for a moment and all of the tiles around you go dark. It appears that you failed to appropriately match the displayed sequence. Perhaps you should try again?",
    "PTB": "Ao pisar no azulejo, a barreira ao redor do pedestal pulsa brilhantemente por um momento e todos os azulejos ao seu redor escurecem. Parece que você não correspondeu adequadamente à sequência exibida. Talvez deva tentar novamente?"
  },
  "1151163": {
    "ENU": "As you step upon the final tile, all of the colored tiles shine brightly and a pulse of light from the pedestal temporarily blinds you. As you lower your arm from your eyes, you see that the barrier surrounding the lotus is deteriorating.  The sparkling light fades, leaving the Lotus unprotected. <br><br>\tReaching down, you delicately lift the fragile flower and admire its beauty. The petals are transparent, with a faint bluish hue and the petals voluminous and soft to the touch. Upon first glance, the lotus does indeed look as if it were carved from crystal.  The heady, intoxicating scent that rises from its petals, proves that it is, indeed, not a sculpture. It is truly sad that this is the last of its kind; a field of these must have been a glorious sight. <br><br>\tGently wrapping the lotus in some cloth, you place it in your backpack and prepare to return to the Gargoyle Queen with your prize.",
    "PTB": "Ao pisar no azulejo final, todos os azulejos coloridos brilham intensamente e um pulso de luz do pedestal o cega temporariamente. Ao baixar o braço de seus olhos, você vê que a barreira ao redor do lótus está se deteriorando. A luz cintilante se dissipa, deixando o Lótus desprotegido. <br><br> Alcançando para baixo, você levanta delicadamente a frágil flor e admira sua beleza. As pétalas são transparentes, com um leve tom azulado e volumosas e macias ao toque. À primeira vista, o lótus parece ter sido esculpido em cristal. O aroma intenso e embriagador que sobe de suas pétalas prova que não é uma escultura. É realmente triste que este seja o último de sua espécie; um campo destes deve ter sido uma visão gloriosa. <br><br> Envolvendo gentilmente o lótus em um pano, você o coloca em sua mochila e se prepara para retornar à Rainha Gargoyle com seu prêmio."
  },
  "1151164": {
    "ENU": "Chronicle of the Gargoyle Queen Vol. II",
    "PTB": "Crônica da Rainha Gargoyle Vol. II"
  },
  "1151165": {
    "ENU": "Chronicle of the Gargoyle Queen Vol. III",
    "PTB": "Crônica da Rainha Gargoyle Vol. III"
  },
